<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">LUK-POGORO</book>
  <para style="h">LUKA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Shisoweru Shiwagira shakalembiti Luka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="mt2">SHISOWERU SHIWAGIRA SHAKALEMBITI</para>
  <para style="mt1">LUKA</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOLERU</para>
  <para style="ip">Shisoweru Shiwagira shakalembiti Luka ndo shintola shimu wamu pa vintora vyamsheshi vya Lipatanu lya Syayi vyaviyowelera makaliru ga Yesu Kristu. Kila shimu shishemwa “Injili, mana yakuwi Shisoweru Shiwagira.” Avi ndo vintora vyavilembitwi Pakuhowa kwa Yesu, vintora vyeni ndo Matayu na Mariku na Luka na Yohani. Luka kalembiti ndiri matakuliru kuusu makaliru ga Yesu hera, kumbiti viraa kalembiti kuusu vitwatira vyeni wantumintumi wa Yesu wavitenditi pakuhowa na kuzyuka kwa Yesu. Vitwatira avi vyavitenditwi viwera mushintola sha Matendu ga wantumintumi. Kwahera yakayimana tarehi teratera ya Shisoweru Shiwagira ntambu yakashilembiti Luka, ama pahala pashilembitwi. Wabetula wamonga wajimilirana kuwera Shisoweru Shiwagira ashi shilembitwi mushinja sha malongu saba Pakwiyuka Yesu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mlemba gwa Shisoweru Shiwagira ashi ndo Luka, mweni kaweriti bwana mganga. Umana wa ulemba wakuwi na ntambu ya matakuliru gakuwi galanguziya kuwera kaweriti muntu mbetula. Luka kafiriti kulemba matakuliru ganakaka kuusu makaliru ga Yesu kwa kutakulira vitwatira ntambu yavilawiriti su wamonga wapati utanga pawagabetula (Luka 1:1-3). Luka kaweriti ndiri Muyawudi (Wakolosayi 4:10-14), na kalembiti kwantambu walii yawawera Wayawudi ndiri mewavimani. Shitwatira ashi shilanguziya paweru pakavitakulira vitiba vya Shiyawudi (Luka 1:8).</para>
  <para style="ip">Shisoweru Shiwagira shakashilembiti Luka ndo shintola shashilifana na vintora vya Matayu na Mariku, kwantambu ilii vintora avi vitakulira vitwatira viraa vilii muntambu yayilifana. Pa vintora vitatu, Luka ndo yakatakulira nakamu visoweru vya kwiyuka kwa Yohani Mbatiza. Luka katakulira kwa kugolokera kuusu ulekiziwu (Shipandi sha 3:3, 11:4, 17:3-4, 23:34, 24:47) na viraa maluwa (Shipandi sha 3:21, 5:16, 6:12, 11:1-12, 22:32).</para>
  <para style="iot">Yagaweramu</para>
  <para style="io">Luka kankulaviya ULONGOLERU wa Shisoweru Shiwagira shakuwi na kutakulira toziya ya kushilemba, shipandi sha 1:1-4.</para>
  <para style="io">Shakapanu kankuvitakulira visoweru vya kuyiwuka kwa Yesu na ntambu yakatandiritwi kuusu utenderu, Shipandi sha 1:5-4:13.</para>
  <para style="io">Musemu nkulu yayisigariti mu Shisoweru Shiwagira, Shipandi sha 4:14 mpaka shipandi sha 21:38, Luka kankutakulira mahengu Yesu gakatenditi, shikulu nentu ndo mauzauza gakatenditi na vitwatira vyakafunditi.</para>
  <para style="io">Muvipandi viwili vya upeleru, Shipandi sha 22 mpaka shipandi sha 24, Luka kankutakulira kuusu Yesu ntambu yakahowiti na ntambu yakasilitwi na ntambu yakazyukiti.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Mtuwa Teufili.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:1">Wantu wavua wajeriti kulemba vitwatira vyavitendikiti pakati pa twenga. <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />Walembiti ntambu yawatugambiriti vilii vyawaviwoniti kwa masu gawu kwanjira pavyanjiti, na walii yawabweriti Shisoweru Shiwagira. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Su mkulu Teufili, toziya nuvigendiriti weri vitwatira vyoseri avi kwanjira pavyanjiti, mona ifaa na neni nukulemberi weri ntambu yayirawiriti. <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />Ntenda hangu, su na gwenga gupati kuvimana nakaka toziya ya vitwatira avi vyanukufunditi.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwiwuka kwa Yohani Mbatiza kwankubwerwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Shaka sha Herodi mfalumi gwa Yudeya, kuweriti na mkulu gwa numba ya Mlungu litawu lyakuwi wamshema Zakariya, yakaweriti gwa shipinga sha watambika sha Abiya. Mdala gwakuwi litawu lyakuwi wamshema Elizabeti nayomberi kaweriti gwa shiyiwuku sha mtambika Aruni. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Na woseri wawili waweriti wantu wa matendu gaherepa kulongolu kwa Mlungu, walikala pawagajimira malagaliru goseri ga Mtuwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Kumbiti weriti wahera nonu, toziya Elizabeti kaweriti mpendi, vinu woseri wawili waweriti wagogolu.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Lishaka limu Zakariya kaweriti kankutenda lihengu lyakuwi lya utambika Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu, toziya shiweriti shaka shakuwi sha kutambika. <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />Kulawirana na vitiba vya watambika, Zakariya kasyagulitwi kwa kugalambuziya simbi kwingira Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu su katumiziyi ubani. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Shaka Zakariya pakaweriti kankutumiziya ubani, lipinga lya wantu waweriti walivaga pamuhera kunja wankumluwa Mlungu.<verse eid="LUK 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Ntumintumi gwa kumpindi gwa Mtuwa kamlawiriti Zakariya, kagolokiti uwega wa kumliwu pashitalawanda sha kutambikira ubani. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Zakariya pakamwoniti, kalilimuka, kaweriti na lyoga. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Kumbiti ntumintumi gwa kumpindi kamgambiriti, “Nagutira Zakariya! Mlungu kapikanira kala kuluwa kwaku. Mdala gwaku Elizabeti hakakuleleri mwana mpalu. Na mwana ayu litawu lyakuwi gumshemi Yohani. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Yomberi hakaweri nemeru na nemeleru kwaku, wantu wavuwa hawaweri na nemeleru kwa kwiwuka kwakuwi. <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />Yomberi hakaweri mkulu pamasu pa Mtuwa, hakalandi ndiri divayi ama ujimbi, yomberi hakamemi Rohu Mnanagala kwanjira mumtima mwa mawu gwakuwi. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Hakawatendi wantu wavuwa wa Israeli wamuwuyiri Mtuwa Mlungu gwawu. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Yomberi hakamlongoleri Mtuwa, hakaweri na makakala pamuhera na uwezu ntambu yakaweriti Eliya mbuyi gwa Mlungu. Hakawajegi kayi pamuhera wana na watati, hakawawuziyi wantu yawamjimira ndiri Mlungu kuwera na maholu ga wantu yawamfiriziya Mlungu na kumtandira Mtuwa wantu yawasyagulitwi.”<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Zakariya kamkosiya ntumintumi gwa kumpindi, “Hanuvimani hashi shisoweru ashi? Toziya neni pamuhera na mdala gwangu twawagogolu.”<verse eid="LUK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Ntumintumi gwa kumpindi kamwankula, “Neni Gaburieli yangoloka kulongolu kwa Mlungu, ndo kantuma ntakuli na gwenga na kukugambira shisoweru ashi shiwagira. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Vinu guloli! Toziya gujimira ndiri shisoweru shangu, ashi hashitendeki kwa shaka shakuwi, vinu haguweri bebi, haguwezi ndiri kutakula mpaka lishaka lilii pashilawira shisoweru ashi.”<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Lipinga lya wantu liweriti lyankumuhepera Zakariya na walikangasha kwa kukawa kwakuwi mulii Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Pakalawiti kasinditi kutakula nawomberi, nayomberi kendereyiti kuwalanguziya kwa mawoku hera, nawomberi wavimaniti kuwera kawoniti shintu Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu.<verse eid="LUK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Pashiperiti kala shaka shakuwi sha kutenda lihengu Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu, kagenditi ukaya kwakuwi. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Pa mashaka galii mdala gwakuwi Elizabeti kawera na yinda, kalikaliti mnumba kwa myezi muhanu, <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />kalitakuliti, “Vinu Mtuwa kamonera lusungu kwa kumusilira soni zyangu kulongolu kwa wantu.”<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwiwukwa kwa Yesu kwankubwerwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Yinda ya Elizabeti pasokiti myezi sita, Mlungu kamtumiti Gaburieli ntumintumi gwa kumpindi kagendi mpaka Galilaya, lushi lwa Nazareti. <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />Kaweriti na shisoweru kwa muhinga luyenja yakahetitwi na muntu yawamshema Yosefu, gwa shiyiwuku sha Dawudi, litawu lyakuwi ayu luyenja ndo Mariya. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Ntumintumi gwa kumpindi kamwiziriti Mariya na kumulamusiya, “Gwakashina? Ponga iweri pamuhera na gwenga! Mtuwa kapamuhera na gwenga, kakupanana upendelewu.”<verse eid="LUK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Mariya kalisheliti nentu, toziya ya shisoweru sha ntumintumi gwa kumpindi, kaliholiti mumoyu pakalikosiya, “Kulamusiya aku kwana mana gaa?” <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Ntumintumi gwa kumpindi kamgambiriti Mariya, “Nagutira Mariya, Mlungu kakupapanana manemu. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Guloli, haguweri na yinda na kwiwula mwana mpalu na litawu lyakuwi hagumshemi Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Ayu hakaweri mkulu, hawamshemi mwana gwa Mlungu na Mtuwa Mlungu hakampanani shibanta sha ufalumi sha Dawudi mbuyi gwakuwi. <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />Hakakolimlima lukolu lwa Yakobu mashaka goseri na ufalumi wakuwi hapeni uweri na upeleru.”<verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Mariya kamgambiriti ntumintumi gwa kumpindi, “Neni haneliwoni na mpalu! Hashiweri ashi shisoweru ashi?”<verse eid="LUK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Ntumintumi gwa kumpindi kamuwankula, “Rohu Mnanagala hakizi kwaku na makakala ga Mlungu hagakwizili. Toziya ayi mwana hakiwukili hakaweri mnanagala, hakashemwi Mwana gwa Mlungu. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Gumuholi mlongu gwaku Elizabeti, yomberi yawamshemiti mpendi kumbiti hakaleri mwana mpalu muugogolu wakuwi na mwezi agu ndo mwezi gwa sita kwa yinda yakuwi. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Toziya kwahera shintu shashikamala kwa Mlungu.”<verse eid="LUK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Mariya katakula, “Neni na ntumintumi gwa Mtuwa! Iweri kwa neni ntambu ya gulongiti.” Ntumintumi gwa kumpindi kawukiti na kugenda zakuwi.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mariya kankumtyangira Elizabeti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Mashaka galii Mariya kawukiti kagenditi mpaka isi ya mulugongu lwa Yudeya. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Aku kingiriti mnumba mwa Zakariya na kamlamsiyiti Elizabeti. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Elizabeti pakapikaniriti ntambu Mariya yakamlamsiyiti, nonu kadunkula mumtima mwakuwi. Elizabeti kamemiti Rohu Mnanagala, <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />Elizabeti kalonga, “Gutekelerwa gwenga pakati pa wadala woseri na katekelerwi mwana hakiwukili mumtima mwaku. <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Neni na gaa ata mawu gwa Mtuwa gwangu kanizili neni? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Nakugambira, palaa pampikaniriti ntambu yagunamusiyiti, nonu kadunkula kwa kunemelera mumtima mwangu. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Mbaka gwenga toziya gujimira kuwera havitendeki vitwatira vyakakugambiriti Mtuwa.”<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lwimbu lwa Mariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Mariya kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:46">“Moyu gwangu gumkwisa Mtuwa,<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />Na rohu yangu yankunemelera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:47">Toziya Mlungu ndo Mlopoziya gwangu.<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />Toziya kamonera lusungu neni ntumintumi gwakuwi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:48">Kwanjira vinu wantu woseri hawalongi Mlungu kantekelera,<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />Toziya ya shintu shikulu shakantendera Mlungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:49">Litawu lyakuwi linanagala.<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Kawalanguziya lusungu lwakuwi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:50">Kwa walii yawampanana ligoya kwa shiyiwuku na shiyiwuku.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Katenda vitwatira vikulu kwa liwoku lyakuwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:51">Kawapalasiya yawawera na msindu pamuhera na mipangu ya myoyu yawu.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />Kawasulusiya yawawera na likakala mu ukolamlima wawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:52">Na kawakweniziya wananagala.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Yawawera na njala kawayikutiziya vintu viherepa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:53">Na walunda kawawusiya mawoku hera.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Katenda shakatakuliti kwa wambuyi wetu wagona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:54">Kiza kumtanga Israeli ntumintumi gwakuwi.<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />Ntambu vyakawagambiriti wambuyi wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:55">Aburahamu na wiwuka wakuwi mashaka goseri!”<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Mariya kalikaliti pamuhera na Elizabeti kwa shaka sha myezi mitatu, shakapanu kawuyiti ukaya kwakuwi.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwiwuka kwa Yohani Mbatiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Shaka sha Elizabeti kwiwura shisokiti, kiwuliti mwana mpalu. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Wantu wapakwegera wakuwi na walongu wakuwi pawapikaniriti visoweru viherepa vya kulikangasha Mtuwa vyakavitenditi kwa Elizabeti, womberi wanemeleriti pamuhera na yomberi.<verse eid="LUK 1:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Palipititi lijuwa limu, womberi wiziti kumwingiziya jandu mwana, wafira kumpanana litawu lya tati gwakuwi, Zakariya. <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Kumbiti mawu gwakuwi kalonga, “Hangu ndiri! Litawu lyakuwi hawamshemi Yohani.”<verse eid="LUK 1:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Wamgambira, “Kwehera muntu muwalongu waku yawamshema litawu ali!” <verse eid="LUK 1:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Wamlanguziyiti langaliru tati gwakuwi, wavimana ntambu hakamshemi.<verse eid="LUK 1:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Zakariya kaluwiti shibawu na kalemba hangu, “Litawu lyakuwi ndo Yohani.” Kila muntu kalikangasha. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Pala palii Zakariya kanjiti kayi kutakula, kanjiti kumkwisa Mlungu. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Lyoga liwayingiriti woseri yawalikaliti pakwegera nayomberi na visoweru avi vyoseri vyeniyiti muisi yoseri ya mulugongu mwa Yudeya. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Woseri yawapikaniriti vitwatira avi, waliholiti mumyoyu mwawu pawalonga, “Mwana ayu hakaweri gwa ntambu gaa?.” Toziya nakaka makakala ga Mtuwa hagaweri pamuhera nayomberi.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lwimbu lwa umbuyi lwa Zakariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Zakariya, tati gwa Yohani kamemiziwiti Rohu Mnanagala, katungiti shisoweru shiwagira sha Mlungu.<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />Tumkwisi Mtuwa, Mlungu gwa Israeli!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:68">Kiza kuwatanga wantu wakuwi na kuwakombola.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Katupanana mlopoziya mkulu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:69">Mushiyiwuku sha Dawudi ntumintumi gwakuwi.<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />Gambira ntambu yakawagambiriti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:70">wambuyi wa Mlungu wananagala kwanjira kwanja.<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />Hakatulopoziyi kulawa mumawoku mwa wangondu wetu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:71">na kutulaviya kulawa mumakakala mwa woseri yawatufira ndiri.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Kalongiti hakawawoneri lusungu wambuyi wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:72">na kulihola lipatanu lyakuwi linanagala.<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />Kulirapa kwakamlapiriti Aburahamu mbuyi gwetu,<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />kuwera hakatutangi twenga tulopoziwi kulawa kwa wangondu wetu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:74">Katugambira tumtenderi Mlungu pota na lyoga, <verse eid="LUK 1:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />tuweri wananagala yatumfiriziya Mlungu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:75">mashaka goseri ga makaliru getu.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />“Na gwenga mwana gwangu, hawakushemi mbuyi gwa Mlungu kakumpindi nentu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:76">Toziya hagumlongoleri Mtuwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:76">kumnyawila njira yakuwi, <verse eid="LUK 1:76" /><verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />haguwagambiri wantu wakuwi kuwera hawalopoziwi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:77">kwa kuwawusilira vidoda vyawu.<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Mlungu gwetu mnanagala na yakawera na lusungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:78">Hakatulavilili ulangala wa ulopoziya kulawa kumpindi,<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />na kawalangalira woseri yawalikala muluwindu lwa kuhowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:79">na kuwalonguziya magulu getu munjira ya ponga.”<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Mwana kendereyiti kukula nshimba na kuwera na makakala murohu. Kalikaliti kushiwala mpaka lishaka lya kuliranguziya mweni kwa wantu wa Israeli.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s">Kwiwuka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Matayu 1:18-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Majuwa galii, Kayisari Agustinu mfalumi gwa Rumi kabweriti kulagalira, wantu woseri wa Iushi loseri la Rumi wawalangwi. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Kuwawalanga aku ndo kuweriti kwa kwanja shaka Kureniu pakaweriti mkulu gwa mukowa gwa Siriya. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Su kila muntu kagenditi kulembwa litawu lyakuwi muisi mwakuwi.<verse eid="LUK 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Viraa Yosefu kaweriti na mwanja gwa kulawa Nazareti mumkowa gwa Galilaya, kagenditi muisi ya Betirehemu mumkowa gwa Yudeya pakayiwukiti Dawudi. Yosefu kagenditi kulii toziya kalawiti mushiyuwuku sha Dawudi. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Kagenditi kulii wakalembwi pamuhera na Mariya muheta gwakuwi, yakaweriti na yinda. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Pawaweriti kulii Betirehemu, shaka sha Mariya sha kwiwura mwana shisokiti. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Kamwiwula mwana gwakuwi gwa kwanja mpalu, kamgubikila nguwu na wamgonjeka muliboma lya wang'ombi, toziya womberi wapatiti ndiri pakugonja kunumba ya wahenga.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walolera wa mifugu na wantumintumi wa kumpindi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Kuweriti na walolera wa mifugu, yawaweriti kuntundu pashiru wankulolera mifugu yawu.<figure style="fig" file="02 Shepherds.jpg" size="col" ref="2:8">Walolera wa nkanyama wankulolera wakondolu wawu.</figure> <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Ntumintumi gwa kumpindi gwa Mtuwa kawalawariti walolera wa mifugu na ukwisa wa Mtuwa guwalangaziya. Womberi watiliti nentu, <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />kumbiti ntumintumi gwa kumpindi kawagambira, “Namtira! Neni nuwajegerani shisoweru shiwagira, shisoweru ashi hashiwajegeli wantu woseri wanemeleri nentu. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Leru muisi ya Mfalumi Dawudi kiwuka Mlopoziya gwenu. Mweni ayu ndo Kristu Mtuwa! <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Ayi haliweri lilangaliru kwa mwenga, pamusoka kala palii hamumwoni nonu wamgubikira vinguwu vya shiwana wamgonjeka muliboma la wang'ombi.”<verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Palaa palii wantumintumi wamonga wa kumpindi wavuwa nentu, waliwoniti pamuhera wamkwisiti Mlungu, pawalonga,<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />“Ukwisa uweri kwa Mlungu kumpindi nentu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:14">na ponga iweri pasipanu kwa wantu yawamfira Mlungu!”<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Wantumintumi wa kumpindi pawawukiti kala kuwuya kumpindi kwa Mlungu, walolera wa mifugu wanja kuligambira weni, “Vinu su tugendeni Betirehemu na kulola shintu shashitendikiti, shakatugambiriti Mtuwa.”<verse eid="LUK 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Su wawuka wagenda kanongola, pawasokiti palii wawawona Mariya na Yosefu na nonu ulii wamgonjeka muliboma la wang'ombi. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Walolera wa mifugu pawamwoniti kala nonu ulii, su wanja kutakula ntambu yawapikaniriti kulawa kwa ntumintumi gwa kumpindi kuusu nonu ayu. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Muntu yoseri yakapikaniriti hangu kashyeniti visoweru vyawatakuliti walolera wa mifugu. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Mariya kavituliti vintu vyoseri avi mumoyu mwakuwi na kavihola mana yakuwi.<verse eid="LUK 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Walolera wa mifugu wawuyiti pawayimba kwa kumkwisa Mlungu ntambu yawapikaniriti na yawawoniti, iwera ntambu iraa ilii yawapikaniriti kulawa kwa ntumintumi gwa kumpindi.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wankumupanana litawu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Palisokiti lishaka lya nani, shaka sha kumwingiziya mwana jandu, wampananiti litawu Yesu, litawu lyeni ali ntumintumi gwa kumpindi kamupananiti kala Mariya pakaweriti ndiri na yinda.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wamtula Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Pashisokiti shaka sha msambu gwa kupungwa kwawu Mariya na Yosefu hangu ndo ifiriwitwi mumalagaliru ga Musa, wamtola mwana wagenda nayu Yerusalemu wamtulili Mtuwa, <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />ntambu yayilembitwi mumalagaliru ga Mtuwa, “Kila mwana gwa kwanja mpalu kafiruwa kutulwa kaweri mnanagala kwa Mtuwa.” <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Viraa virii wagenditi su walaviyi tambiku ya wankunda wawili ama wana wawili wa teteli, ntambu yayifiruwitwi mulilagaliru lya Mtuwa.<verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Shaka shiraa shilii kuweriti na muntu yumu yawamshema Simiyoni yakalikaliti Yerusalemu. Kaweriti muntu kaherepa, muntu yakamfiriziya Mlungu na kaweriti kankulolera kulopoziwa kwa wantu wa Israeli. Rohu Mnanagala kaweriti pamuhera na yomberi, <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />na Rohu Mnanagala kamgambiriti kala Simiyoni kulonga hapeni kahowi mpaka kamwoni Kristu yakasyagulitwi na Mtuwa.<verse eid="LUK 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Su Rohu Mnangala kamlonguziyiti Simiyoni kwingira Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu. Na palii mawu na tati gwa Yesu wamjegiti Yesu Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu wamtenderi ntambu yayifiruwitwi mulilagaliru, <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Simiyoni kamwanka mwana mumawoku mwakuwi na kamkwisa Mlungu pakalonga,<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />“Vinu Mtuwa guweza kumlekeziya ntumintumi gwaku</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:29">kagendi kwa ponga, toziya gugatimiza galii gagulagaliti.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Masu gangu gawona ulopoziya waku,<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />wawutandiritwi palongolu pa wantu woseri.<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />Ulangala hawuwalangaziyi njira wantu yawawera ndiri Wayawudi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:32">na hawujegi ukwisa kwa wantu waku Israeli.”<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Tati na mawu gwa mwana walikangashiti nentu ntambu yakatakuliti Simiyoni kuusu mwana gwawu. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Simiyoni kawatekelera, kamgambira Mariya mawu gwa Yesu, “Mwana ayu kasyagulitwi na Mlungu toziya ya kwagamira na kulopoziwa kwa wantu wavuwa Muisraeli. Nayomberi hakaweri lilangaliru kulawa kwa Mlungu kumbiti wantu wavuwa hawamtakuli vidoda, <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />na virii vyawalihola wantu mumyoyu mwawu ndo havimaniki. Na gwenga Mariya utama hawuweri gambira mgoha gwagusongoka, haguwusomi moyu gwaku.”<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Palii kuweriti na mdala mbuyi gwa Mlungu, litawu lyakuwi Ana, mwana gwa Fanueli gwa likabila la Asheri. <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />Shakapanu kasigaliti mkenja mpaka shaka pakaweriti mgogolu gwa vinja malongu matatu na msheshi. Shaka shoseri ashi kalikaliti Munumba nkulu ya Mlungu pakoya kuliya na pakamluwa Mlungu pashiru na paliwala. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Shaka shila shilii, Ana kiziti na kulonga mayagashii Mlungu na katakuliti visoweru vya mwana kwa wantu woseri yawaweriti wankumuhepera Mlungu kwa kukombolwa kwa Yerusalemu.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwuya Nazareti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Mariya na Yosefu pawatenditi kala vyoseri ntambu yanfiruwitwi mulilagaliru lya Mtuwa, su wawuyiti ukaya kwawu Nazareti muisi ya Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Mwana kakula kawera na makakala, su kawera na luhala na Mlungu kamtekelera.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mntemba Yesu kamnumba nkulu ya Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Kila mvinja mawu na tati gwa Yesu wagendaga Yerusalemu mumsambu gwa Pasaka. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Yesu pakaweriti na vinja lilongu na miwili, wagenditi nayu mumsambu ntambu yayiweriti shitiba. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Paguperiti kala msambu gwa Pasaka, wanjiti mwanja gwa kuwuya ukaya, kumbiti Yesu kasigaliti kulaa Kuyerusalemu pota mawu na tati gwakuwi kuvimana. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Womberi wavimana Yesu kapamuhera na wantu wa mwanja, wagendagenda lishaka lyoseri, shakapanu wanja kumsakula mwa walongu na waganja wawu. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Wamwona ndiri, su wawuyiti Yerusalemu pawamsakula.<verse eid="LUK 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Lishaka lya tatu wamwoniti Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu, kalikaliti pamuhera na wafunda wa Wayawudi, kaweriti pakawapikinira na kuwakosiya. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Woseri pawampikaniriti vyakatakula, waweriti wankulikangasha ntambu yakeniti mahala na ntambu yakankuliti kwa luhala. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Mawu na tati gwakuwi pawamwoniti washeniti. Mariya, mawu gwakuwi, kamkosiya, “Mwana gwenga, ashi gututenda ntambu ayi? Neni na tati gwaku tuweriti twankulishera patukusakula.”<verse eid="LUK 2:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Yesu kawankula, “Ntambu gaa mwankunsakula? Muvimana ndiri handa nfiruwa nulikali mnumba mwa Tati gwangu?” <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Kumbiti tati na mawu gwakuwi wavimana ndiri vyakawankuliti.<verse eid="LUK 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Yesu pakawuyiti pamuhera na mawu na tati gwakuwi Kunazareti, kendereyiti kuwajimira. Mawu gwakuwi kendeleyiti kulihola mmoyu mwakuwi. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Yesu kendereyiti kukula munshimba pamuhera na luhala na kumfiliziya Mlungu pamuhera na wantu.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s">Yohani Mbatiza ntambu yakabweriti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matayu 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mariku 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yohani 1:19-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Mushinja sha lilongu na muhanu wa ukolamlima wa Kayisari Tiberiwu, Pontiwu Pilatu kaweriti mkolamlima gwa Yudeya, Herodi kaweriti mkolamlima gwa mkowa gwa Galilaya na Filipi mlongu gwakuwi kaweriti mkolamlima gwa mikowa ya Itureya na Trakuniti. Lusaniya kaweriti mkolamlima gwa Abileni, <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />na Anasi na Kayafa waweriti watambika wakulu, shaka ashi shisoweru sha Mlungu shimwizira Yohani mwana gwa Zakariya kushiwala kulii. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Su Yohani kagenda pahala poseri papaweriti na lushemba Yoridani kaweriti kankubwera pakalonga, “Mleki vidoda vyamtenditi na mkabatizwi, su Mlungu hakawalekiziyi vidoda vyamtenditi.” <verse eid="LUK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Ayi ndo yawalembiti mushintola sha mbuyi gwa Mlungu Isaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">“Liziwu lya muntu lipikanliika kushiwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">‘Mumtenderi kala Mtuwa njira yakuwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">mumnyawili weri njira zyakuwi!’”<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />“ ‘Kila shibokela hawashifintili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">Kila lugongu na shigongu hashipalaswi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">Paweriti padusunka hapanyolosiwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">Zinjira za vuluvulu hazinyawi.<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Wantu woseri hawawuwoni ulopoziwu wa Mlungu!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Lipinga lya wantu liziti kwa Yohani su wabatizwi. Yomberi kawagambira, “Mwenga mwashiyiwuku sha wanjoka, kakugambirani gaa mtugi maya ga Mlungu gagiza? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Mulanguziyi nakaka ntambu yamutenda handa mleka vidoda vyamtenditi. Namwanja kulonga, ‘Twenga Aburahamu ndo mbuyi gwetu!’ Nukugambirani nakaka, Mlungu tembera katendi ata mabuwi aga gaweri wana wa Aburahamu! <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Su vinu liwagu litulwa kala kudumula mishigira ya mitera, na kila mtera gwagulera ndiri mabwajubwaju gaherepa, hagudumulwi na kugwasila mumotu.”<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Wantu wamkosiyiti Yohani Mbatiza, “Su twenga tutendi hashi?” <verse eid="LUK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Yomberi kawankula, “Yakana nguwu mbili kamupi kahera nguwu na yakana shiboga na yomberi katendi ntambu iraayi.”<verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Watola kodi wiziti wabatizwi, wamkosiya, “Mfunda na twenga tutendi hashi?”<verse eid="LUK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Kawagambira, “Namtola kodi nentu ya shiyasi shawatuliti.”<verse eid="LUK 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Na wamanjagila wamkosiya, “Na twenga tutendi ashi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:14">Su yomberi kawankula, “Mwenga mleki kuwapoka wantu vintu vyawu, ama kuwasitaka wantu pamuwapayira hera. Mjimili shibenamgongu shampata.”<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Wantu woseri waweriti wankulolera kwiza kwa Mlopoziya, waweriti wankulikosiya mumyoyu mwawu Yohani, ndo Kristu? <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Paliya Yohani kuwagambira woseri, “Neni nankubatiza kwa mashi, kumbiti kwana muntu kiza kana uwezu kuliku neni. Neni weza ndiri kuyopola lugoyi lwa kutawira shilyatu shakuwi. Mweni ayu hakakubatizani kwa Rohu Mnanagala na kwa motu. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Yomberi mumawoku mwakuwi kana luselu lwa kupetera, hakayijojiniri nganu na kuitula muluhanja lyakuwi, kumbiti hakatoli miwawi na kuipambira pamotu gwagutenda ndiri tiya.”<verse eid="LUK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Kwa visoweru vivuwa Yohani kaweriti kankuwabwelera wantu visoweru viheri, kankuwagambira wantu waleki vidoda vyawatenda. <verse eid="LUK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Yohani kamkalipiriti Herodi yakaweriti mkolamlima gwa mukowa, toziya kaweriti kamupoka Herodiya yakaweriti mdala gwa mlongu gwakuwi na katenditi vintu vivuwa vidoda nentu. <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Su Herodi katenditi shidoda nentu kwa kamtatira Yohani mushibetubetu.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wambatiza</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Matayu 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mariku 1:9-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Wantu woseri pawawabatiziti kala, Yesu wambatiziti vilavi. Pakaweriti kankuluwa, kumpindi kuvuguka, <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />na Rohu Mnanagala kamsulukira kaweriti gambira mpongu mfanu gwa ng'unda, liziwu lipikanika kulawa kumpindi palilonga, “Gwenga gwa mwana gwangu yanukufira. Gunihelepeziya”<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alu ndo lukolu lwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Matayu 1:1-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Yesu pakanjiti lihengu lyakuwi kaweriti na mivinja milongu mitatu. Su wantu wamaniti hangu, Yesu kaweriti mwana gwa Yosefu na Yosefu kaweriti mwana gwa Heli. <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Heli kaweriti mwana gwa Matati na Matati yakaweriti mwana gwa Lawi, shakapanu kayi Lawi mwana gwa Maliki na Maliki kaweriti mwana gwa Yanayi na Yanani kaweriti mwana gwa Yosefu. <verse eid="LUK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />Yosefu kaweriti mwana gwa Matatiya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:25">na Matatiya kaweriti mwana gwa Amosi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:25">Amosi kaweriti mwana gwa Nahumu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:25">na Nahumu kaweriti mwana gwa Hesli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:25">na Hesli kaweriti mwana gwa Nagayi.<verse eid="LUK 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />Nagayi kaweriti mwana gwa Maati</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:26">na Maati kaweriti mwana gwa Matatiya</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:26">na Matatiya kaweriti mwana gwa Shemeni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:26">na Shemeni kaweriti mwana gwa Yoseki</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:26">na Yoseki kaweriti mwana gwa Yuda.<verse eid="LUK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />Yuda kaweriti mwana gwa Yohanani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:27">na Yohanani kaweriti mwana gwa Resa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:27">na Resa kaweriti mwana gwa Zerubabeli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:27">na Zerubabeli kaweriti mwana gwa Sheatiyeli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:27">na Sheatiyeli mwana gwa Neri.<verse eid="LUK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />Neri kaweriti mwana gwa Maliki</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:28">na Maliki mwana gwa Adi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:28">na Adi kaweriti mwana gwa Kosamu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:28">na Kosamu kaweriti mwana gwa Elimadamu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:28">na Elimadamu kaweriti mwana gwa Eri.<verse eid="LUK 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />Eri mwana gwa Yoshuwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:29">na Yoshuwa kaweriti mwana gwa Eliazeri</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:29">Eliazeri kaweriti mwana gwa Yorimi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:29">na Yorimi kaweriti mwana gwa Matati</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:29">na Matati kaweriti mwana gwa Lawi.<verse eid="LUK 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />Lawi kaweriti mwana gwa Simiyoni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:30">na Simiyoni kaweriti mwana gwa Yuda</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:30">na Yuda kaweriti mwana gwa Yosefu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:30">na Yosefu kaweriti mwana gwa Yonamu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:30">na Yonamu kaweriti mwana gwa Eliyakimu.<verse eid="LUK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Eliyakimu kaweriti mwana gwa Melea</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:31">na Melea kaweriti mwana gwa Mena</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:31">na Mena kaweriti mwana gwa Matati</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:31">na Matati kaweriti mwana gwa Natani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:31">na Natani kaweriti mwana gwa Dawudi.<verse eid="LUK 3:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />Dawudi kaweriti mwana gwa Yese</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:32">na Yese kaweriti mwana gwa Obedi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:32">na Obedi kaweriti mwana gwa Boazi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:32">na Boazi kaweriti mwana gwa Salimoni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:32">na Salmoni kaweriti mwana gwa Nashoni.<verse eid="LUK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />Nashoni kaweriti mwana gwa Aminadabu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:33">na Aminadabu kaweriti mwana gwa Adimini</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:33">na Adimini kaweriti mwana gwa Arini</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:33">na Arini kaweriti mwana gwa Hesironi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:33">na Hesroni kaweriti mwana gwa Peresi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:33">na Peresi kaweriti mwana gwa Yuda.<verse eid="LUK 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Yuda kaweriti mwana gwa Yakobu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:34">na Yakobu kaweriti mwana gwa Isaka</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:34">na Isaka kaweriti mwana gwa Aburahamu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:34">na Aburahamu kaweriti mwana gwa Tera</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:34">na Tera kaweriti mwana gwa Nahori.<verse eid="LUK 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Nahori kaweriti mwana gwa Serugi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:35">na Serugi kaweriti mwana gwa Reu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:35">na Reu kaweriti mwana gwa Pelegi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:35">na Pelegi kaweriti mwana gwa Eberi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:35">na Eberi kaweriti mwana gwa Sala.<verse eid="LUK 3:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />Sala kaweriti mwana gwa Kaini</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:36">na Kaini kaweriti mwana gwa Arifakisadi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:36">na Arifakisadi kaweriti mwana gwa Shemu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:36">na Shemu kaweriti mwana gwa Nuhu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:36">na Nuhu kaweriti mwana gwa Lameki.<verse eid="LUK 3:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />Lameki kaweriti mwana gwa Matusala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:37">na Matusala kaweriti mwana gwa Henoki</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:37">na Henoki kaweriti mwana gwa Yaredi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:37">na Yaredi kaweriti mwana gwa Mahalaleli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:37">na Mahalaleli kaweriti mwana gwa Kenani.<verse eid="LUK 3:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Kenani kaweriti mwana gwa Enosi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:38">na Enosi kaweriti mwana gwa Seti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:38">na Seti kaweriti mwana gwa Adamu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:38">na Adamu kaweriti mwana gwa Mlungu.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s">Kugeziwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Matayu 4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mariku 1:12-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Yesu kalawiriti mulishemba mwa Yoridani, pakamema makakala ga Rohu Mnanagala na Rohu Mnanagala kamlonguziyiti Yesu kugenda kushiwala. <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />Kushiwala kulii, Shetani kamjeriti Yesu mashaka malongu msheshi. Shaka shoseri ashi Yesu hakeniliyi shintu, pagapititi kala mashaka aga Yesu kaweriti na njala.<verse eid="LUK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Shetani kamgambiriti Yesu, “Handa gwenga gwa Mwana gwa Mlungu, guligambiziyi libuwi ali liweri libumunda.”<verse eid="LUK 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Kumbiti Yesu kamwankula, “Galembwa, ‘Muntu hapeni kalikali kwa libumunda hera.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Palaa paliya Shetani kamlonguziyiti Yesu na kumkweniziya pahala pampindi na kumlanguziya ufalumi wa pasipanu poseri. <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />Shetani kamgambiriti Yesu, “Hanukupanani uwezu wa falumi zoseri na lunda zyakuwi mana wanupanana neni vyoseri, panfira kumpanana muntu yoseri, weza. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Vyoseri avi haviweri lunda zyaku gwenga handa pagung'uwira neni.”<verse eid="LUK 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Yesu kamuwankula, “Galembwa, ‘Gumguwiri Mtuwa Mlungu gwaku na kumtendera yomberi gweka yakuwi.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Shetani kamjega Yesu mpaka Yerusalemu, kamkweniziya pashitwiku pa Numba nkulu ya Mlungu, kamgambira, “Handa gwenga gwa Mwana gwa Mlungu, guliyasi pasi. <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />Toziya galembwa, ‘Mungu hakawagambiri wantumintumi wakuwi wa kumpindi wakuloleli weri. <verse eid="LUK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />Kayi galembwa hawakutoli mumawoku mwawu pota na kulikwala ligulu lyaku mulibuwi.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Kumbiti Yesu kamwankula, “Galonga, ‘Nagumjera Mtuwa Mlungu gwaku.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Shetani pakamjeriti kala Yesu kwa kila njira kasinda, kamleka kwa shaka na kagenda zakuwi.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kanja lihengu lyakuwi Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Matayu 4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mariku 1:14-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Yesu pakawuyiti Galilaya, keweriti kamema likakala lya Rohu Mnanagala. Shisoweru shakuwi shieneyiti pahala poseri pakwegera. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Nayomberi kawera pakawafunda wantu mnumba zawu za Mlungu, woseri wamkwisa.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wamlemiti Nazareti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Matayu 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mariku 6:1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Su Yesu kagenditi Nazareti, pahala pakalelitwi na lishaka lya kwoyera kingira munumba ya Mlungu ntambu yayiweriti shitiba shakuwi. Kagoloka kabetuli malembu mananagala kwa liziwu. <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />Kawanka shintola sha Isaya Mbuyi gwa Mlungu, kashivugula na kuwona pahala pawalembiti,<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />“Rohu gwa Mtuwa kapamuhera na neni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">Toziya kansyagula neni nuwajegeli shisoweru shiwagira kwa wahushu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">Kantuma nuwagambiziyi watatirwa kuvugulirwa kwawu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">Na wanalwisi wapati kuwona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">Wantuma nuwalopoziyi woseri yawonewa,<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />Na kushibwelera shaka shilii shankwiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:19">Mtuwa hakawalopoziyi wantu wakuwi.”<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Yesu pakabetuliti kala, kashigubika shintola na kamupanana ntumintumi, mweni kalivaga. Wantu woseri munumba ya Mlungu, wamjodolera masu, <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />su kanja kuwagambira, “Leru Lilembu Linanagala ali liwera nakaka pampikaniriti lyankubetulwa.”<verse eid="LUK 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Woseri wafiliziwa nentu nayomberi, walikangashira visoweru viwagira vyakatakuliti. Walonga, “Hashi ayu mwana ndiri gwa Yosefu?”<verse eid="LUK 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Yomberi kawagambira, “Nakaka hamung'ambiri visoweru avi, ‘Mganga guliponiziyi gumweni.’ Viraa hamtakuli, ‘Goseri gatupikiniriti gugatenditi Kafarinaumu, gugatendi panu pa pashijiji shaku.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Kendereya kutakula, “Nankuwagambirani nakaka, mbuyi gwa Mlungu kamanikana ndiri mushijiji mwawu.<verse eid="LUK 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />“Munpikaniri weri, Nakaka kweniti na wadala wakenja wavuwa pa isi ya Israeli shaka sha Eliya, vula ileka kutowa kwa mivinja mitatu na nusu, kweniti njala nkulu pa isi yoseri. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Ata hangu, Eliya wamtumiti ndiri kwa muntu yoseri Muisiraeri, ira kwa mdala mkenja yakalikaliti Sarepati pa Sidoni. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Mushaka sha Elisha mbuyi gwa Mlungu, kweniti wantu wavuwa muisi ya Israeli yawaweriti walwala ungumbula kumbiti kwahera muntu yoseri yakapungitwi kumbiti Naamani yakaweriti gwa isi ya Siriya.”<verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Wantu woseri yawaweriti mnumba ya Mlungu pawapikaniriti aga, wakalaliti nentu. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Wagoloka, wamlaviya Yesu kunja kushijiji shawanyawiti kulugongu. Wamkweniziya mpaka mlupeleru lwa lugongu su wamwasi pasi. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Kumbiti Yesu kapena pakati pawu kagenda zyakuwi.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muntu kana washamshera</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Mariku 1:21-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Yesu kagenditi mpaka Kafarinaumu Iushi lwa Galilaya, kaweriti kankuwafunda wantu mulishaka lya kwoyera. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Walikangashiti mafundu gakafunditi, toziya katakuliti kwa uwezu. <verse eid="LUK 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Mlaa munumba ya Mlungu kweniti na muntu kana shamshera, su kabotanga, <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />“Wuyi! Gwanashishi na twenga, Yesu gwa Nazareti? Gwapanu, gwiza kutulaga? Nukumana gwenga gwa gaa, gwenga gwa Mjumbi yumu Mnanagala gwa Mlungu!”<verse eid="LUK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Yesu kamkalipira shamshera ulii pakalonga, “Gunyamali na gumlawi muntu ayu!” Su shamshera ulii kumgusiya pasi muntu ulii kulongolu kwawu na kamlawa pota na kumtenda shintu.<verse eid="LUK 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Wantu woseri walikangasha na walitakuziyana weni kwa weni, “Ashi shitwatila gaa? Mana kwa uwezu na makakala kawagambira washamshera walawi nawomberi walawa!” <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Visoweru vya Yesu viyeniyiti pahala poseri mumkowa guliya.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuwaponiziya wantu wavuwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Matayu 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mariku 1:29-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Yesu kalawiti munumba ya Mlungu na kagenditi ukaya kwa Simoni. Nahonga gwa Simoni kaweriti na nshimba ipyupa nentu, wamluwiti Yesu kamuponiziyi. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Yesu kagenda na kagoloka pakwegera na yomberi, kakukalipira kupyupa kulii na kupyupa kulii kumleka. Palaa mawu uliya kimuka kawatendera.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Mushenji paguweriti gwankuzyeta, wantu woseri wawaweriti na walweli wawu wawajega kwa Yesu, nayomberi katula mawoku gakuwi kwa kila muntu na kuwaponiziya woseri. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Washamshera wawalawa wantu wavuwa, wabotanga pawalonga, “Gwenga gwa Mwana gwa Mlungu!” Kumbiti Yesu kawakaripira, kawalewelera nawatakula, mana wavimana kuwera mweni ndo Kristu.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankubwera munumba za Mlungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Mariku 1:35-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Pamandawira shirawu yakuwi, Yesu kawukiti kagenda pahala pagweka. Wantu waweriti wankumsakula na pawamwoniti kala, wajeriti kumzyengeta nakawuka. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Kumbiti yomberi kawagambira, “Nfiruwa kubwera visoweru viwagila vya Ufalumi wa Mlungu mulushi zimonga viraa, toziya ntenda shilii shakantumiti Mlungu.” <verse eid="LUK 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Su kawera kankubwera munumba za Mlungu Muyudeya.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuwashema wantumini wa kwanja</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Matayu 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mariku 1:16-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Lishaka limu Yesu kagolokiti pampenku pa litanda lya Genezareti, aku wantu waweriti wankulibabanika wapikiniri visoweru vya Mlungu. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Kawoniti miuwatu miwili mumpenku mwa litanda, walowa wa wasomba waweriti wawuka, wagenditi kuzigulula wavu zawu. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Yesu kagenda kwingira muuwatu mwa Simoni na kamgambiriti kausegeziyi uwatu ulii palongolu padidini mulitanda. Yesu kalivagiti muuwatu na kanjiti kulifunda lipinga lya wantu.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Pakamaliriti kala kutakula, kamgambira Simoni, “Gushimi uwatu kugenda kumashi gagenda, gwenga na wayagu mwakazidibisiyi zinavu zyeni mlowi wasomba.”<verse eid="LUK 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Simoni kamwankula, “Mtuwa, twenga pashiru poseri tutenditi lihengu liraa ali kumbiti tupata ndiri wasomba. Toziya gwenga gutakula hangu, neni hanuzidibisiyi zinavu.” <verse eid="LUK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Pawadibisiyiti kala zinavu wamemiti wasomba wavuwa mpaka zinyavu zyanja kudegeka. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Wawashemiti wayawu yawaweriti muuwatu umonga wizi wawatangi. Womberi wiza na wamemisiya wasomba miuwatu yoseri miwili mpaka yanja kulidiba. <verse eid="LUK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Simoni Peteru pakawoniti yagalawiriti, kasuntamalira palongolu pa Yesu pakalonga, “Guwuki palongolu pangu, Mtuwa! Toziya neni muntu yanwera na vidoda!”<verse eid="LUK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Simoni na wayaguwi woseri walikangashiti pawawoniti ntambu yawapatiti wasomba wavuwa. <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Wayaguwi na Simon, ashina Yakobu na Yohani, wana wa Zebedayu nawomberi walikangasha. Yesu kamgambira Simoni, “Nagutila, kwanjira vinu haguweri mlowa wantu.”<verse eid="LUK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Wasegeziyiti miuwatu yawu pampenku palitanda, waleka kila shintu, wamfata Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kamuponiziya muntu kana ugumbula</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Matayu 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mariku 1:40-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Su Yesu pakaweriti mulushi, kuweriti na muntu yakana ugumbula. Pakamwoniti Yesu, kasuntama makukama kulongolu kwa Yesu kamluwa pakalonga, “Mtuwa pagufira gumweni, guweza gumpungi neni.”<verse eid="LUK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Yesu kalitalapisiya liwoku lyakuwi na kumshinkula pakalonga, “Neni nfira hangu, gupungwi!” Pala palii ugumbula umlekeziya. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Yesu kamsinga pakalonga, “Nagumgambira muntu yoseri, su gugendi gwakaliranguziyi kwa Mtambika mkulu, gulaviyi tambiku ntambu yakalagaliriti Musa kwa kupungwa kwaku su muntu yoseri kavimani kuwera gupona.”<verse eid="LUK 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Visoweru vya Yesu vyeniyiti nentu. Lipinga lya wantu limgendiriti kumpikinira na wamonga wafiliti waponiziwi malweli gawu. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Su Yesu kawukiti na kagenda pahala pagweka, kaweriti kankumluwa Mlungu.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kamuponiziyiti muntu yakalewelekiti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Matayu 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mariku 2:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Lishaka limu Yesu kaweriti kankufunda, Mafalisayu wamu pamuhera na wafunda wa Malagaliru yawalivagiti palii weni walawiti mukila Iushi lwa Galilaya na Yudeya na kulawa Yerusalemu. Likakala lya Mtuwa liweriti kwa Yesu kwajili ya kuponiziya walweli. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Wantu wamu wiziti pawampapa mulisaga muntu yakalewelekiti, wajeriti kumwingiziya mnumba su wamtuli palongolu pa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Toziya ya lipinga lya wantu, wasinditi kwingira nayomberi mnumba. Su wamkweniziya mlweri ulii pashitwiku, wadonola pampindi palitala, shakapanu wamseleziya mlweri ulii mulisaga lyakuwi mpaka pakati kulongolu kwa Yesu. Wantu wamsheshi wankumsulusiya mlweri kupitira palitala.<figure style="fig" file="17 Lowering Man Through the Roof.jpg" size="col" ref="5:19">Wantu wamsheshi wankumsulusiya mlweri kupitira pashitwiku</figure> <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Yesu pakawoniti njimiru yawu nkulu, kamgambiriti mlweri ulii, “Ganja gwangu, vidoda vyaku vilekiziwa.”<verse eid="LUK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Wafunda wa Malagaliru na Mafalisayu su wanja kulikosiya pawalonga, “Ayu muntu gaa, kamwigilanga Mlungu! Mlungu gweka yakuwi ndo kaweza kulekiziya vidoda.”<verse eid="LUK 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Yesu kavimaniti kala vyawaliholiti su kawakosiya, “Hashi, mulihola hangu mumyoyu mwenu? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Shoshi shikamala, ‘Kulonga vidoda vyaku vilekiziwa,’ ama kutakula, ‘Gugoloki na gugendigendi?’ <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Nfira muvimani, Mwana gwa Muntu kana uwezu pasipanu wa kulekiziya vidoda.” Su kamgambiriti muntu yakalewelekiti, “Nankugambira, gugoloki na gutoli mkeka gwaku na gugendi ukaya kwaku!”<verse eid="LUK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Pala palii muntu ulii yakalewelekiti kagoloka kulongolu kwawu woseri, katola mkeka gwakuwi na kugendagenda na kagenditi ukaya pakamkwisa Mlungu. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Woseri walikangasha nentu! Waweriti na lyoga, wamkwisiti Mlungu pawalonga, “Tulola mauzauza leru!”<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kamshema Lawi,</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Matayu 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mariku 2:13-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Shakapanu, Yesu kalawa kunja, kamwoniti yakatola kodi litawu lyakuwi Lawi, kalivaga muofisi mwakuwi. Yesu kamgambira, “Gunfati.” <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Lawi kagoloka, kaleka kila shintu, kamfatiti yomberi.<verse eid="LUK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Lawi kamtenderiti Yesu msambu mkulu nentu pakaya pakuwi, mngati mwa wahenga, waweriti watola kodi wavuwa pamuhera na wantu wamonga. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Mafalisayu wamu na wafunda wa Malagaliru, winginikiti kwa wafundwa wa Yesu pawalonga, “Iwera hashi mwega mliya shiboga na kulanda pamuhera na watola kodi na wantu yawawera na vidoda?”<verse eid="LUK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Yesu kawankula, “Wantu wakomu walandaga ndiri mgota, kumbiti woseri yawalwala ndo walandaga mgota. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Niza ndiri kuwashema wantu waheri, kumbiti niza kuwashema wantu yawawera na vidoda waleki vidoda vyawatenda.”<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wamkosiya kwajili ya kwoya kuliya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Matayu 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mariku 2:18-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Wantu wamonga wamgambiriti Yesu, “Wafundwa wa Yohani Mbatiza, woyiti kuliya mala zivuwa na kumluwa Mlungu na wafundwa wa Mafalisayu watendaga hera hangu, kumbiti wafundwa waku wankuliya na kulanda.”<verse eid="LUK 5:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Yesu kawankula, “Hashi muweza kuwatenda wahenga wa mpalu gwa ndowa woyi kuliya pawawera na mpalu gwa ndowa? Hapeni watendi hangu! <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Su lishaka halizi pawamtola mpalu gwa ndowa, womberi ndo hawoyi kuliya.”<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Yesu viraa kawagambira kwa mfanu, “Kwahera muntu hakatoli shiraka sha nguwu yasyayi na kusonera munguwu ngona. Pakatenda hangu, su nguwu yasyayi hawayidegi, kayi shiraka sheni hapeni shilinganiri na nguwu ngona. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Kwahera muntu yakalekera divayi yasyayi mumihaku ya lukuli migona, toziya divayi ya syayi hayipanti mihaku ya lukuli na divayi yeni hayitiki na mihaku ya lukuli hayidegeki. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Mala zoseri, divayi yasyayi ilekerwa mumihaku ya lukuli yasyayi! <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Kwahera muntu yakafira kulanda divayi yasyayi pakalanditi kala divayi ngona, su katakula, ‘Divayi ngona ndo iherepa nentu.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s">Likosiwu kwajili ya lishaka lya kwoyera</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Matayu 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mariku 2:23-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Lishaka limu lya kwoyera Yesu kaweriti kankupita mumigunda ya nganu. Wafundwa wakuwi waweriti wankubena mikunguwi ya nganu, pawayisyoga mumawoku mwawu na kuziliya mbunji zya nganu. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Mafalisayu wamu wamkosiya, “Iwera hashi mtenda shintu sheni Lilagaliru lilewelera kutenda mulishaka lya kwoyera?”<verse eid="LUK 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Yesu kawankula, “Mwenga hamwenibetuli ntambu yakatenditi Dawudi na wayaguwi shaka pawaweriti na njala? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Yomberi kingiriti Mnumba ya Mlungu, katola mabumunda gawatuliti Mnumba ya Mlungu, kaliyiti na gamonga kawapananiti wayaguwi. Kwahera muntu yoseri yakaliyaga kumbiti watambika hera ndo waliyaga.”<verse eid="LUK 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Yesu kamaliriti kwa kuwagambira, “Mwana gwa Muntu ndo Mtuwa gwa lishaka lya kwoyera.”<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muntu kana liwoku lilewelekiti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Matayu 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mariku 3:1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Lishaka lyamonga lya kwoyera Yesu kingiriti mnumba ya Mlungu kufunda. Kuweriti na muntu mlaa yakaweriti na liwoku lya kumliwu lyalilewelekiti. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Wafunda wamu wa Malagaliru na Mafalisayu wamu wasakuliti shisoweru sha kumsitaki Yesu, su waweriti wankumuhepelera waloli handa hakamponiziyi muntu mulishaka lya kwoyera. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Kumbiti Yesu kavimaniti kala shawaliholiti, su kamgambiriti muntu yakeniti na liwoku lyalilewelekiti, “Gugoloki, gwizi panu palongolu.” Muntu ulii kimuka na kugoloka palii. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Su Yesu kawagambira, “Nukukosiyani, Lilagaliru litujimira twenga kutenda shishi mulishaka lya kwoyera? Kuponiziya ama kulaga? Kugalopoziya makaliru ga muntu ama kugalaga?” <verse eid="LUK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Kawaloliti wega zoseri, shakapanu Kamgambira muntu yakeniti na liwoku lyalilewelekiti, “Gulitalipisiyi liwoku lyaku.” Yomberi kalitalipisiya liwoku lyakuwi na liwera kayi likomu.<verse eid="LUK 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Womberi wakalala, su wanja kulihola ntambu ya kumtenda Yesu vidoda.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kawasyagula wantumintumi lilongu na mbili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Matayu 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mariku 3:13-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Shaka shilii Yesu kagenda kulugongu kumluwa Mlungu, kalivagiti kulaa aku pashiru poseri pakamluwa Mlungu. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Shilawu yakuwi kawashema wantumintumi wakuwi, pakati pawu kawasyagula lilongu na mbili kawashema wantumintumi. <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Awa ndo Simoni yawamupiti litawu lya Peteru na Andereya mlongu gwakuwi na Yakobu na Yohani na Filipu na Batolumayu, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Matayu na Tomasi na Yakobu mwana gwa Alifayu na Simoni yawamshemiti Zeloti, <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />Yuda mwana gwa Yakobu na Yuda Isikariyoti yakamgalambukiti Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankufunda na kuwaponiziya wantu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Matayu 4:23-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Pakasulukiti kulugongu pamuhera na wafundwa wakuwi, Yesu kagolokiti palushi, pakaweriti na wafundwa wakuwi wavuwa. Lipinga likulu lya wantu yawalivagiti palii, walawiti Muyudeya yoseri na Yerusalemu na mbwega ya Tiru na Sidoni, <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />wiziti kumpikinira na kuponiziwa malweli gawu. Woseri yawagaziwitwi na washamshera viraa wiziti na waponiziwitwi. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Wantu woseri wafiriti kumshinkula Yesu, makakala gamlawiti na kawaponiziya woseri.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nemeleru na kutabika</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Matayu 5:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Yesu kawagalambukira wafundwa wakuwi na kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:20">“Mnemeleri mwenga mwawahushu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:20">Toziya Ufalumi wa Mlungu hawuweri wenu!<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Mnemeleri mwenga yamuwera na njala vinu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">Toziya hamyukutiziwi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">Mnemeleri mwenga yamlira vinu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">Toziya hamsekeleri!”<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />“Mnemeleri mwenga wantu pawawakalirani na kuwalema, kuwahigilanga na kuwapayirani madoda, goseri aga toziya ya Mwana gwa Muntu! <verse eid="LUK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Shaka pagalawila aga, mnemeleli pa mvina, toziya ya lijenjeri likulu lyawawatulirani kala kumpindi kwa Mlungu. Hangu ndo wambuyi wawu wawatenditi wambuyi wa Mlungu ntambu iraayi.”<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />“Kumbiti shondi shondi mwenga mwawalunda vinu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:24">Toziya nemeleru yenu vinu ipera!<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Shondi shondi mwenga yamwikuta vinu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">Hamuweri na njala!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">Shondi shondi mwenga yamseka vinu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">Hamlili na kudaya!<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />“Shondi shondi wantu woseri wankukuzyumani, hera hangu wagogolu wawu watakuliti ntambu iraayi kwa wambuyi wa mpayu.<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwafira wangondu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Matayu 5:38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12">Matayu 7:12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />“Kumbiti nankuwagambirani mwenga mwamunpikanira. Muwafiri wangondu wenu, muwatekeleri woseri wakukalalirani. <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />Muwatekeleri woseri wawakupangilirani na muwaluwili kwa Mlungu woseri yawakutenderani madoda. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Muntu pakakukoma lisaya limu, gumleki kakomi na lisaya lyamonga, handa muntu pakakupoka likoti lyaku, gumlekeri na lishati lyaku. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Muntu yoseri pakakuluwa gumpanani na muntu pakakupoka ulunda waku, nagumgambira kawuziyi. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Muwatenderi wamonga ntambu yamfira kutenderwa.<verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />“Handa pamuwafira walii yawawafira mwenga, hampati lifupu gaa? Ata yawawera na vidoda wawafira wantu yawawafira womberi. <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Kayi pamuwatendera viheri walii yawakutenderani mwenga viheri, hampati lifupu gaa? Ata yawawera na vidoda watendaga hera hangu! <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Na pamuwawanda walii yamuwahola kuwera hawakuwuzireni hampati lifupu gaa? Ata yawawera na vidoda wawawanda yawawera na vidoda, pawalihola wawawuziliri shawawandiri. <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Kumbiti mwenga muwafiri wangondu wenu na muwatenderi viheri, muwandi namuliholera kuwuzilirwa. Lifupu lyenu haliweri likulu na hamuweri wana wa Mlungu gwa kumpindi. Toziya yomberi ndo muheri kwa wantu yawahera mayagashii na yawatenda vidoda. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Muweri na lusungu gambira Tati gwenu ntambu yakawera na lusungu.<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwalunda wamonga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Matayu 7:1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />“Namuwalunda wamonga, su Mlungu hakawalundi ndiri mwenga, namuwapangira wamonga, su Mlungu hapeni kawapangili mwenga, muwalekeziyi wamonga, su Mlungu hakawalekiziyi mwenga. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Muwapanani wamonga, su Mlungu hakawapanani mwenga. Hamuwanki shipimu shakumemeziya, sha kutikisiya na kuyonera na kwitika mumawoku mwenu, vyoseri avi haviweri vya mwenga. Shipimu shamuwapimiliti wamonga, Mlungu ndo hakakupimirani mwenga.”<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Yesu kawagambira mfanu agu, “Muntu kana lwisi kaweza ndiri kumlongoziya kana lwisi muyaguwi, pakatenda hangu, woseri hawapokeri mulirindi. <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Kwahera mfundwa kaweza kumsinda mfunda gwakuwi, su kila mfundwa pakamalila kala mafundu hakaweri gambira mfunda gwakuwi.<verse eid="LUK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />“Guweza hashi kushiwona shibandu shididini nentu mulisu lya mlongu gwaku, pota kuwona lipingiri lya mulisu lyaku? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Hashi guweza kutakula kwa mlongu gwaku, ‘Guleki nukuwusiyi shibandu shididini nentu mulisu lyaku,’ na gwenga gusinda kuliwona lipingiri lya mulisu lyaku? Gwa mfyangu gwenga! Kwanja guwusiyi huti lipingiri lya ligogu mulisu lyaku, ndo haguwezi kushiwusiya weri shibandu mulisu lya mlongu gwaku.<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtera na mabwajubwaju gakuwi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Matayu 7:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">Matayu 12:33-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />“Kwahera mtera guherepa gwagulera mabwajubwaju gadoda, viraa mtera gudoda guweza ndiri kulera mabwajubwaju gaherepa. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Kila mtera gumanika kulawirana na mabwajubwaju gakuwi galeriti, guweza ndiri kwapa embi mumishongoma ama zabibu mumbigiri. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Muntu muheri katendaga viheri kulawa muviheri vivuwa mumoyu mwakuwi, na muntu kana vidoda katendaga vidoda kulawa muvidoda vivuwa mumoyu mwakuwi. Toziya mlomu gutakula galii gaweriti mumoyu.<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ntambu mbili zya wanyawa numba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Matayu 7:24-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />“Iwera ashi munshema, ‘Mtuwa, Mtuwa,’ Uganu mtenda ndiri vyanuwagambirani? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Hanuwalanguziyi ntambu yakalifana muntu yoseri pakiza kwa neni na kupikinira visoweru vyaneni na kuvijimira. <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />Kalifana na muntu yakanyawa numba yakuwi, kabawa pasi nentu na kunyawa liyanjiru mulitalawu. Mafuriku gamashi pagarawiriti gayiputa numba ilii kumbiti itikinyika ndiri, toziya wayinyawiti weri numba. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Su yoseri ulii yakapikanira visoweru vyangu na kuvijimira ndiri, ayu kalifana na muntu yakanyawiti numba yakuwi pota na kunyawa lyanjiru, mafuriku pagiziti gayiputa numba ilii na kuguwa puu na kubomokanga nakamu!”<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kamuponiziya mtumini gwa Mkulu gwa Warumi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Matayu 8:5-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Yesu pakamaliriti kutakula vyoseri kwa wantu, kagenditi Kafarinaumu. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Mkulu gwa wanjagila miya yimu kaweriti na ntumini yakamfiriti nentu. Ntumintumi kaweriti kalwala tashitashi. <figure style="fig" file="08 Centurion.jpg" size="col" ref="7:2">Mkulu gwa wanjagila miya wa Shirumi</figure> <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Mkulu ulii pakapikaniriti visoweru vya Yesu, kawatumiti wazewi wa Shiyawudi kumluwa kizi kamuponiziyi ntumintumi gwakuwi. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Wagenditi kwa Yesu na kumuhiga nentu pawalonga, “Muntu ayu kafiruwa gumtenderi shitwatila ashi. <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />Kawafira wantu wetu na mweni katunyawira numba ya Mlungu.”<verse eid="LUK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Su Yesu kagenda pamuhera na womberi. Pakaweriti pakwegera na ukaya kwa mkulu ulii, mkulu ulii kawatumiti waganja wakuwi wamgambiri Yesu, “Mtuwa naguligaziya hera. Gwenga gufiruwa ndiri kwingira mnumba mwangu, <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />na neni mona nfaa ndiri ata kwiza kwa gwenga. Kumbiti gutakuli hera, ntumintumi gwangu hakaweri mkomu. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Mana neni viraa namuntu gwa pasi pa ukulu, nanawa wamanjagila yanuwalongoziyiti. Panumgambira yumu, ‘Gugendi!’ Yomberi kagenda na panumgambira yumonga, ‘Gwizi!’ Yomberi kiza na panumgambira ntumintumi gwangu, ‘Gutendi shintu ashi!’ Nayomberi katenda.”<verse eid="LUK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Yesu pakapikaniriti hangu kalikangasha, su kaligalambukiriti lipinga lya wantu lyalimfatiti pakalonga, “Nankuwagambirani, mpata ndiri kuwona muntu kana njimiru gambira ayu Muisraeli!”<verse eid="LUK 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Wantu walii pawasokiti ukaya kwa Mkulu wamwoniti ntumintumi ulii kawera mkomu nakamu.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kamzukusiya mwana gwa Mkenja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Shakapanu, Yesu kagenditi lushi lwawalushema Naini, wafundwa wakuwi pamuhera na lipinga likulu lya wantu wagenda nayomberi. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Su pakaweriti pakwegera na ligomi likulu lya Iushi, wantu wampapiti yakahowiti waweriti wankulawa kunja kwa Iushi. Yakahowiti kaweriti mwana gwagweka gwa mdala yakaweriti mkenja, na lipinga likulu lya wantu waweriti pamuhera nayomberi. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Mtuwa pakamwoniti mkenja ulii, kamwonera lusungu mdala ulii, kamgambiriti, “Nagulira.” <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Shakapanu kalisegelera lijeneza lya yakahowiti na kulishinkula, wantu wawalipapiti wagoloka. Yesu kalonga, “Muntemba! Nukugambira gwimuki!” <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Muntu ulii yakahowiti kalivaga, su kanja kuyowera. Yesu kamupanana mawu gwakuwi.<verse eid="LUK 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Wantu woseri weniti lyoga wamkwisiti Mlungu pawalonga, “Mbuyi mkulu kalawira pakati petu. Mlungu kiza kuwalopoziya wantu wakuwi!”<verse eid="LUK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Visoweru avi vya Yesu viyeniyiti mulushi loseri lwa Yudeya na lushi zya pakwegera.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wajumbi yakawatumiti Yohani Mbatiza</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 11:2-10">Matayu 11:2-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Wafundwa wa Yohani wamgambiriti Yohani vitwatira avi vyoseri, nayomberi pakawashemiti kala wawili wamu wa wafundwa wakuwi <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />kawatumiti kwa Mtuwa wakamkosiyi, “Hashi, gwenga ndo gumweni yatumuhepera, ama tumuheperi gwingi?”<verse eid="LUK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Wafundwa walii wamgendiriti Yesu na kumgambira, “Yohani Mbatiza katutuma kwaku tukukosiyi handa gwenga ndo uliya yakatakuliti gwankwiza ama tumuheperi gwingi?”<verse eid="LUK 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Shaka shiraa shilii Yesu kaweriti kankuwaponiziya wantu wavuwa weniti na malweri na wamonga waniti na washamshera wadoda na kuwapanana wanalwisi wavuwa kulola. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Su Yesu kawankula wantumintumi wa Yohani pakalonga, “Mgendi mwakamgambiri Yohani vyoseri vyamuviwoniti na kuvipikinira, wanalwisi wawona, wavibyeketu wagendagenda, woseri walii yawawera na ungumbula wapungwa, yawawera na majogu vinu wapikinira, wahowiti su wazyuka na Shisoweru Shiwagira shibwerwa kwa wahushu. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Mbaka woseri walii wahera lyoga na neni.”<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Su wajumbi wa Yohani pawawukiti kala, Yesu kanja kuligambira lipinga kwajili ya Yohani, “Pamgenditi kumlola Yohani kushiwala mfira kulola shintu gaa? Mfiriti kuwona gambira mateti ntambu yagatikinyika na lihega? Ndala! <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Su mgenditi kumlola muntu gwa ntambu gaa? Hashi mliholiti Mgenditi kumlola muntu kavaliti nguwu ziherepa? Ndala, wantu yawavala nguwu ziherepa na kubojola vinoga noga vyaviwera muukulu! <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Su mung'ambiri, mgenditi kumlola muntu gwa ntambu gaa? Mgenditi kumlola mbuyi gwa Mlungu? Yina nakaka, tuwona gavuwa nentu kuliku mbuyi. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Yohani ayu ndo yumu yawamtakula mukulemba, kulonga, ‘Mlungu kalonga, hanumtumi mjumbi gwangu hakakulonguleri kukunyawira njira kwajili yaku.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Yesu kamaliriti kwa kulonga, “Nukugambirani, Yohani ndo mkulu kuliku woseri yawalikaliti pasipanu. Kumbiti yakaweriti mdidini Muwufalumi wa Mlungu ndo mkulu kuliku Yohani.”<verse eid="LUK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Wantu woseri wampikaniriti. Wantu wavuwa asa watola kodi ndo wagajimiriti Malagaliru Mananagala ga Mlungu, awa ndo walii Yohani yakawabatiziti. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Kumbiti Mafalisayu pamuhera na wafunda wa Malagaliru wagulemiti mpangu gwa Mlungu na wamlemiti Yohani kawabatizi.<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Yesu kongera kulonga, “Vinu wantu wa mashaka aga walifana na shintu gaa? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Walifana gambira wana yawalivaga pahala pasoku. Shipinga shimu shishigambizisiya shamonga, ‘Tuviniti msambu gwa ndowa kumbiti mwenga mvina ndiri! Twimba lwimbu lwa kudaya kumbiti mlila ndiri!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Yohani Mbatiza pakiziti, koyiti kuliya na kalanda ndiri divayi, kumbiti mwenga mlongiti, ‘Kana washamshera!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Kiziti Mwana gwa Muntu, kaliyiti shiboga na kulanda, kumbiti mwenga mtakula, ‘Mumloli muntu ayu, Kana lwaliya na mkologeru, ganja gwa watola kodi na wanavidoda!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Kumbiti luhala lwa Mlungu luwoneka kuwera lwa nakaka kwa wantu woseri yawalijimira.”<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kamuukaya mwa Simoni Mfarisayu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Mfalisayu yumu kamshemera Yesu walii shiboga sha pamihi pamuhera nayomberi na Yesu kingiriti mnumba mwa Mfarisayu na kulivaga pasi kuliya shiboga. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Su palushi palii peniti na mdala yakaweriti na makaliru ga vidoda. Kapikaniriti handa Yesu kankuliya shiboga mnumba ya Falisayu, katoliti supa ya alabasta yayiweriti na utuli. <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />Kagenda kagoloka pakwegera pamagulu pa Yesu pakalila na masozi gakuwi gamtulukiriti Yesu pamagulu. Kapukuta magulu ga Yesu kwa vilii zyakuwi na kunonera magulu, kagaswaga utuli. <verse eid="LUK 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Mfalisayu pakawoniti hangu, kalitakuliti pakalihola mumoyu mwakuwi, “Handa muntu ayu nakaka ndo mbuyi gwa Mlungu, hakavimani handa mdala yakakushinkula ka gaa, hakavimani makaliru ga vidoda ntambu yakawera nagu!”<verse eid="LUK 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Yesu kamgambira Mfarisayu uliya, “Simoni, nana shintu shakukugambira.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:40">Simoni kamwankula, “Yina mfunda gung'ambiri.”<verse eid="LUK 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Yesu kamgambira, “Kuweriti na wantu wawili yawamuwanditi muntu yakawandira mpiya. Yumu kawanditi senti zivuwa na yumonga senti zivuwa ndiri. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Pawasinditi kulipa uwanda wawu, muntu uliya kawalekiziya woseri awili. Vinu pakati pa wantu awili walii, yoshi hakamfiri nentu muntu ayu yakawalekiziyiti?”<verse eid="LUK 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Simoni kamwankula, “Nuvimana kuwera, ulii yawamlekiziyiti uwanda mkulu nentu”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:43">Yesu kamgambira, “Gutakula nweri.” <verse eid="LUK 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Kamgalambukira mdala uliya na kumgambira Simoni, “Gumwona mdala ayu? Niziti pakaya paku, gunupa ndiri mashi gakunaviya magulu gangu, kumbiti mdala ayu kaganaviya magulu gangu kwa masozi gakuwi na kumpukuta kwa vilii zyakuwi. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Gwenga gunamsiya ndiri kwa kunonera, kumbiti mdala ayu kwanjira paningiliti kaweriti pakanonera magulu gangu. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Gwenga gunswagaziya ndiri lipaki mumtuwi mwangu, kumbiti mdala ayu kagapakaziya magulu gangu kwa utuli. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Su nukugambira, kwa kufira kwakuwi kukulu kulanguziyiti nakaka kuwera vidoda vivuwa vyakaweriti navyi vilekiziwa. Kumbiti ulii yakalekiziwa padidini kalanguziya kufira padidini hera.”<verse eid="LUK 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Su Yesu kamgambira mdala uliya, “Gulekiziwa vidoda vyaku.”<verse eid="LUK 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Wantu wamonga yawaweriti walivaga pashintalawanda wanjiti kulitakuliziyana weni pawalonga, “Ayu gaa yakaweza kulekiziya vidoda?”<verse eid="LUK 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Kumbiti Yesu kamgambira mdala ulii, “Kujimira kwaku kukulopoziya, gugendi kwa ponga.”<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s">Wadala yawagenditi pamuhera na Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Shaka shimonga Yesu kagenditi mwanja kupitila mlushi na muvijiji pakabwera Visoweru viwagila vya Ufalumi wa Mlungu. Wantumini lilongu na mbili wagenditi pamuhera nayomberi <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />na kuweriti na wadala wamu yawaponiziyitwi washamshera na malweli, Mariya yawamshemiti Magidalena, yawamuusiyiti washamshera saba, <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />Yoana mweni mpalu gwakuwi Kuza yakaweriti mtenda lihengu mkulu gwa Herodi, viraa vilii kuweriti na Susana na wadala wamonga wavua watumiiti vyawaweriti navi kumtanga Yesu na wantumini wakuwi.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfanu gwa Mkweta mbeyu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Matayu 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mariku 4:1-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Wantu waweriti wankumwizira Yesu kulawa kila Iushi na pawaliwoniti pamuhera waweriti lipinga likulu, su yomberi kawagambiriti mfanu agu,<verse eid="LUK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />“Mkweta mbeyu kagenditi kukweta mbeyu. Pakaweriti kankukweta mbeyu, mbeyu zimonga zitulukiti munjira na wagendagenda munjira wazitimbanga na wampongu waziliya. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Zimonga zitulukira mumabuwi ga mulitapaka na pazimeriti kala ziyanja kunyala toziya litapaka liweriti lya mashi ndiri. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Zimonga zitulukiriti mumisontu, pazimeriti, misontu ilii izibabanika na zisinda kukula. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Na mbeyu zimonga zitulukiriti mulitapaka liherepa, zimera na kulera viboga vivuwa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">Yesu kamaliriti kwa kutakula, “Yakana makutu kapikaniri!”<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shakafiriti kufunda mumifanu ayi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Matayu 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mariku 4:10-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Wafundwa wakuwi wamkosiyiti Yesu mana ya mfanu agu, <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />nayomberi kawankula, “Mwenga mpananwa kuumana ubada wa Ufalumi wa Mlungu, kumbiti wamonga wavimana ndiri mpaka nuwagambiri kwa mifanu, su pawalola hapeni wawoni na pawapikanira hapeni wavimani.<verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankutakula mfanu gwa Mkweta mbeyu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Matayu 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mariku 4:13-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />“Mfanu agu ndo gutakula hangu, mbeyu ndo shisoweru sha Mlungu. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Mbeyu zilii zyazitulukiriti munjira mana yakuwi, woseri yawapikanira shisoweru sha Mlungu, kumbiti Shetani kiza na kushiwusiya shisoweru shilii mumyoyu mwawu, su hapeni wajimili na kulopoziwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Mbeyu zyazitulukiriti mulibuwi mana yakuwi woseri yawapikanira ujumbi na kuuwanka kwa nemeru. Kumbiti wahera mishigira mitali, wajimira kwa shaka shididini hera na shaka sha kujeruwa pashiza, waleka shawapikaniriti. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Mbeyu zilii zyaziturukiriti mumisontu mana yakuwi, woseri yawapikaniriti shisoweru sha Mlungu, su lyoga na ulunda na vinoganoga vyawabojola hapeni waleri mabwajubwaju yagakamala. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Na mbeyu zilii zyazitulukiriti mulitapaka liherepa mana yakuwi, woseri yawashipikanira shisoweru sha Mlungu, pawashijimila kwa moyu gwoseri na gwa kujimira. Awa ndo wagangamala mpaka pawalera mabwajubwaju.”<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shikorobuyi shawashigubikiti mulidebi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Mariku 4:21-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />“Wantu hapeni wawashi shikorobuyi na kushigubikira mulidebi ama washituli mulivungu mwa lisaga. Kumbiti hawashituli pampindi pashintambi su wantu pawingira mnumba wawoni kulangala ndaa.<verse eid="LUK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />“Shoseri shawatenditi kwa kufifwa hashiwoneki na shoseri shawatenditi muluwindu hashimaniki kwa woseri.<verse eid="LUK 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />“Mlikali weri, ntambu yampikanira, toziya yakawera na shintu hawamwongeri, kumbiti ulii yakahera shintu ata shilii shakawera nashi hawampoki.”<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mawu na walongu wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Matayu 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mariku 3:31-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Mawu gwa Yesu na walongu wakuwi wamgenderiti, kumbiti wasinda kumsegelera pakwegera toziya ya lipinga lya wantu. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Muntu yumu kamgambiriti Yesu, “Mawu na walongu waku wakunja, wafira wakuwoni.”<verse eid="LUK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Yesu kawagambiriti woseri, “Mawu na walongu wangu ndo woseri yawashipikanira shisoweru sha Mlungu na kushijimira.”<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankulikalipira lyega</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Matayu 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mariku 4:35-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Lishaka limu Yesu pamuhera na wafundwa wakuwi wakweniti muuwatu na kawagambira, “Tuloki litanda, tugendi kumwambu.” Su wanja mwanja. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Pawaweriti wankuloka, Yesu kaweriti na mpota su kagonja. Lyega likulu lyanja kuvuma, mashi ganja kwingira muuwatu, su wawera mukutenduwa, kubidukira mumashi. <verse eid="LUK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Wantumintumi wamgendera Yesu na kumwimusiya, walonga, “Mtuwa, Mtuwa! Twankusokera!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Yesu kimuka, kalikalipira lyega pamuhera na mankapala ga mashi, su vyoseri vyoya na kuweriti kuzindawala jiii. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Kawagambira wantumini wakuwi, “Yakoshi njimiru yenu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">Kumbiti womberi walikangasha na kuwera na lyoga, waligambiziyana weni, “Ayu muntu gwa ntambu gaa? Kalikalipiriti lyega na mawimbi ga mashi na vyoseri vimjimira!”<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kamuponiziya muntu keniti washamshera</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Matayu 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mariku 5:1-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Yesu na wantumintumi wakuwi wendereyiti na mwanja, wasoka kumpwani kwa isi ya Gerasi yapakwegera na Galilaya, kumwambu kulitanda. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Yesu pakasulukiti kumpenku, kaliwoniti na muntu yakeniti washamshera, kamwizira kulawa mulushi. Kwa shaka shivuwa muntu ayu kaweriti kagendagenda shivula na kalikala ndiri ukaya, kumbiti kalikaliti kumapumba. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Pakamwoniti Yesu, kabotanga, kasuntama pamagulu ga Yesu pakalonga kwa liziwu likulu, “Yesu Mwana gwa Mlungu gwa Kumpindi nentu! Gufira kutenda ashi kwa neni? Shondi shondi nukuluwa naguntenda!” <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Kalongiti hangu toziya Yesu kamgambiriti shamshera kamlawi. Shaka shivuwa shamshera ulii kamwigilanga muntu ayu, tembera wantu wamtuliti mushibetubetu, mawoku na magulu gakuwi wagatawiti kwa minyololu kumbiti yomberi kayidumuliti na shamshera kamtugiziyiti kushiwala.<verse eid="LUK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Yesu kamkosiya muntu uliya, “Litawa lyaku gwagani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:30">Yomberi kamwankula, “Litawu lyangu ‘Tuvuwa.’ ” Katakuriti hangu toziya kaweriti na washamshera wavuwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Washamshera wamluwiti Yesu nakawawinga kugenda mulirindi likulu.<verse eid="LUK 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Palii pawaweriti na lipinga likulu lya wamtumbi lya pakwegera, waweriti wakuliya mumpeku mwa mulugongu. Su washamshera wamluwiti Yesu kawajimiri wawayingiri wamtumbi, nayomberi kawajimira. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Washamshera wamlawiti muntu uliya na kugenda kuwayingira wamtumbi. Wamtumbi woseri watugiti pawaserera na kutulukira mumashi na wafuwiti woseri.<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Walolera wa mifugu walii pawawoniti galii yagalawiriti, watugiriti mulushi na muvijiji pawalonga shashilawiriti. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Wantu wiza kulola shashilawiriti na pawaweriti wankumwizira Yesu, wamuwoniti muntu uliya yakeniti na washamshera kalikaliti pakwegera pamagulu ga Yesu, kaweriti kavaliti nguwu na kana mahala, su woseri waweriti na lyoga. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Woseri yawaviwoniti vilii vyavilawiriti wawagambiriti wantu ntambu yakaponiti muntu ulii. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Wantu woseri wenikaya wa lushi lwa Gerasi wamgambiriti Yesu kawuki, toziya waweriti na lyoga nentu. Su Yesu kakwena muuwatu na kuwuka. <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Muntu yawamuusiyiti washamshera kamluwa Yesu pakamgambira, “Nfira kugenda na gwenga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:38">Kumbiti Yesu kamjimira ndiri wagendi pamuhera, su kamgambiriti, <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />“Guwuyi ukaya na katakuli shilii ntambu Mlungu shakakutendiriti.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:39">Su muntu uliya kagenditi kulushi na kutakula ntambu Yesu shakamtendiriti.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nafunda gwa Yairu na mdala yakashinkuliti nguwu ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Matayu 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mariku 5:21-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Yesu pakawuyiti uwega umonga wa litanda, wantu wamshemiriti toziya waweriti wankumuhepelera. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Palaa kiza muntu yawamshema Yairu, kaweriti mkulu gwa numba ya Mlungu. Kasuntama palongolu pa magulu ga Yesu na kumhiga pakamgambira wagendi ukaya kwakuwi, <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />toziya kaweriti na nafunda yumu hera, yakaweriti na mivinja lilongu na miwili su kaweriti kankulwala tashitashi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Yesu pakaweriti kankugendagenda, wantu wambabanika wega zoseri, <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />mngati mwawu kuweriti na mdala yakalwaliti kusuma mwazi mivinja lilongu na mbili, tembera katumiyiti ulunda wakuwi woseri kwa waganga kumbiti wamponiziya ndiri. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Mdala ayu kamfwatiti Yesu kumbeli mulipinga lilii na kashinkuriti lusepi lwa nguwu ya Yesu, su palaa palii kusuma mwazi kwoya. <verse eid="LUK 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Yesu kakosiya, “Gaa kanshinkuliti?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:45">Kila muntu kalemiti na Peteru katakuliti, “Mtuwa, lipinga lya wantu likutindiriti na kukubabanika.”<verse eid="LUK 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Kumbiti Yesu kalonga, “Nuvimana kwana muntu kanshinkula, mana nuvimana makakala ga kuponiziya gantawa.” <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Mdala ulii pakawoniti kaweza ndiri kulififa, su kiza kwa kutetema na kusuntama palongolu pa magulu ga Yesu. Kaweriti kulongolu kwa kila muntu, kamgambiriti ntambu yakamshikuliti na ntambu yakaponiti kamkam hera. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Yesu kamgambira mdala ulii, “Nafunda gwangu, njimiru yaku ikuponiziya. Gugendi kwa ponga.”<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Yesu pakaweriti kankali kankuyowera hangu, mjumbi kiza kulawa kunumba ya Yairu. Kamgambiriti Yairu, “Nafunda gwaku kahowa, nagumgaziya hera Mfunda.”<verse eid="LUK 8:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Kumbiti Yesu pakapikaniriti aga, kamgambira Yairu, “Nagwana lyoga, gujimiri hera hakaponi.”<verse eid="LUK 8:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Pakasokiti pakaya, kabera muntu yoseri kwingira mnumba, ira Peteru na Yohani na Yakobu na tati na mawu gwa mwana yakahowiti. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Kila muntu kaweriti kankulira na kudaya toziya ya nafunda ulii. Yesu kawagambira, “Namlira! Mwana kahowa ndiri ira kagonja hera.”<verse eid="LUK 8:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Wantu woseri wamseka, toziya wavimaniti mwana kahowiti. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Kumbiti Yesu kambata liwoku na kumshema, “Mwana gwangu gwimuki!” <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Ukomu wakuwi umuwuyira, palaa palii kimuka, su Yesu kawagambiriti mawu na tati gwakuwi wamupi shintu shakuliya. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Mawu na tati gwakuwi walikangashiti, kumbiti Yesu kawagambira nawamgambira muntu galii gagatendikiti.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuwatuma Wantumini lilongu na mbili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Matayu 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mariku 6:7-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Yesu kawashemiti wantumini lilongu na mbili pamuhera na kuwayupa makakala na uwezu wa kuwalaviya washamshera woseri na kuponiziya malweri. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Shakapanu kawatumiti wegendi wakabweri visoweru vya Ufalumi wa Mlungu na kuwaponiziya walweli, <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />kayi kawagambira, “Munjira mwamgenda namtola shintu shoseri, namtola lukongoshu ama muhaku, namtola shiboga ama mpiya, ama lishati lya shigubikiru. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Poseri pawawashemerani, mwikali mnumba ilii mpaka pamuwuka muisi ilii, <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />viraa vilii wantu pawalema kuwashemerani mwenga, mwuki mlushi alu na mpukuti lidika lya litapaka mumagulu mwenu haiweri likalipiru kwawomberi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Su wantumintumi wanja mwanja kugenda muvijiji vyoseri, pawabwera visoweru viwagila na kuwaponiziya wantu kila pahala.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupunganika kwa Herodi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Matayu 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mariku 6:14-29</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Mtuwa Herodi mkolamlima gwa Galilaya, kapikaniriti goseri aga gagalawiriti, su gamupunganikiti nentu toziya wantu wamonga watakuliti kuwera Yohani Mbatiza kazyuka. <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />Wamonga watakuliti kuwera Eliya kalawira na wamonga walonga kuwera yumu gwa wambuyi wa makashu wa Mlungu kazyuka. <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Herodi kalonga, “Yohani numdumuliti mtuwi, muntu ayu yampikanira ndo gaa?” Su kendereyiti kumsakula Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuliwapanana shiboga lipinga likulu lya wantu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matayu 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mariku 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yohani 6:1-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Wantumintumi walii pawawuyiti, wamgambiriti Yesu vyoseri vyawatenditi. Yesu kawatola, wagenda gwekayawu lushi lwawalushema Betisayida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Kumbiti lipinga lya wantu pawavimaniti kala aga, wamgenderiti. Yesu kawashemera na kayoweriti nawa visoweru viwagila vya Ufalumi wa Mlungu na kuwaponiziya woseri wawafiriti kuponiziwa.<verse eid="LUK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Mshenji paguweriti gwankuzyeta, wantumini lilongu na awili wamgenderiti na kulonga, “Guwagambiri wantu wagendi, kuvijiji na mumalambu ga pakwegera wakasakuli shiboga pamuhera na pahala pakugonja, toziya pahala panu patuwera pantundu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Kumbiti Yesu kawagambira, “Mwenga muwapanani shintu sha kuliya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">Womberi walonga, “Twana mabumunda muhanu na wasomba wawili hera. Gufira twenga tugendi twakawahemeleri shiboga lipinga lya wantu woseri awa?” <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Wapalu hera yawaweriti palii, waweriti gambira elufu muhanu hangu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Yesu kawagambira wafundwa wakuwi, “Muwagambiri walivagi vipinga vipinga vya malongu muhanu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Su wafundwa pawatenditi kala ntambu yakawagambiriti, <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Yesu katola mabumunda muhanu galii na wasomba wawili, kaloliti kumpindi na kalonga mayagashii Mlungu, kagamega kawapanana wafundwa wakuwi wawagawili wantu. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Wantu waliya mpaka wikuta na wantumintumi wasola majamanda lilongu na mbili ga vilii vyavisigaliti.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Peteru kalonga Yesu ndo Mlopoziya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Matayu 16:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Mariku 8:27-29</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Lishaka limu Yesu kaweriti kankuluwa Mlungu gweka yakuwi, wafundwa wakuwi wamwizira. Su Yesu kawakosiya, “Wantu walonga neni nagaa?”<verse eid="LUK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Womberi wamwankula, “Wamonga walonga gwenga gwa Yohani Mbatiza na wamonga walonga gwenga gwa Eliya na wamonga walonga gwenga gwa mbuyi gwa Mlungu gwa makashu yakahowiti vinu kazyuka.” <verse eid="LUK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Su nayomberi kawakosiya, “Hashi, mwenga mlonga neni nagaa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:20">Peteru kamwankula, “Gwenga gwa Kristu Mlopoziya yagulagaliritwi na Mlungu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Shakapanu Yesu kawalagalira pakalonga nawamgambira muntu yoseri shisoweru ashi.<verse eid="LUK 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kalonga kutabika na kuhowa kwakuwi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Matayu 16:20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30-9:1">Mariku 8:30-9:1</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />Yesu kawagambira, “Mwana gwa Muntu mpaka katabiki na kulemwa na wazewi na watambika wakulu wa numba ya Mlungu na wafunda wa Malagaliru. Hawamlagi, kumbiti lishaka lya tatu kwanjira pakahowiti hakazyuki.”<verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Na kawagambira woseri, “Muntu yoseri pakafira kaweri na neni, mpaka kalilemi mweni, katoli lupingika lwakuwi mashaka goseri na kanfati. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Muntu yoseri yakafira kugaponiziya makaliru gakuwi hakagamili na yoseri yakagamiziya makaliru wakuwi kwa kunfata neni hakagalopoziyi. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Hashi, kwana mbotu gaa muntu pakapata vintu vyoseri vya pasipanu, kumbiti mweni pakagamila? Yina ndiri! <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Muntu pakamonera soni neni pamuhera na mafundu gangu, Mwana gwa Muntu hakamwoneri soni muntu ayu shaka pakiza muukwisa wakuwi na ukwisa wa Tati na ukwisa wa wantumintumi wananagala wa kumpindi. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Nukugambirani nakaka, kwana wamonga palaa panu hapeni wahowi mpaka wauwoni Ufalumi wa Mlungu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kagalambuka nshimba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Matayu 17:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Mariku 9:2-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Palipititi lijuwa kwanjira pakalongiti galiya, Yesu kawatoliti Peteru, na Yohani na Yakobu, kagenditi nawomberi mpaka kulugongu kuluwa Mlungu. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Pakaweriti kankumluwa Mlungu, nshimba yakuwi igalambuka na nguwu zyakuwi ziwera neru mbuu. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Palaa paliya wantu awili waweriti paliya wankuyowera nayomberi. Wantu walii waweriti Musa na Eliya, <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />yawalawiriti muukwisa wa kumpindi kwa Mlungu, waweriti wankuyowera na Yesu ntambu yakugumalilira mpangu gwa Mlungu gwa kuhowa kwakuwi kulii Yerusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Peteru na wayaguwi waweriti wankuhepera, kumbiti wimukiti na kuwona ukwisa wa Yesu na wantu awili wagolokiti pamuhera nayomberi. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Su wantu wawili walii paweriti wankuwuka, Peteru kamgambira Yesu, “Mtuwa, iherepa twenga kulikala panu! Su hatunyawi visasa vitatu, shimu shaku na shamonga sha Musa na shamonga sha Eliya.” Nakaka kavimaniti ndiri shakatakula.<verse eid="LUK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Peteru pakatakuliti hangu, palaa paliya lilawira liwundi lizotopa liwagubika na liwundi ali paliwawiziriti wantumintumi walii weniti lyoga nentu. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Wapikinira liziwu kulawa muliwundi lilonga, “Ayu ndo mwana gwangu yanumsyaguliti, mumpikaniri.”<verse eid="LUK 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Liziwu lyawalipikiniriti palinyamaliti kala, wamwona kayi Yesu kagweka yakuwi. Wantumintumi pawaoniti hangu wanyamalira jii na shaka shilii wamgambira ndiri muntu vilii vyawawoniti.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kamuponiziya Muntemba kana washamshera</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Matayu 17:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Mariku 9:14-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Shirawu yakuwi Yesu pamuhera na wantumintumi watatu pawaweriti wankulawa kulugongu, lipinga likulu lya wantu waliwoniti na Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Muntu yumu mulipinga lilii kabota pakalonga, “Mfunda! Nukuhiga gwakamloli mwana gwangu, mwana gwangu gwa gweka! <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Shamshera kamgaziyaga, pamonga kamtenda katendi umatu na pamonga kamtenda kaweri na shisirika na lifulufulu limlawa mumlomu. Kendereyiti kumgaziya nentu pota nakumlekeziya kanongola. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Nuwaluwiti wafundwa wakuwi wamwusiyi shamshera kumbiti wasinda.”<verse eid="LUK 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Yesu kawankula, “Mwenga shiyiwuku shahera njimiru na shana vidoda! Hashi hankali na mwenga na panuwahepelera mpaka ndii?” Shakapanu kamgambira muntu uliya, “Gumjegi mwana gwaku panu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Muntemba ulii pakaweriti kankumgendera Yesu, shamshera uliya kamgusiya pasi, kumtenda shisirika. Kumbiti Yesu kamkalipira shamshera ulii, kamuponiziya muntemba, su kamupa tati gwakuwi. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Wantu woseri walikangashiti kwa uwezu mkulu wa Mlungu.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 9:43">Yesu kunkuyowera kayi kuusu kuhowa kwakuwi</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Matayu 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mariku 9:30-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Wantu pawaweriti wankali wankulikangasha kila shintu shakatenditi Yesu, yomberi kawagambiriti wafundwa wakuwi, <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />“Namlyaluwa shanuwagambiriti! Mwana gwa Muntu hawambati mumawoku ga wantu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Kumbiti wafundwa werewiti ndiri ntambu yakatakuliti. Shitwatira ashi shiweriti shififwa kwawomberi nawavimani, womberi watira kumkosiya ntambu yakatakuliti.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndo gaa yakaweriti mkulu?</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Matayu 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mariku 9:33-37</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Palawiriti magambiziyanu pakati pawu wantumintumi walii, gaa yakaweriti mkulu nentu. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Yesu kavimaniti shawaliholiti, su kamtola mwana mdidini, kamgolosiya pakwegera na mweni, <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />na kawagambira, “Muntu yoseri ulii yakamshemera mwana mdidini ayu kwa litawu lyangu, kanshemera neni na yoseri yakanshemera neni, viraa kamshemera yumu ulii yakantumiti. Yoseri yakaweriti mdidini pakati penu ndo mkulu kuliku woseri.”<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakawalema ndiri mwenga ndo gwenu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Mariku 9:38-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Yohani kankula, “Mtuwa, tumwoniti muntu pakawusiya washamshera kwa litawu lyaku na twenga tumubera, toziya kaweriti ndiri mushipinga shetu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Yesu kamgambira, “Namuwabera, toziya yoseri yakamlema ndiri yumu pakati penu, kawuwega wa twenga gwenu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wasamaliya walema kumshemera Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Shaka pashiweriti pakwegera sha Yesu mewamtoli kugenda kumpindi, yomberi kagonjera mwanja gwa Yerusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Kawatumiti wajumbi wamlongoleri na womberi wagenda mpaka mushijiji shimu sha Wasamariya, wamnyawili kila shintu. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Kumbiti wenikaya walema kumshemera toziya yomberi kaweriti kankugenda Yerusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Su wafundwa wakuwi, ashina Yohani na Yakobu, pawawoniti hangu walonga, “Mtuwa, gufira tugushemi motu kulawa kumpindi guwagamiziyi?” <verse eid="LUK 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Yesu kawagalambukira na kawakalipira. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Shakapanu Yesu na wafundwa wakuwi wagenditi mushijiji shimonga.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantu yawafira kuwera wafwasi wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Matayu 8:19-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Pawaweriti munjira wankugenda, muntu yumu kamgambira Yesu, “Hanukufati koseri kwagugenda.”<verse eid="LUK 9:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Yesu kamgambira, “Vibweta wawera na mpanga na wampongu wawera na vitukulu kumbiti Mwana gwa Muntu kahera pahala pa kwoyera.”<verse eid="LUK 9:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Kamgambira muntu gwingi, “Gunfati.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:59">Kumbiti muntu ulii kalonga, “Mtuwa, gundeki huti nakamsiri tati gwangu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Yesu kamwankula, “Guwaleki wahowiti wawasiri wayawu wawahowiti. Gwenga gugendi gwakawubweri ufalumi wa Mlungu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Kuweriti na muntu gwingi yakamgambira Yesu, “Hanukufati Mtuwa, kumbiti gundeki huti ng'endi kulonga ne mbuka wantu wa ukaya kwangu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yesu kamgambira, “Muntu yoseri pakanja kulima, pakagalambuka na kulola kumbeli kafaa ndiri kutenda lihengu Muufalumi wa Mlungu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuwatuma malongu saba na mbili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Shakapanu Mtuwa kawasyagula wamonga malongu saba na mbili. Kawatuma wamlongoleri wawili awili wagendi muvijiji vyoseri vyakafira kugenda yomberi. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Kawagambira, “Viboga vya kubena vivuwa, kumbiti wantu wakubena wadidini. Su mumluwi mweni kana lirambu kajegi wantu wakubena mulirambu lyakuwi. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Vinu su mgendi, muvimani handa nankuwatuma mwenga gambira mwawakondolu wawagenda pakati pa wamaminyi. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Namtola muhaku gwakutulila mpiya, ama libegi, ama vilwatu, namumlamsiya muntu yoseri munjira. <verse eid="LUK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />Pamwingira mnumba yoseri, kwanja mtakuli hangu, ‘Ponga iweri mnumba amu!’ <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Handa pakaweriti yakafira ponga, ponga yamwenga hayikali nayomberi, handa ndiri, ponga yamwenga hayiwawuyili mwaweni. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Mwikali mnumba ayi pamliya na kulanda vyawakupanani, toziya yakatenda lihengu kafiruwa shibenamgongu shakuwi. Namgenda mala numba ayi ama yimonga. <verse eid="LUK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Handa pamsoka muisi na wantu pawawashemerani, mlii vyawakupani, <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />muwaponiziyi walweli muisi ilii na muwagambiri wantu, ‘Ufalumi wa Mlungu wapakwegera kwa mwenga.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Kumbiti pamwingila muisi yoseri, wantu pawawalema kuwashemerani, muwuki na mlongi, <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />‘Ata lidika lyalitulemeteriti mumagulu mwetu tulipunda na haliweri likalipiru. Kumbiti muvimani kuwera Ufalumi wa Mlungu wapakwegera.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Nakaka nukugambirani, lishaka lilii Isi ayi hayipati azabu nkulu kuliku ilii ya wantu wa Sodoma.<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shondi kwa Isi ijimira ndiri</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Matayu 11:20-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />“Shondi gwenga Kolazini! Shondi gwenga Betisayida! Handa mauzauza galawiriti kwa mwenga, megalawiri Tiru na Sidoni, wantu wakuwi mewavali nguwu zya maguniya shaka shivuwa na kulivaga mulivu kuleka vidoda vyawatenda. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Mlungu hakawapanani azabu nkulu nentu mulishaka lya kutoza kuliku Tiru na Sidoni. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Na gwenga Kafarinaumu, hagulikwisi mweni mpaka kumpindi kwa Mlungu? Hawakusulusiyi mpaka mulirindi lyalihera upeleru.”<verse eid="LUK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />Yesu kawagambira wantumintumi wakuwi, “Yakawapikanira mwenga kankumpikinira neni na yakawalema mwenga kanema neni, yakanema neni, ndo kamlema ulii yakantumiti.”<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walii malongu saba na awili wankuwuya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Wantumini malongu saba na awili wawuyiti kwa manemu walonga, “Mtuwa, ata washamshera watujimila patuwakalipira kwa litawu lyaku!”<verse eid="LUK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Yesu kawankula, “Numwoniti Shetani pakaguwiti gambira lupanda kulawa kumpindi kwa Mlungu. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Mpikaniri! Nukupani uwezu wa kutimbanga wanjoka na vipinini na uwezu mkulu kwajili ya makakala goseri ga Shetani, kwahera shintu shakuwatenduwa. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Kumbiti namnemelera toziya washamshera wawajimila, ira mnemeleri toziya matawu genu wagalemba kumpindi.”<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Manemu ga Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Matayu 11:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">Matayu 13:16-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Shaka shiraa shilii Yesu kanemeleriti kwa uwezu wa Rohu Mnanagala, kalonga, “Tati, Mtuwa gwa kumpindi na gwa paisi panu! Nonga mayagashii kwaku toziya guwalanguziya walii wahera mahala na guwafifa walii wanaluhala na wanamahala. Yina Tati, ntambu yagufiriti gumweni aga galawili.<verse eid="LUK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />“Tati gwangu kanupiti neni vintu vyoseri. Kwahera muntu yakammana Mwana ira Tati na kwahera yoseri yakammana Tati ira Mwana na yoseri yagagubutulitwi na Mwana.”<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Shakapanu Yesu kawagalambukira wafundwa wakuwi na kuwagambira, “Mbaka waviwona vilii vyamuviwona mwenga. <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Nukugambirani mwenga kuwera wambuyi wa Mlungu na wafalumi wafiriti kugawona galii gamugawoniti mwenga, kumbiti wagawona ndiri na kupikinira ntambu yampikaniriti mwenga kumbiti wapikinira ndiri.”<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfanu gwa Msamariya muheri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Mfunda gwa Malagaliru kiziti na kufira kumjera Yesu. Su kamkosiya, “Mfunda, ntendi ashi mpati ukomu wa mashaka goseri?”<verse eid="LUK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Yesu kamwankula, “Walemba shishi Mumalagaliru Mlungu gakampananiti Musa? Kupikanira ntambu yampikaniriti mwenga kumbiti wapikanira ndiri. Gwenga gugamana hashi?”<verse eid="LUK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Muntu ulii kawankula, “Gumfiri Mtuwa Mlungu gwaku kwa moyu gwaku goseri na kwa rohu yaku yoseri na kwa makakala gaku goseri na kwa mahala gaku goseri na gumfiri muyagu ntambu yagulifira gumweni.”<verse eid="LUK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Yesu kamgambira, “Guwankula weri, gutendi ntambu iraayi hagupati ukomu wa mashaka goseri.”<verse eid="LUK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Kumbiti mfunda gwa Malagaliru kafiriti kuliranguziya handa kahera vidoda, su kamkosiyiti Yesu, “Gwapakwegera gwangu ndo gaa?”<verse eid="LUK 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yesu kamwankula, “Kweniti na muntu yumu yakaweriti kankusuluka kulawa Yerusalemu, kaweriti kankugenda Yeriku. Pakaweriti munjira, wamvamiya wamajambazi wamkoma na kumpoka vintu vyakuwi wamleka kankugalagata nusula kahowi. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Shintu shashilawiti paliya, kweniti na mkulu gwa numba ya Mlungu kaweriti kankupita njira ilailii, kumbiti pakamwoniti muntu yawamkomiti ulii, kalishashara uwega wingi kagenda. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Ntambu ilailii Mlawi kapititi njira ilailii, kumbiti pakamwonit muntu yawamkomiti ulii kalishashariti uwega wing,i su kagenda. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Kumbiti Msamariya yakaweriti kankugenda mwanja kasokiti paliya pakaweriti muntu ulii na pakamwoniti muntu ulii, kamwonera lusungu. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Kamgendera, kampakaziya lipaki pamuhera na divayi muvironda vyakuwi na kumtawa, shakapanu kamkweniziya mupunda gwakuwi, kagenda nayu mpaka mnumba ya kugonja wahenga kamlwaziya. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Shirawu yakuwi kalaviya mpiya mbili kumpanani kananumba ya kufikira wahenga na kamgambira, ‘Gumloleli weri muntu ayu na pambuya hanukulipi shoseri shagutumiyiti kwa muntu ayu.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Yesu kamaliliti kulonga kwa kukosiya, “Ntambu yamlihola, pakati pa wantu watatu awa, ndo gaa kaweri kapakwegera gwa muntu yakakomitwi na majambazi?”<verse eid="LUK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Mfunda gwa Malagaliru kamwankula, “Uliya yakamwoniriti lusungu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Yesu kamgambira, “Gugendi gwakatendi ntambu iraayi.”<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kaukaya kwa Marita na Mariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Yesu pamuhera na wantumintumi wakuwi pawaweriti mumwanja, wingira mushijiji shimu waliwona na mdala yumu yawamshema Marita kamshemera ukaya kwakuwi. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Marita kaweriti na muhasha gwakuwi yawamshema Mariya, yakalivagiti pakwegera pamagulu ga Yesu pakapikanira mafundu gakuwi. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Marita kaweriti kankunyoganyoga na vimonga, su kamgenderiti Yesu na kumgambira, “Mtuwa, iwera hashi gumleka muhasha gwangu kandekeri neni nyoginyogi gweka yangu? Gumgambiri kizi, kantangi!”<verse eid="LUK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Mtuwa kamwankula, “Marita, Marita! Gwankunyoganyoga na kuligaziya na vintu vivuwa, <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />kumbiti shintu shimu hera shifiruwa. Mariya kasyagula shintu shiherepa nentu na kwahera muntu hakampoki.”<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kankufundiza ntambu ya kusali</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Matayu 6:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">Matayu 7:7-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Lishaka limu Yesu kaweriti pahala tunga pakaluwa Mlungu. Pakamaliriti kuluwa Mlungu, yumu gwa wafundwa wakuwi kamgambira, “Mtuwa, gutufundi kuluwa Mlungu gambira Yohani Mbatiza ntambu yakawafunditi wafundwa wakuwi.”<verse eid="LUK 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Yesu kawagambira, “Pamluwa Mlungu mlongi hangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">‘Tati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">Litawu lyaku likwisuwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">Ufalumi waku wizi.<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Gutupanani shiboga shetu sha kila lishaka <verse eid="LUK 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Gutulekiziyi vidoda vyetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:4">Mana twenga tuwalekeziya woseri yawatutenditi upyota.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:4">Pota nagututula mukujeruwa.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Na Yesu kawagambira wantumintumi wakuwi, “Payiwera yumu gwenu pakagenda ukaya kwa ganja gwakuwi pashiru na kumgambira, ‘Ganja, shondi shondi nyagu gunuwandi mabumunda mitatu. <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />Ganja gwangu yakaweriti mumwanja, kapitira pakaya pangu na neni nahera shiboga shakumpanana.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Na payiwera ganja gwaku kankuwankula kulawa mnumba, ‘Nagung'aziya! ligomi litatuwa kala, neni pamuhera na wana wangu tugonja kala. Na hapeni nimuki kukupanani shintu shoseri.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Nakaka nankuwagambirani, ata pakalema kwimuka na kukupanani mabumunda toziya gwenga gwa ganja gwakuwi, kumbiti pagwendereya kumgaziya kwa kumluwa hakimuki na kukupanana shoseri shagufira.<verse eid="LUK 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />“Su nankuwagambira, guluwi na hampananwi, gusakuli na haguwoni, gutendi hodi na hamvugulirwi. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Mana woseri yawaluwa hawapananwi na woseri yawasakula, hawawoni na ligomi halivuguluwi kwa kila muntu yakatenda hodi. <verse eid="LUK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />Mwana pakamluwa tati gwakuwi somba, hashi hakampanani njoka badala ya somba? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Na pakamluwa ligi, hakampanani shipinini? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Su payiwera mwenga yamuwera na vidoda, muvimana kuwapanana viherepa vyawaluwa wana wenu. Nakaka Tati gwenu gwakumpindi hakatendi kupita mwenga, hakawapanani Rohu Mnanagala walii yawamluwa!”<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Belizebuli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Matayu 12:22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Mariku 3:20-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Yesu kaweriti kankumwinga shamshera yakamtenditi muntu yumu kaweri bebi . Su shamshera ulii pakamlawiti, muntu ulii kaweziti kutakula. Lipinga lya wantu lilikangashiti, <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />kumbiti wantu wamu mulipinga lilii walonga, “Belizebuli, mkulu gwa washamshera ndo yakampananiti makakala ga kuwalaviya washamshera.”<verse eid="LUK 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Wamonga wafiriti kumjera Yesu, su wamgambira kawalanguziyi mauzauza kulonga nakaka Mlungu ndo yakamtumiti. <verse eid="LUK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Kumbiti Yesu kavimaniti kala shawalihola, su kawagambira, “Ufalumi woseri waubagulika weni vipinga vipinga vyavisingana vyeni hapeni vilikali, kaya payibagulika yeni mpaka iyagamili. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Su handa ufalumi wa Shetani pawuwera muvipinga na pawalikoma weni, hawuendereyi hashi? Mlonga kuwera ndaviya washamshera toziya Belizebuli kampananiti makakala ga kutenda aga, <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />handa neni nankuwawusiya washamshera kwa likakala lya belizebuli, hashi wafata wenu wawawusiya kwa uwezu wa gaa? Wafata wenu hawaweri watoza wenu! <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Kumbiti payiwera nankuwinga washamshera kwa makakala ga Mlungu, su muvimani kuwera Ufalumi wa Mlungu usoka kala kwa mwenga.<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />“Muntu kana makakala pakawera na silaha zoseri, pakalolera numba yakuwi mweni, vyoseri vyakaweriti navi haviweri salama. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Kumbiti pakiza muntu kana makakala kuliku yomberi pakamkoma na kumsinda, hakatoli silaha zoseri zakalitumbiriti muntu ulii na kugawana ulunda wakuwi.<verse eid="LUK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />“Yoseri yakawera ndiri uwega wa neni ndo nakaka kanema neni na yoseri yakajojinira ndiri pamuhera na neni, ayu ndo kapalasiya.<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwuya kwa shamshera</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Matayu 12:43-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />“Shamshera pakawingwa kulawa kwa muntu, kayerayera mlaa mushiwala pakasakula pakwoyera. Pakapata ndiri pakwoyera, kalitakuziya mweni, ‘Hambuyi kunumba kwangu kwandawiti.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Pakawuya na kwona numba ilii wayifyagira na kuyiherepiziya. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Su kagenda kuwatola washamshera wayaguwi wamonga saba wadoda kuliku yomberi, woseri wagenda kumwingira muntu ayu. Su ntambu ya muntu ayu hayiweri idoda kuliku ntambu yayiweriti kwanja.”<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Manemu ga nakaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Yesu pakaweriti kankutakula hangu, mdala yumu kulawa mulipinga lya wantu kamgambira, “Mbaka mdala yakakuleriti na kukunoniziya!”<verse eid="LUK 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Kumbiti Yesu kamwankula, “Mbaka nentu kwa walii yawapikanira shisoweru sha Mlungu na kushijimira”<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wafira Mawuzawuza</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Matayu 12:38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Lipinga lya wantu palimzingiti Yesu, kendereyiti kutakula, “Shiyiwuku shikondola na shashihera uwaminika kulongolu kwa Mlungu! Mfira mauzauza, kumbiti hapeni mpananwi liuzauza lyoseri lilii ira hampananwi liwuzawuza lya Yona.” <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Ntambu ira ilii Yona mbuyi gwa Mlungu pakaweriti lilangaliru kwa wantu wa Ninawi, su Mwana gwa Muntu hakaweri lilangaliru kwa wantu wa mashaka aga. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Malikiya gwa kusika hakalawili shaka shiyiwuku ashi pashitozwa na yomberi hakawatozi. Toziya mweni kagenditi mwanja kulawa kutali, kiziti kuvipikinira visoweru vya luhala lwa mfalumi Selemani, kumbiti panu kwana mkulu kuliku Selemani! <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Mulishaka lya kutoza, wantu wa Ninawi hawagoloki pamuhera na shiyiwuku ashi na womberi hawashitozi. Toziya wantu wa Ninawi walekiti vidoda vyawatenditi pawamupikaniriti Yona pakabwera, kumbiti panu kwana shitwatila shikulu kuliku Yona.<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gulangala gwa nshimba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:15">Matayu 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">Matayu 6:22-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />“Kwahera muntu yakawasha shikoroboyi na kushigubikira na mulidebi, ira hakashituli pashintambi, su wantu pawingira mnumba wapati kuwona kulangala. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Masu gaku ga gambira shikoloboyi sha nshimba. Masu gaku pagawera makomu, nshimba yaku yoseri hayiweri ilangala, kumbiti masu gaku pagawera gaherepa ndiri, nshimba yaku yoseri hayiweri muluwindu. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Su gwikali weri, gulangala gwaguweriti mngati mwaku naguwera luwindu. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Handa nshimba yaku yoseri paiwera ilangala, pota kuwera pahala poseri pa luwindu, nshimba ayi hayilangali nakaka gambira shikoloboyi ntambu yashikulangalira kwa gulangala wakuwi.”<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuwakalipira Mafalisayu na Wafunda wa Malagaliru</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matayu 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mariku 12:38-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Yesu pakamaliriti kulonga, Mfalisayu yumu kamshemeriti ukaya kwakuwi waliyi shiboga pamuhera, su Yesu kagenditi na kulivaga kuliya shiboga. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Mafalisayu walikangasha pawamwoniti kankuliya shiboga pota kugulula huti mawoku. <verse eid="LUK 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Su Mtuwa kamgambira, “Mwenga Mafalisayu mgulula lwindi na viselu kwa kunja kumbiti mngati mmema lwamata na vidoda. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Mwawazyigizyigi mwenga! Mlungu ndo yakanyawiti kunja, kayi kanyawiti mngati. <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Kumbiti muwayupi wahushu shilii shashiweriti mulwindi na muviselu na kila shintu hashiweri shiherepa kwa mwenga.<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />“Shondi mwenga Mafalisayu! Mwankumupa Mlungu zaka zya binzari na mshisha na mihamba yamonga na uganu pamlema yagamfiriziya Mlungu na ufiru wa Mlungu. Vitwatila avi mfiruwa muviloli weri pota na kulyaluwa vyamonga.<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />“Shondi mwenga Mafalisayu! Mfira kulivaga palongolu pawapapanana ligoya munumba za Mlungu na kukulamsiyani kwa ligoya pahala pa soku. <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />Shondi mwenga! Toziya mulifana na mapumba yagalififa, wantu pawagendagenda kunani kwakuwi pota na kuvimana.”<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Yumu gwa Wafunda wa Malagaliru kamgambira, “Mfunda, pagutakuliti hangu, gutuhigilanga na twenga vilavi.”<verse eid="LUK 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Yesu kamwankula, “Shondi mwenga wafunda wa Malagaliru! Muwatwika wantu visanka vipapika ndiri, kumbiti mwaweni mwenga muweza ndiri ata kwa shala kuwatanga. <verse eid="LUK 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />Shondi mwenga! Mganyawa mapumba gaherepa ga wambuyi wa Mlungu, weni wazewi wenu wawalagiti. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Su mgapitawulira na kugajimira galii gawatenditi wazewi wenu, wawalagiti wambuyi wa Mlungu, na mwenga mugajengera mapumba gawu. <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Toziya ayi Luhala lya Mlungu lutakuliti hangu, ‘Hanuwajegeri wambuyi wa Mlungu na wantumintumi, kumbiti hawawalagi wambuyi wa Mlungu wamu na kuwatabisiya wamonga.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Su wantu wa shaka ashi hawatozwi kwa kuwalaga wambuyi wa Mlungu kwanjira pawanyawiti pasipanu, <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />kwanjira pawamlagiti Abeli mpaka Zakariya ulii yawamlagiti pakati pashitalawanda sha kutambikira, pahala Pananagala. Yina, nakuwagambira, wantu wa shaka ashi hawatozwi kwa matendu gawu.<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />“Shondi mwenga wafunda wa Malagaliru! Muufifa ufunguu ulii wa ligomi gwa mahala na mwaweni mwenga hapeni mwingiri na muwalewelera woseri yawafira kwingira nawingira.”<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Pakaweriti kankuwuka palii, wafunda wa Malagaliru pamuhera na Mafalisayu wanjiti kumgambira pawambeziya nentu na kumkosiya kwajili ya vintu vivuwa, <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />pawajera kumgomiziya pakatakula shintu shipayira su wapati pakumbatira.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s">Likapiru kwajili ufyangu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Matayu 10:26-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Maelufu ga wantu pawaliwoniti pamuhera, ata waweriti wankulitimbanga, Yesu kawagambiriti huti wafundwa wakuwi, “Mliloleri weri na simika ya Mafalisayu, nana mana ufyangu. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Kila shintu shawashigubikiti hashiweri paweru na kila bada hayimaniki. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Su vyoseri vyamtakuliti muluwindu havipikaniriki paluwala, ata vilii vyamulipwepwera shaka pamtatiti ligomi havibwerwi panani pa numba.<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mweni yakafiruwa kumtira</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Matayu 10:28-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />“Nukugambirani waganja wangu, namuwatira woseri yawalaga nshimba kumbiti wasinda kutenda shintu shimonga nentu. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Hanuwalanguziyani gwa kumtira, mumtiri Mlungu, ayu pakawalaga kala kana uwezu wa kumwasira muntu mumotu gwa Jehanamu. Munjimiri, ayu ndo yumu gwa kumtira!<verse eid="LUK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />“Iwera ndiri washomolu wamuhanu wawashuwuza kwa senti ndikandika mbili? Kumbiti Mlungu hapeni kamuwaluwi shomolu ata yumu. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Ata nvili zya mumtuwi mwenu waziwalangiti kala. Su namtira, mwenga wa mana nentu kuliku washomolu wavuwa!<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumjimira ama kumlema Kristu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Matayu 10:32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">Matayu 12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">Matayu 10:19-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />“Nankuwagambira nakaka, kila muntu yakatakula kulongolu kwa wantu kulonga ndo gwaneni, Mwana gwa Muntu hakatakuli kulongolu kwa wantumintumi wa kumpindi wa Mlungu kuwera muntu ayu ndo gwakuwi. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Kumbiti woseri yawanema kulongolu kwa wantu, Mwana gwa muntu viraa hakawalemi kulongolu kwa wantumintumi wa kumpindi wa Mlungu.<verse eid="LUK 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />“Na yoseri Yakamtakulira visoweru vidoda mwana gwa Muntu hakalekiziwi, kumbiti yoseri yakamwigilanga Rohu Mnanagala hapeni kalekeziwi.<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />“Pawawabata na kuwajega munumba za Mlungu, ama kwa wakulu na wakolamlima, namulihola hola ntambu yakutakula ama ntambu ya kujiteteya. <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />Toziya Rohu Mnanagala shaka shiraa shilii hakawafundi ntambu yakutakula.”<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfanu gwa Mlunda mzyigizyigi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Muntu yumu mulipinga lya wantu kamgambiriti Yesu, “Mfunda, gumgambiri mlongu gwangu tugawani uhala yakatulekeriti tati gwetu.”<verse eid="LUK 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Yesu kamwankula, “Ganja gwangu, gaa yakantyeka neni weri mtoza gwenu?”<verse eid="LUK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Su kawagambira woseri, “Muweri masu na muliloli weri na ntambu zoseri za matamata, toziya makaliru ganakaka ga muntu galitumbira ndiri vintu vivuwa vyakawera navi.”<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Yesu kawagambira mfanu agu, “Kuweriti na mlunda yumu yakaweriti na lirambu lyakuwi lyalileriti viboga nentu. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Kanjiti kulihola mumoyu mwakuwi pakalonga, ‘Nahera pahala pa kutula viboga vyangu vyoseri. Su hantendi hashi?’ <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Kaligambiriti mweni, ‘Hantendi hangu, hambomoli hanja zyangu zoseri na kunyawa nkulu nentu, su hantuli viboga vyangu na lunda zyangu zimonga. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Shakapanu hanuligambiri mweni, Muntu yakana bahati! Gwana vintu vivuwa viherepa vya kuliya vinja vivuwa. Guvibojoli, vinu su gulii, gulandi na gulinemiziyi gumweni!’ <verse eid="LUK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Kumbiti Mlungu kamgambira, ‘mzyigizyigi gwenga! Leru pashiru rohu yaku hayitoluwi. Vinu gaa hakatoli vintu vyoseri vyaguvituliti kwajili yaku gumweni?’ ”<verse eid="LUK 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Na Yesu kamaliriti pakatakula, “Ayi ndo ntambu hayiweri kwa muntu ulii yakalitulira ulunda kwajili yakuwi mweni kumbiti hapeni kaweri mlunda kwa Mlungu.”<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gumjimiri ula Mlungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Matayu 6:25-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Yesu kawagambira wafundwa, “Nankuwagambira mleki kulihola hola makaliru genu ama nguwu zya kuvala. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Ukomu wa mana nentu kuliku shiboga na nshimba yana mana nentu kuliku nguwu. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Mloli wampongu, wayala ndiri ama wabenanga ndiri, kayi wahera ata luhanja lwa kutulila viboga, kumbiti Mlungu kawapanana shiboga! Mwenga muwera na mana nentu kuliku wampongu! <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Kwana muntu yoseri pakati penu yakaweza kwongera mweni makaliru gakuwi ata kwa saa yimu? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Handa pamuweza ndiri ata kutenda shintu shididini, iwera hashi mulihola hola vintu vimonga? <verse eid="LUK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />Muloli uluwa wa kuntundu ntambu yagakula, utenda ndiri lihengu ama ulinyawa ndiri weni. Kumbiti nukugambirani kuwera Mfalumi Selemani pamuhera na ulunda wakuwi woseri kapatiti ndiri kuvalisiwa gambira uluwa awu. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Payiwera Mlungu kaluvalusiya luhamba lya kuisi, lweni leru luwera na shirawu walwasila pamotu, ashi ndiri hakawatenderi nentu mwenga? Mwenga yamuwera na njimiru ndidini!<verse eid="LUK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />“Su namuligaziya kwa kusakula shintu sha kuliya ama shintu sha kulanda. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Toziya wantu yawamumana ndiri Mlungu pasipanu wavisakula nentu vintu vyoseri avi. Tati gwenu kavimana mfira vintu avi. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Kumbiti msakuli huti Ufalumi wa Mlungu na hakawapanani vintu avi.<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulunda kumpindi kwa Mlungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Matayu 6:19-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />“Mwenga shipinga shididini namtira, toziya Tati gwenu kafira kuwapanana Ufalumi. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Muwuzi vyoseri vyamuwera navi na muwapanani mpiya wahushu. Mulinyawili mihaku yayidegeka ndiri na mtuli ulunda wenu kumpindi kwa Mlungu, kweni aku hapeni ipungulwi toziya kwahera mpoka yakaweza kwiwa, ama wameyi yawaweza kuhalibisiya. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Ulunda waku pawuwera, ndo na moyu gwaku haguweri.<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantumintumi walikali weri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />“Muweri kala kwa kila shintu shashiza na muviwashi vikoloboyi vyenu, <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />gambira wantumintumi yawamuhepera mtuwa gwawu yakiza kulawa mumsambu gwa ndowa. Pakawera kankwiza na kutenda hodi, su hawamvugulili ligomi kamukamu. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Mbaka kwa walii wantumintumi, mtuwa gwawu pakiza hakawawoni wankali masu! Nukugambirani nakaka, hakavuli nguwu yakuwi, nakuwagambira walivagi pasi na kuwatendera. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Hawaweri na manemu ga ntambu gaa handa pakawawona wankali masu, ata pakiza pashiru ama pamandawira! <verse eid="LUK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />Muvimani nakaka kuwera handa mweni kana numba pakavimaniti shaka shakwiza mpoka, hapeni kamleki mpoka kubomolanga numba yakuwi. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Na mwenga viraa, muweri kala, toziya Mwana gwa Muntu hakizi shaka shamumana ndiri.”<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wantumintumi waminika na waminika ndiri</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Matayu 24:45-51</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Peteru kamgambira, “Mtuwa, mfanu agu ndo kwajili ya twenga, ama kwajili ya kila muntu?”<verse eid="LUK 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Mtuwa kawankula, “Ndo gaa yakawera ntumintumi kaaminika na yakana mahala? Ndo ulii mtuwa gwakuwi yakamtula kaweri mlolera gwa numba na kuwapanana wantumintumi wamonga wa mtuwa gwakuwi kwa shaka shifaa. <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Mbaka yakuwi ntumintumi ulii, mtuwa gwakuwi pakawuya hakamwoni pakatenda hangu. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Nakaka nukugambirani, mtuwa hakampanani ukulu gwa vintu vyakuwi vyoseri. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Kumbiti handa ntumintumi pakalitakulila mweni mumoyu, kuwera mtuwa gwakuwi kakawa shaka shivuwa nentu kwiza, su kanja kuwakomanga wantumintumi wamonga, woseri wapalu pamuhera na wadala, su kalanda na kuliya shiboga pamuhera na kulanda ujimbi, <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />shakapanu mtuwa gwakuwi ntumintumi ulii hakizi lishaka na shaka shakashimana ndiri. Mtuwa hakamdumuli vipandi vipandi na kumwasira kunja na kumtula mushipinga shimuhera na yawajimira ndiri.<verse eid="LUK 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />“Ntumintumi yakavimana shakafira mtuwa gwakuwi kutenda, kumbiti kawera ndiri kala kutenda, hawamkomi nentu. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Kumbiti ntumintumi yakavimana ndiri shilii shakafira mtuwa gwakuwi, na viraa katenda shilii shimtenda wamkomi, hawamkomi padidika. Yawampananiti vivuwa hawamdayi vivuwa, kumbiti yawampananiti vivuwa nentu hawamdayi vintu vivuwa nentu.<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndo shanjiru sha wantu kupalanganyiya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Matayu 10:34-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />“Niza kukoziya motu pasipanu, hera hangu meguweri gwakiti kala! <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Nana ubatizu weni nfiruwa nuwanki na ntabika nentu mpaka ukamiliki. <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Mulihola niza kujega ponga pasipanu? Ndala, kumbiti niza kupalanganyiya. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Kwanjira vinu na kwendeleya kaya ya wantu wamuhanu hawapalanganyiki na wantu watatu hawalisingani kwa wantu wawili na wantu wawili hawalisingani kwa wantu watatu. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Watati hawalisingani na wana wawu na wana hawalisingani na watati na wamawu hawawalemi wahinga wawu na wahinga hawawalemi wamawu na wanahonga hawawalemi wamika mwana na wamika mwana hawawalemi wanahonga wawu.”<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kushimana shaka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Matayu 16:2-3</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Yesu viraa kawagambiriti wantu, “Pamuwona liwundi lilawira kushana, mala mlonga hakatowi na nakaka vula itowa. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Pamuwona lihemuhemu lya kusika lyankuvuma, mlonga hakuweri na mshenji na nakaka iwera. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Mwawafyangu mwenga! Muvimana kutunga lishaka ntambu yaliwera kwa kulola isi na liyera, kumbiti kwa ntambu gaa muvimana ndiri mana ya shaka ashi?”<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gulikoli mawoku na mngondu gwaku</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Matayu 5:25-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />“Ntambu gaa msinda kuamuwa maweni kutenda shitwatira shiheri? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Handa mstaki gwaku kankukujega pashiyotera motu , iherepa nentu mulikoli mawoku pamuhera mwankali munjira. Pamutenda ndiri hangu, nakakujega kwa mtoza mweni hakakujegi kwa wamanjagila na womberi hawakutuli mushibetubetu. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Nakaka nukugambira hapeni gulawi mulii mpaka gulipi ata ligwala lya kumalalira.”<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s">Mleki vidoda ama hamuhowi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Shaka shilii wantu wamu yawaweriti palii wamgambiriti Yesu kwajili wantu wa Galilaya weni Pilatu kawalagiti pawaweriti wankulaviya tambiku kwa Mlungu. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Yesu kawakosiya, “Toziya wantu wa Galilaya wawalagiti kwa njira ilii, mlihola kuwera waweriti na vidoda kuliku wantu wa Galilaya wamonga? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Neni nonga, ndala! Nukugambirani kuwera handa pamlema kuleka vidoda vyamtenda, hamhowi ntambu yawahowiti womberi. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Ntambu gaa kwajili ya wantu lilongu na wanani wa Silowamu yawahowiti shaka mnara paguwatulukiriti? Mlihola kuwera womberi waweriti wanavidoda kuliku wantu wamonga yawalikala Yerusalemu? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Ndala! Nukugambirani mwenga, handa pamlema kuleka vidoda vyamtenda, hamhowi ntambu yawahowiti womberi.”<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfanu gwa mtini wagulera ndiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Su Yesu kawagambiriti mfanu agu, “Kuweriti na muntu yumu, keniti na mtera gwa tini mulirambu lyakuwi. Kagenditi kwapa tini mumtera kumbiti kapata ndiri. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Su kamgambiriti ntumintumi gwa lirambu, ‘Guloli, kwa mivinja mitatu paniza kwapa mabwajubwaju mumtera gwa tini, kumbiti nugawona ndiri. Gugudumuli! Toziya gumalira hera litapaka.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Kumbiti ntumintumi kamgambira, ‘Mtuwa, guguleki huti kwa shinja shimu hera, hanugulimili na kugulekera mbotu. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Pagulera mabwajubwaju shinja shankwiza, hayiherepi nentu, kumbiti pagulera ndiri su guweza kugudumula.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kamuponiziya mdala yumu mulishaka lya koyera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Yesu kaweriti munumba ya Mlungu mulishaka lya kwoyera pakafunda. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Palii peniti na mdala yakeniti na shamshera yakamtenda kalwali mivinja lilongu na nane, kaweriti na shibyongu ata kasinditi kugoloka. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Yesu pakamwoniti kamshema, “Mawu, su guponiziwa ulweli waku!”<verse eid="LUK 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Kamtulila mawoku gakuwi, na palaa palii shibyongu shihuka na kawera safi, su kamkwisiti Mlungu.<verse eid="LUK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Mkulu gwa numba ya Mlungu kaweriti kakalala Yesu pakamponiziyiti mulishaka lya kwoyera, su kawagambiriti wantu, “Kwana mashaka sita gamuweza kutenda lihengu, mwizi mumashaka aga muponiziwi malweli genu, namwiza Mulishaka lya kwoyera!”<verse eid="LUK 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Mtuwa kamwankula, “Gwamfyangu gwenga! Ndo gaa pakati penu mekamvuguli ng'ombi ama punda gwakuwi kulawa mulizizi na kumtenda kalandi mashi ata payiwera lishaka lya kwoyera? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Vinu su peni panu kwana muhinga gwa Aburahamu ndomweni Shetani kamtenda shibyongu kwa mivinja lilongu na nane, su iherepa ndiri kumponiziya mulishaka lya kwoyera?” <verse eid="LUK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Kuwankula kwakuwi kuwatenditi wadoda wawoni soni weni, kumbiti wantu wamonga wanemeleriti toziya ya vitwatira vyakatenditi.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfanu gwa mbeyu ndidini nentu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Matayu 13:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mariku 4:30-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Yesu kakosiyiti, “Ufalumi wa Mlungu ulifana na shishi? Nuufaniziyi na shintu gaa? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Ulifana hangu. Muntu katola mbeyu ndidini nentu ya haradali na kuyala mulirambu. Mbeyu imera na kuwera mtera, na wampongu wiza na kunyawa vitukulu vyawu mumitambi.”<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfanu gwa simika</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:33">Matayu 13:33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Kayi Yesu kakosiya, “Hanuufaniziyi Ufalumi wa Mlungu na shintu gaa? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Ulifana na simika yakatoliti mawu yumu na kuyihanganyiya pamuhera na ubumu vipimu vitatu, su ubumu woseri ututumuka.”<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ligomi lididini</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Matayu 7:13-14</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">21-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Yesu kendereyiti na mwanja gwakuwi kugenda muisi na muvijiji, pakafunda wantu na pakanyawa njira yakuwi kugenda Yerusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Muntu yumu su kamkosiya, “Mtuwa, wantu hawawalopoziyi ndo wadidini hera?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">Yesu kawagambiriti, <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />“Mkamaliri nentu kwingira muligomi lididini, toziya wantu wavuwa hawajeri nakaka kwingira kumbiti hapeni wingiri. <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Mkulu gwa numba hakimuki na kutata ligomi , mwenga hamgoloki kunja na kwanja kukota ligomi na kulonga, ‘Mtuwa, mtuwa! Gutuvuguliri ligomi !’ Nayomberi hakawankuli, ‘Nuwamana ndiri mwenga na pamlawa!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Su mwenga hamwankuli, ‘Tuliya na kulanda pamuhera na gwenga, na gwenga gutufunditi muisi yetu!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Kumbiti yomberi kayi hakalongi, ‘Nupamana ndiri pamlawa. Muwuki kulawa kwaneni mwoseri mtenda vidoda!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />Su panu hamulili na kugayagaya menu genu pawakwasirani kunja na hamuwaloli Aburahamu na Isaka na Yakobu na wambuyi wa Mlungu Muufalumi wa Mlungu! <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Wantu hawizi kulawa kwagulawa mushenji na kwaguzyeta mushenji, kulawa kushana na kusika, su hawaweri mumsambu Muufalumi wa Mlungu. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Su woseri yawawera wa upeleru hawaweri wa kwanja, na woseri yawawera vinu wa kwanja hawaweri wa upeleru.”<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ufiru wa Yesu kwa Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Matayu 23:37-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Shaka shilaa shiliya Wamafalisayu wamu wamwiziriti Yesu na kumgambira, “Gufiruwa guwuki panu na gugendi pahala pingi, toziya Herodi kafira kakulagi gwenga!”<verse eid="LUK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Yesu kawankula, “Mgendi mwakamgambiri shibweta ulii hangu, ‘Nankuwalaviya washamshera na kuwaponiziya walweli leru na shilawu, na lishaka lya tatu hamalili lihengu lyangu.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Vila vilii mpaka weri mumwanja leru, na shilawu, na lishaka limonga, toziya iherepa ndiri kwa mbuyi gwa Mlungu wamlagi kunja kwa Yerusalemu.<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />“Yerusalemu! Shondi shondi Yerusalemu bamu! Guwalaga wambuyi wa Mlungu, guwagumanga kwa mabuwi walii yawatumitwi kwaku! Shaka zivuwa nfira kuwatula wana waku mumawoku mwangu gambira nkuku pakavigupika vyana vyakuwi kwa mbapatiru zyakuwi, kumbiti gwenga gunema! <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Su hawakulekeli gumweni numba yaku. Nukugambira nakaka gwenga hapeni muwoni mpaka shaka shiza pamtakula, ‘Mlungu gumtekeleri ulii yakiza mulitawu lya Mtuwa.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kamuponiziyiti muntu yakalwala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Lishaka limu lya kwoyera, Yesu kagenditi kuliya shiboga kwa yumu gwa walongoziya wa Mafalisayu, na wantu yawaweriti palii waweriti wankumlola handa hakatendi shishi. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Muntu kana magulu na mawoku gakuwi gatutuma, kamwiziliti Yesu, <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />na Yesu kawakosiyiti wafunda wa Malagaliru na Mafalisayu, “Hashi, Lilagaliru lya twenga litulekeziya kuponiziya mulishaka lya kwoyera?”<verse eid="LUK 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Kumbiti womberi watakula ndiri shintu. Yesu kamshinkula muntu ulii na kumponiziya na kamleka kagendi zyakuwi. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Su kawagambira, “Kwana muntu yoseri pakati penu yakawera na mwana ama ng'ombi yakapatukiliti mulirindi mulishaka lya kwoyera su hapeni kamlaviyi toziya ya lishaka lya kwoyera?”<verse eid="LUK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Woseri wasinda shakutakula, su wanyamalira jii.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukalamuka na Unanagala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Yesu kaloliti wahenga wamu ntambu yawasyagula pahala paherepa nentu, su kawagambira woseri mfanu agu, <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />“Muntu yoseri pakakushemerani mumsambu gwa ndowa, namulivaga pahala paherepa nentu. Mana pamonga kwana muntu yakawera mkulu kuliku gwenga wamshemera, <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />Na ulii mwenikaya kakugambili, ‘Gumlekeli shigoda ayu.’ Su palii haguwoni soni na hagugendi kulivaga pahala pa upeleru. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Ira pagushemelwa, gugendi na kulivaga pahala pa upeleru, su mweni kaya gwaku hakizi kwaku na kukugambira, ‘Ganja gwangu, gwizi uganu, pahala paherepa ng'anji.’ Palii hagupananwi ligoya palongolu pa wahenga wamonga woseri. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Kwa woseri yawalikweniziya hawawasulusiyi, na woseri yawalisulusiya weni hawawakweniziyi.”<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Shakapanu Yesu kamgambira na ulii yakamshemera, “Handa pagutenda msambu paliwala ama pashiru naguwashemera waganja waku ama walongu waku ama wapakwegera waku, toziya hawakushemeri na gwenga vira, na kwanjira ayi hagupati shilii shagutenditi kwawu. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Gwenga pagutenda msambu, guwashemeli wahushu, na wavibyeketu, na wana lwisi, <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />na hagutekelelwi, toziya hapeni wakulipi shilii shagutenditi kwawu. Mlungu hakakulipi gwenga mulishaka lya wantu waheri pawazyuka.”<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfanu gwa Msambu Mkulu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Matayu 22:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Yumu gwa wantu yawalivagiti kulongolu kwa shitalawanda kapikaniriti aga, kamgambiriti Yesu, “Mbaka woseri hawawalivagi mumsambu Muufalumi wa Mlungu!”<verse eid="LUK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Yesu kamgambira, “Kwana muntu yumu yakatenditi msambu mkulu na kawashemiriti wantu wavuwa. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Payiweriti shaka sha msambu, kawatumiti wantumintumi wakuwi wagendi wakawagambiri walii yawashemiritwi, ‘Wizi, toziya kila shintu shiwera kala!’ <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Kumbiti wantu woseri, yumu pa yumonga wanjiti kulonga toziya ya kuleka kwiza. Muntu gwa kwanja kamgambiriti ntumintumi, ‘Hemeriti lirambu su nfiruwa ng'endi nukaliloli, su nduwa hapeni nizi.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Muntu gwingi katakula, ‘Hemeriti wang'ombi lilongu limu na nankugolokera kugenda kuwajera mulirambu, su nduwa hapeni nizi!’ <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Na yumonga katakula, ‘Neni nyuga mdala, su hapeni nizi.’<verse eid="LUK 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />“Su ntumintumi kawuya na kumgambira goseri mtuwa gwakuwi. Mtuwa ulii kakalaliti nentu na kumgambira ntumintumi gwakuwi, ‘kanongola gugendi munjira na muvipenyu vya muisi, gwakawajegi wahushu, na wavibyeketu na wanalwisi wavibyeketu wamonga.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Pamberi ntumintumi kalonga, ‘Mtuwa, vitwatira vitendeka ntambu yagutakuliti, kumbiti mwana fasi mnumba.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Su mtuwa kamgambiriti ntumintumi, ‘Gugendi munjira na muvipenyu, guwagambiri wantu mpaka wizi, su numba yangu hayimemi. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Nukugambira nakaka kwahera muntu ata yumu pakati pa walii yawawashemeriti hakalambi ata tyee shiboga shaneni!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Galama ya kuwera ntumintumi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Matayu 10:37-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Palii lipinga likulu paliweriti lyankugenda pamuhera na Yesu, yomberi kagalambuka na kuwagambira, <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />“Woseri yawiza kwa neni uganu wawafira tati na mawu wawu, wadala na wana, walongu na wadada wawu, ama womberi, hapeni waweri wafundwa waneni. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Woseri yawatola ndiri lupingika lwawu weni na kunfata hapeni waweri wafundwa wangu.”<verse eid="LUK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />“Handa yumu pakati pa mwenga yakafira kunyawa mnara, kwanja kalivaga huti pasi na kulihola galama zakuwi, pakalola handa kana mpiya zitosha za kumalira lihengu. <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Handa gwahera mpiya, pagunyawiti liyanjiru hapeni guwezi kumalira kunyawa mnara, na woseri pawalola galii gagalawiriti hawakuseki. <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />Womberi hawalongi, ‘Muntu ayu yakanjiti kunyawa mnara kasinda kumalira lihengu!’<verse eid="LUK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />“Mfalumi yakawera na wantu elufu lilongu limu pakagenda kumkoma mfalumi yumonga yakawera na wantu elufu malongu mawili, mpaka huti yomberi kalivagi kulihola handa kana makakala ga kuukoma ufalumi umonga. <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Handa pakahera makakala, hakawatumi wajumbi waliwoni na mfalumi yumonga, kumkosiya mashaliti ga ponga uganu yomberi kankali ka kutali.” <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Yesu kamaliriti kwa kutakula, “Ntambu ira ayi kwahera ata yumu pakati penu hakaweri mfundwa gwangu mpaka huti guleki kila shintu shakaweriti nashi.<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Munu gunoga ndiri</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5:13">Matayu 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mariku 9:50</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />“Munu guherepa, kumbiti munu pagukola ndiri kwahera njira ya kugutenda gukoli kayi. <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Su gufaa ndiri ata pawitira mulitapaka ama kuwera mbotu, hawagwasi kutali. Yakana makutu kapikaniri!”<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s">Mfanu gwa kondolu yakagamiriti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Matayu 18:12-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Lishaka limu watola kodi wavua pamuhera na wanavidoda wiziti kumpikinira Yesu, <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Wamafalisayu na wafunda wa Malagaliru wanjiti kung'ong'a, mumoyu mwawu, walonga, “Muntu ayu kuwashemera wanavidoda na ata kuliya pamuhera na womberi!” <verse eid="LUK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Su Yesu kawagambira mfanu agu,<verse eid="LUK 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />“Yumu pakati penu pakawera na wakondolu miya na pagwerewa yumu kagamila, hagutendi ashi? Haguwaleki walii wakondolu malongu tisa na tisa kuntundu na kugenda kumsakula kondolu ulii yakagamiliti mpaka gumwoni. <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Pagumwona hagunemeleli nentu na hagumpapi mumakombi mwaku <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />na kuuya nayu ukaya. Shakapanu pagusoka ukaya, haguwashemi waganja waku na wapakwegera pamuhera na kuwagambira, ‘Nana shereku shereku nentu toziya numwona kondolu gwangu yakagamiliti. Su tunemeleli pamuhera !’ <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Ndo ntambu ira ayi, nukugambirani haiweri nemeru nentu kumpindi kwa yakatenda vidoda yumu pakaleka vidoda vyakatenditi kuliku wantu malongu tisa na tisa yawamfiriziya Mlungu, ndoweni yawalihola wahera vidoda vyakuleka.<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mpiya yaiyagamiliti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />“Ama payiwera mdala yumu yakawera na magwala lilongu limu na ligwala limu paliyagamila, su hakatendi ashi? Hakawashi shikoloboyi, hakafyagili numba yakuwi na kusakula weri kila pahala mpaka kaliwoni. <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Handa pakayiwona kala, ndo hakawashemi waganja wakuwi na wapakwegera pamuhera na kuwagambira, ‘Nana nemeli nentu toziya mona mpiya yaiyagamiliti. Su tunemeleli pamuhera !’ <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Nankuwagambira nakaka ndo hera hangu, wantumintumi wa kumpindi kwa Mlungu hawanemeleri toziya ya muntu yumu yakatenda vidoda pakaleka vidoda vyakatenditi.”<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwana yakagamiriti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Yesu kendereyiti kulonga, “Kwanaga muntu yumu yakaweriti na wana wawili wapalu. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Muhasha kamgambiriti tati gwakuwi, ‘Tati gunupi vinu uhala wangu.’ Su muntu ulii kawagawira sawa wana wakuwi awili. <verse eid="LUK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />Gapita ndiri mashaka gavuwa muhasha ulii kashuwuza uhala wakuwi woseri, shakapanu kawuka ukaya kagenda zakuwi na mpiya zakapatiti. Kagenditi isi ya kutali kweni aku su katumiyiti mpiya zilii vuluvulu. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Kamaliriti kila shintu shakaweriti nashi. Su ilawira njala na kueneya muisi yoseri, na yomberi kaweriti kahera shintu. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Su kagenditi kutenda lihengu kwa muntu yumu gwa isi ilii, mweni kamtuliti mulirambu lyakuwi kuwalolera wamtumbi. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Kafiriti kuliya viboga vyawalekiti wamtumbi, toziya kwahera muntu yakampananiti shintu shakuliya. <verse eid="LUK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />Upeleru kanjiti kulihola mumoyu na kutakula, ‘Wantumintumi wa tati gwangu waliya viboga mpaka waleka, pahala panu neni nankufuwa njala! <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Hambuyi kwa tati gwangu na kulonga, Tati, ntenda vitendu vifaa ndiri kwa Mlungu na kwaku viraa. <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Neni nfaa ndiri kushemuwa mwana gwaku, guntendi neni gambira yumu gwa wantumintumi waku.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Su kanjiti mwanja kuwuya ukaya kwa tati gwakuwi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">“Pakaweriti kankali kakutali kulawa ukaya, kumbiti tati gwakuwi kamwoniti kala, su moyu gwakuwi gumwoniliti lusungu, su kumtugira na kamkisikira mwana gwakuwi na kumnonera. <verse eid="LUK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />Mwana ulii kamgambira tati gwakuwi, ‘Tati, neni numkosera Mlungu na gwenga viraa. Nfaa ndiri kunshema namwana gwaku.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Kumbiti tati gwakuwi kawashemiti wantumintumi wakuwi na kawagambira, ‘Kanongola! Mtoli nguwu ziherepa nentu mumvalisiyi na pete mvalisiyi mushyala na mumvalisiyi vilwatu mumagulu. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Shakapanu mgendi mwakamleketuli ndama kaherepa tuliyi, na tunemeleli mumsambu! <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Toziya mwana gwangu kahowiti, kumbiti vinu kazyuka, kaweriti kagamila, kumbiti leru kawoneka.’ Su wanjiti kuvina msambu.<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />“Shaka shilii mkulu gwakuwi kaweriti kankali keniwuyi kulirambu. Pakaweriti munjira pakwegera na ukaya kwakuwi kankuwuya, kapikaniriti zilaa shereku na ng'oma. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Su kamshemiti yumu gwa wantumitumi na kamkosiya, ‘Kwana shishi pakaya panu?’ <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Ntumintumi ulii kamwankula, ‘Mlongu gwaku kawuya pakaya panu, su tati gwaku kamleketulira lindama likulukulu, toziya kamwona kankali mkomu.’<verse eid="LUK 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />“Su muntemba mkulu ulii kakalariti nentu, kalemiti kwingira mnumba, su tati gwakuwi kalawiti kunja na kamgambira kingiri. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Kumbiti yomberi kamwankula tati gwakuwi, ‘Guloli, mivinja yoseri ayi nukutendera lihengu gambira ntumintumi, na ng'enda ndiri shinyumi na lilagaliru lyaku. Gunupa shishi neni? Pota na kunupa mbuzi ntendi msambu pamuhera na waganja wangu! <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Kumbiti leru kiza mwana gwaku ayu yakatumiyiti ulunda waku woseri pamuhera na wandiyandiya, na pakawuyiti pakaya panu, gwenga gumleketulira ula ndama likulukulu!’ <verse eid="LUK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />Tati gwakuwi kamwankula, ‘Mwana gwangu, gwenga gulikala pahala panu na neni mashaka goseri, vinu vintu vyoseri vyanwera navyi ndo vya gwenga. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Kumbiti tufiruwa tuvini msambu na kunemelera, toziya mlongu gwaku kahowiti, kumbiti vinu kazyuka, kaweriti kagamila, kumbiti vinu kawoneka.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s">Kalani yakaweriti na pyera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Yesu kawagambiriti wafundwa wakuwi, “Kwanaga na mlunda ayu yakaweriti na mfundwa yakalolera ulunda wakuwi. Mlunda mali ulii wamgambiriti kuwera yakalolera ulunda wakuwi kaweriti kankuyananga mpiya. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Su mlunda ulii kamshema na kumgambira, ‘Avi ndo vitwatira gaa vyampikinira kwaku, gung'ambiri ntambu yagutumiyiti mpiya zyangu, toziya hapeni guweri mlolera ulunda gwangu kayi.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Mlolera ulunda kaligambira mweni, ‘Mtuwa gwangu hakanwingi mlihengu lyangu. Hantendi ashi? Neni nahera makakala ga kulima, viraa nana soni kuluwaluwa. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Vinu nuvimana hantendi ashi! Su pakanwinga lihengu, haweri na waganja weni hawanshemeli ukaya kwawu.’<verse eid="LUK 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />“Su kawashemiti wantu woseri weni mtuwa gwakuwi kaweriti kankuwadayi. Kamkosiyiti gwa kwanja, ‘Gwenga mtuwa gwangu kakushonga mpiya ninga?’ <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Yomberi kamwankula, ‘Mapipa miya ga lipaki lya zeyituni.’ Mlolera ulunda kamgambira, ‘Aga ndo mawalangu gaku, gulivagi pasi, gulembi lilongu mhanu.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Shakapanu kamkosiya kayi yumonga, ‘Na gwenga wakushonga mpiya ninga?’ Yomberi kamwankula, ‘Mihaku elufu ya nganu.’ Mlolera ulunda kamgambira, ‘Aga ndo mawalangu gaku, gulembi miya nane.’<verse eid="LUK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />“Su mtuwa ulii kamzyumiti nentu mlolera ulunda yakaweriti kana pyera katumiyiti luhala, toziya wantu wa pasipanu wana luhala ng'anji muvitwatira vyawu kuliku wantu wa muweru.”<verse eid="LUK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Yesu kendereyiti kulonga, “Su nukugambirani mwenga, Mtendi uganja kwa kutumiya vintu vya pasipanu, su paviwapelerani hawawashemeri mnumba ya mashaka goseri. <verse eid="LUK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />Muntu yoseri pakajimira mushintu shididini, hakaweri mjimira muvintu vikulu viraa, na muntu pakajimira ndiri mushintu shididini hapeni kajimiri mushintu shikulu. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Handa mwenga pamujimirika ndiri kwa vintu vya pasipanu, ndo gaa hakawapanani vintu viwagira vya nakaka? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Na handa mwenga pamuwera waminika ndiri kwa vintu vya wantu wamonga, ndo gaa hakakupani vintu vyenu maweni?<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />“Kwahera ntumintumi yakaweza kuwatendera lihengu watuwa wawili, toziya Ntumintumi hakamlemi ayu na kumfira yumonga, ama hakaweri na yumu na kumleka yumonga. Hapeni mwezi kumtendera Mlungu na shaka shila shilii guyitendera mpiya.”<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gakatakulaga Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Matayu 11:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">Matayu 5:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mariku 10:11-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Mafalisayu pawapikaniriti goseri aga, wamkaliriti Yesu toziya womberi wafiraga mpiya. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Yesu kawagambira, “Mwenga mlilanguziya waheri kulongolu kwa wantu, kumbiti Mlungu kayimana myoyu yenu. Kwa shintu shilii shashiwoneka shana mana nkulu kulongolu kwa wantu, Mlungu kashiwona kuwera shinyankalika.<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />“Lilagaliru lya Musa na malembu ga wambuyi wa Mlungu gaweriti mpaka shaka sha Yohani Mbatiza, kwanjira palii Visoweru viwagila vya Ufalumi wa Mlungu wankubwerwa, su kila muntu kankwingira kwa makakala. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Kumbiti ndo ikamala ndiri kumpindi na pasipanu kwagamira kuliku lilembu lididini lya Lilagaliru kuliwusiya.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />“Muntu yoseri pakamleka mdala gwakuwi na kuyuga mdala gwingi katenda uhumba, na muntu pakamuyuga mdala yawamlekiti viraa katenda uhumba.<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlunda na Lazaru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />“Paweriti na muntu yumu yakaweriti mlunda, yakavaliti nguwu zya beyi nkulu nentu na kaweriti kankubojola mashaka goseri. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Vilaa vilii kuweriti muntu muhushu yawamshema Lazaru, yakaweriti na vironda nshimba yoseri, mweni kalikaliti paligomi lya mlunda. <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />Pakafira kuliya masigalu ga viboga vyavitulukiriti pasi pashitalawanda pa mlunda. Ata wang'ang'a wiziti na kulambita vironda vyakuwi!<verse eid="LUK 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />“Muhushu pakahowiti kala, wantumintumi wa kupindi wamtoliti na kumtula pakwegera na Aburahamu mumsambu kulaa kumpindi. Na mlunda kahowiti viraa na wamsira, <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />na kagenda pahala yapaweriti kwana ntabiku nentu mulirindi lyalihera upeleru, na pakaloliti kamwoniti Aburahamu kwa kutali pamuhera na Lazaru kapakwegera. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Su kanjiti kushema, ‘Tati Aburahamu! Nyagu gumoneri lusungu bamu. Gumtumi Lazaru kajobi shala shakuwi mumashi, kizi kaluzizimisiyi lulimi lwangu, toziya nulikala mundabiku nentu mumotu amu!’<verse eid="LUK 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />“Kumbiti Aburahamu kamgambira, ‘Guliholi mwana gwangu paguweriti gwamkomu gupatiti vintu vyoseri viherepa, kumbiti Lazaru kapatiti vintu vidoda vyoseri. Kumbiti vinu kankunemelera panu, na gwenga gwankutabika. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Pamuwera na goseri aga, pakati petu panu kwana lirindi likulu nentu, su kwa woseri yawafira kwiza kwa twenga hapeni wawezi, ama kwahera muntu yakaweza kulawa kwenu kwiza uganu ama kwa twenga kwiza kwa mwenga.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Mlundamali kalonga, ‘Nyagu nukuluwa tati Aburahamu, gumtumi Lazaru kagendi ukaya kwa tati gwangu, <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />kwana walongu wangu wamuhanu. Kagendi kawaberiziyi nawiza uganu panu pahala pa ndabiku.’<verse eid="LUK 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />“Aburahamu kamuwankula, ‘Kwa walongu waku kwana malembu ga Musa na malembu ga wambuyi wa Mlungu hagawaberiziyi, walongu waku wafiruwa wagapikaniri ntambu yagawagambira.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Mlundamali kamwankula, ‘Tati Aburahamu, itosha ndiri! Kumbiti pakazyuka muntu kwawu kulawa kwa wahowiti na kuwagendera, hawampikiniri na kuleka vidoda vyawatenda.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Kumbiti Aburahamu kamgambira, ‘Pawagapikanira ndiri malembu ga Musa na malembu ga wambuyi wa Mlungu, hapeni wajimili ata muntu pakazyuka.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s">Vidoda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Matayu 18:6-7</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 18:21-22">21-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Mariku 9:42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Yesu kawagambira wafundwa wakuwi, “Vintu vyavimtenda muntu katendi vidoda mpaka vilawili, kumbiti shondi kwa ulii yakavijega! <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Ayiweri mbaka kwa muntu yakavijega vikomu kumtawa musingu libuwi likulu lya kusagila na kumwasira mubahali, kuliku kumkalaziya yumu gwa wadidini awa watendi vidoda. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Muliloleli weri ntambu yamtenda!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">“Handa mlongu gwaku pakatenda vidoda, gumkalipiri na pakaleka gumlekizii. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Handa pakakukoseya mala saba kwa lishaka limu, na kila shaka pakakuwuyira na kutakula, ‘Vyantenditi gundekiziyi,’ su gufiruwa gumlekizii.”<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Njimiru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Wantumintumi wamgambiriti Mtuwa, “Gutongeleri njimiru.”<verse eid="LUK 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Mtuwa kawankula, “Handa njimiru yenu payiwera nkulu gambira mbeyu ya ndidini nentu, hamuwezi kugugambira mtera gwa mkuyu, ‘Gutupuki gukaliyoshikeri mubahali!’ Ndo meguwajimili.<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lihengu lya ntumini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />“Yumu pakati penu pakawera na ntumintumi yakalima lirambu ama kankulolera wakondolu. Pakawuya kulawa kulirambu, hakamgambiri ntumintumi ulii kamkamu, gwizi gulii shiboga? <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Ndala! Hakamgambiri, ‘Gunyawili huti shiboga, shakapanu guvali na guweri kala kuntendera mpaka mmalili kuliya na kulanda, shakapanu gwenga hagulii.’ <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Hashi, hagulongi mayagashii kwa ntumintumi toziya katenda vyakamgambiriti? <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Ntambu iraa ayi kwa mwenga, pamtenda kala vyoseri vyawawagambiriti mtendi, mlongi, ‘Twenga twawantumintumi hera, twahera mota, tutenda hera lihengu lyetu.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuwaponiziya wangumbula lilongu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Yesu pakaweriti mumwanja kugenda Yerusalemu, kapitiliti mumipaka mwa Samariya na Galilaya. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Pakaweriti kankwingira pashijiji, kaliwoniti na wantu lilongu yawaweriti na ungumbula. Wagolokiti kwa kutali <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />na wabotanga pawalonga, “Yesu! Mtuwa! Gutuwoneri lusungu!”<verse eid="LUK 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Yesu kawawoniti na kawagambira, “Mgendi mwakaliwonisiyi kwa mkulu gwa ludewa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:14">Pawaweriti munjira wankugenda su wapungikiti. <verse eid="LUK 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Yumu pakati pawu pakawoniti handa kapona, kawuyiti pakamkwisa Mlungu kwa liziwu likulu. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Kasuntama makukama pa magulu ga Yesu nakulonga mayagashii kwa Yesu. Muntu ulii kaweriti Msamariya. <verse eid="LUK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Yesu kalonga, “Kuweriti na wantu lilongu yawapungitwi, wakoshi walii wamonga tisa? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Iwera ashi muhenga ayu gweka yakuwi ndo kiza kumkwisa Mlungu?” <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Na Yesu kamgambira, “Gugoloki na gugendi, njimiru yaku ikuponiziya.”<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwiza kwa Ufalumi wa Mlungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Matayu 24:23-28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Mafalisayu wamu wamkosiyiti Yesu, “Ufalumi wa Mlungu wankwiza ndi?” Yomberi kawankula, “Ufalumi wa Mlungu wankwiza ndiri ntambu ya kuwoneka. <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Kwahera muntu hakawezi kutakula, ‘Guloli’ wapalaa! Ama ‘Wa palii!’ Toziya Ufalumi wa Mlungu wamngati mwenu.”<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Shakapanu kawagambira wafundwa wakuwi, “Shaka hakizi pamfira kulilola lishaka limu mumashaka ga Mwana gwa Muntu, kumbiti hapeni mushiwoni. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Wantu woseri hawakugambirani, ‘Mloli, ka palii!’ Ama, ‘Mloli ka panu!’ Kumbiti mwenga namlawa pota namuwafata, <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />toziya Mwana gwa Adamu mumashaka gakuwi, hakaweri gambira lumeta lwa lupanda ntambu yalulangala kulyera kwanjira uwega umu mpaka uwega umonga. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Kumbiti kwanja kafiruwa katabiki muvitwatira vivuwa na kulemwa na wantu wa shiyiwuku ashi. <verse eid="LUK 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />Ntambu yayiweriti mumashaka ga Nuhu, ndo hayiweri mumashaka ga Mwana gwa Muntu. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Wantu wendereyiti kuliya na kulanda, na wapalu hawayugi na wadala kuyugwa mpaka shaka shilii Nuhu pakayingiliti musafina. Mafuliku galawiti na kuwalaga woseri. <verse eid="LUK 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />Hayiweri gambira shaka sha Lutu. Wantu wendereyiti kuliya na kulanda, kuhemera na kushuwuza, kuyala na kunyawa. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Lishaka lilii Lutu pakawukiti Sodoma, motu na mabuwi ga motu gatowiti gambira mvula kulawa kumpindi na kuwalaga woseri. <verse eid="LUK 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Ntambu ayi hayiweri mulijuwa lilii Mwana gwa Muntu pakawoneka.”<verse eid="LUK 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />“Lijuwa lilii muntu yakawera pampindi pashitwiku pa numba yakuwi nakasuluka pasi kutola ulunda wakuwi, Ntambu iraa ayi muntu yoseri pakawera kuisi na kawuya ukaya. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Mmuholi mdala gwa Lutu! <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Yoseri yakafira kugaponiziya makaliru gakuwi, hakagamiziyi na yoseri yakagamiziya makaliru gakuwi hakagalopoziyi. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Nukugambirani, pashiru palii wantu wawili hawaweri wankugonja mulisaga limuwera, yumu hawamtoli na yumonga hawamleki. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Wadala wawili hawaweri wankusaga usaka pamuhera , yumu hawamtoli na yumonga hawamleki.” <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />Wantu wawili hawaweri wankutenda lihengu mulirambu, yumu hawamtoli na yumonga hawamleki <verse eid="LUK 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />wantumini wamkosiyiti Yesu, “Koshi Mtuwa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">Yesu kawankula, “Papawera na lintumbi, kunguru ndo hawaliwoni pamuhera .”<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s">Mfanu gwa mdala mkenja na mtoza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Yesu kawagambiliti wantumintumi wakuwi mfanu, kawafunda wafiruwa kuluwa Mlungu mashaka goseri pota na koya. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Yesu kalonga, “Mlushi lumu kuweriti na mtoza yakamtira ndiri Mlungu, ama kumjali muntu. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Na kuweriti na mkenja mulushi lulii yakamgenderiti hakimu pakaluwa haki yakuwi pakatakula, ‘Guntangi mpati shanfuruwa kupata kulawa kwa mngondu gwangu.’ <verse eid="LUK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />Kwa shaka shivuwa hakimu kafiriti ndiri kumtanga, kumbiti upeleru wakuwi kaligambira mweni, ‘Tembera neni nimtira ndiri Mlungu pota kulishera wantu, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />toziya mkenja ayu kangaziyaga nentu, hanumwamuliri shauri lyakuwi. Pantenda ndiri hakendereyi kwiza panu na upeleru hakang'aziyi nentu!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Mtuwa kendereyiti kutakula, “Mpikaniri ntambu yakatakuliti mtoza ayu mdoda. <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Vinu, hashi Mlungu hapeni kawamuliri wantu wakuwi yawamlilira pashiru na paliwala? Hashi, hakakawi kuwatanga? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Nukugambirani, hakawamuliri kanongola. Kumbiti Mwana gwa Muntu pakiza hakuweri na njimiru pasipanu?”<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfanu gwa Mafalisayu na watola kodi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Yesu kawagambiriti viraa mfanu gwagufata gwa walii yawalilola kuwera waherepa na kuwazarawu wantu wamonga. <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />Kalonga, “Kuweriti na wantu wawili wakweniti kugenda Kunumba nkulu ya Mlungu kuluwa. Yumu kaweriti Mfalisayu na yumonga mtola kodi.”<verse eid="LUK 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Mfalisayu kagolokiti gweka yakuwi na kuluwa shimoyumoyu pakalonga, “ ‘Mlungu mayagashii, neni nanalwaliya ndiri, nampayu ndiri ama mndiyandiya gambira wantu wamonga. Nonga mayagashii kwaku toziya neni nulifana ndiri gambira mtola kodi ayu. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Noya kuliya mala mbili mulijuma, ndaviya fungu lilongu lya vintu vyampatiti.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />Kumbiti mtola kodi kagolokiti kwa kutali, kanyasula ndiri sheni shakuwi kumpindi, su kahinginika mumoyu mwakuwi pakalonga, “Mlungu, gumoneri lusungu neni yantenda vidoda!” <verse eid="LUK 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Yesu kalonga, “Nukugambirani, mtola kodi kawuyiti ukaya pawamlekeziyiti vidoda vyakatenditi, kumbiti Mfarisayu ulii wamlekeziyiti ndiri vidoda vyakatenda. Toziya woseri yawafira kulikweniziya hawawasulusiyi, na woseri yawalisulusiya weni hawawakweniziyi.”<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kawatekelera wana wadidini</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Matayu 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mariku 10:13-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Wantu wamu wamjegiriti Yesu wana wadidini su kawatulili mawoku gakuwi. Wafundwa pawawoniti, wawalewelera ntambu yawatenda, <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />kumbiti Yesu kawashema wana wizi kwakuwi pakalonga, “Muwaleki wana wadidini wizi kwaneni, namuwalewelera toziya Ufalumi wa Mlungu ndo wa wantu gambira awa. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Nukugambirani nakaka! Muntu yoseri yakanka ndiri Ufalumi wa Mlungu gambira mwana mdidini hapeni kingiri amu.”<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mlundamali</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Matayu 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mariku 10:17-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Mkulu gwa Wayawudi kamkosiyiti Yesu, “mfunda muheri, ntendi shishi nwezi kupata ukomu wa mashaka goseri?”<verse eid="LUK 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Yesu kamkosiya, “Iwera ashi gunshema muheri? Kwahera muntu yakawera muheri kumbiti Mlungu gweka yakuwi. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Gugamana malagaliru, ‘Naguwera muhumba, nagulaga, nagwiwa, nagumtakulila mpayu muntu yoseri, guwapanani ligoya tati na mawu gwaku.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Yomberi kawankula, “Kwanjira panweriti mdidini, nugajimira malagaliru goseri aga.”<verse eid="LUK 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Yesu pakapikaniriti aga kamgambira, “Guleka shintu shimu shagufiruwa kutenda. Gushuwuzi kila shintu shaguwera nashu na guwagawiri wahushu mpiya azi, na gwenga haguweri mlunda kumpindi, su gwizi na gunfati.” <verse eid="LUK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Kumbiti muntu ulii pakapikaniriti aga, kahinginikiti nentu toziya kaweriti mlunda nentu.<verse eid="LUK 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Yesu kawoniti ntambu yakahinginikiti na katakula, “Ntambu ayi hayiweri vikamala kwa wantu walunda kwingira mu Ufalumi wa Mlungu. <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Hayiweri ikamala kwa walunda mali kwingira mu Ufalumi wa Mlungu kuliku shigongolu shawamshema Ngamiya kupena mushitoboli sha sanziya.”<verse eid="LUK 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Wantu walii pawapikaniriti aga wakosiya, “Su gaa hakalopoziwi?”<verse eid="LUK 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Yesu kawankula, “Gawezekana ndiri kwa wantu, kumbiti kwa Mlungu gawezekana.”<verse eid="LUK 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Peteru kamgambira, “Guloli! Twenga tuleka kaya zetu na kukufata gwenga.”<verse eid="LUK 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Yesu kawagambira, “Yina! Nukugambirani nakaka muntu yoseri yakalekiti numba, ama mdala, ama walongu, ama mawu na watati wakuwi, ama wana toziya ya Ufalumi wa Mlungu <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />hakawanki gavuwa nentu mushaka ashi na mushaka shashiza hakawanki ukomu wa mashaka goseri.”<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kawagambira mala ya tatu kuhowa kwakuwi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Matayu 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mariku 10:32-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Yesu kawatoliti wantumintumi walii lilongu na mbili na kuwagambira, “Mpikaniri! Twankugenda Yerusalemu kulii kila shintu wambuyi wa Mlungu walembiti, kuusu Mwana gwa Muntu hagalawiri. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Hawamupanani kwa wantu yawaweriti ndiri Wayawudi, na womberi hawamtenderi lidufiya na hawamwigilangi na hawamtemeri mata. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />Hawamsyatangi ntomondu na hawamlagi, kumbiti lishaka lya tatu kwanjira pakahowiti hakazyuki.”<verse eid="LUK 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Kumbiti wantumintumi wavimaniti ndiri vintu vyoseri avi, mana ya visoweru viweriti vififwa kwawomberi, na wavimaniti ndiri shakatakuliti Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kamuponiziya Muntu kana lwisi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Matayu 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mariku 10:46-52</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Yesu pakaweriti kapakwegera na Yeriku, kuweriti na muntu yakana lwisi yakalivagiti panjira pakaluwa. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Pakapikaniriti lipinga lya wantu lyankupita kakosiya, “Kwana shishi?”<verse eid="LUK 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Womberi wamgambira, “Yesu gwa Nazareti kankupita.”<verse eid="LUK 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Nayomberi kalila kwa liziwu likulu, “Yesu! Mwana gwa Dawudi! Gumoneri lusungu!”<verse eid="LUK 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Wantu yawalongoleriti wamkalipira pawamgambira kanyamalili. Kumbiti yomberi kendereyiti kubotanga, “Mwana gwa Dawudi! Gumoneri lusungu!”<verse eid="LUK 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Yesu kagolokiti, na kawagambira wamjegeri muntu kana lwisi ulii. Muntu kana lwisi pakasokiti pakwegela, Yesu kamkosiya, <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />“Gufira nukutenderi shishi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">Nayomberi kawankula, “Mtuwa nduwa mpati kuwona kayi.”<verse eid="LUK 18:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Yesu kamgambira, “Guwoni! Kwakunjimira kwaku, ndo gupona.”<verse eid="LUK 18:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Pala palii, kaweza kuwona, na kamgendera Yesu, kalonga mayagashii kwa Mlungu. Lipinga lya wantu pawawoniti hangu, wamkwisiti Mlungu.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na Zakayu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Yesu kingiriti Yeriku, kaweriti kankupita munjira za lushi alu. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Kuweriti na mkulu gwa watola kodi yawamshema Zakayu, mweni kaweriti mlunda. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Kafiriti kumwona Yesu kaweriti gwa ntambu gaa, kumbiti toziya ya lipinga lya wantu na toziya kaweriti mfupi, kasinditi kumwona Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Su kalongolera mbiru, kakwena pampindi pa mkuyu su kawezi kumwona Yesu kaweriti kankupita njira ayi. <verse eid="LUK 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Yesu pakaweriti kankwiza pahala palii, kaloliti kumtera na kumgambira Zakayu, “Kanongola gusuluki, toziya nfiruwa kulikala mnumba mwaku leru.”<verse eid="LUK 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Zakayu kasuluka kanongola, kumshemera kwa kunemelera. <verse eid="LUK 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Wantu woseri pawawoniti hangu, wanjiti kuhinginika pawalonga, “Muntu ayu kagenda kuwera muhenga yakanaligoya ukaya kwa yakana vidoda!”<verse eid="LUK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Zakayu kagoloka, kumgambira Mtuwa, “Gupikaniri, Mtuwa! Hanuwapanani wahushu nusu ya ulunda wangu, na handa panumupokiti muntu yoseri kwa kumupayira hanumuwuzilili mala msheshi.”<verse eid="LUK 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Yesu kamgambira, “Ulopoziwu usoka mnumba amu leru, toziya muntu ayu vira ndo kamushiyiwuku sha Aburahamu. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Mwana gwa Muntu kiziti kusakula na kuwalopoziya yawagamiliti.”<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfanu gwa wantumini lilongu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Matayu 25:14-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Wantu pawaweriti wankupikanira aga, Yesu kendereyiti kuwagambira mfanu. Pakaweriti pakwegera kusoka Yerusalemu na wantu walii waliholiti kuwera Ufalumi wa Mlungu sambira usoka. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Su kawagambira, “Kuweriti na muntu yumu yakaweriti mkulu yakagenda muisi ya kutali kaweri mfalumi, shakapanu kawuyi ukaya. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Pamberi pa kuwuka, kawashemiti wantumintumi wakuwi lilongu na kuwapanani mpiya kila yumu na kuwagambira, ‘Guloli ntambu yamuweza kutenda pambuka.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Vinu wantu wakuwi wamgalambukiti, pakawukiti kala, wawatumiti wajumbi walongi, ‘Tumfira ndiri muntu ayu kaweri mfalumi gwetu.’<verse eid="LUK 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />“Muntu ulii pawamtyeka kala kuwera mfalumi kawuyiti ukaya. Palii kawashemiti wantumintumi wakuwi kafira kavimani ntambu ya kila muntu kapata mpiya zininga kuliku ntambu yakawapananiti. <verse eid="LUK 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Ntumintumi gwa kwanja kiza na kulonga, ‘Mtuwa, mpata mpiya lilongu nentu ya mpiya yimu yagunupiti.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Nayomberi kamgambira, ‘Gutenda weri, gwenga gwa ntumintumi guherepa! Toziya guwera gwa mwaminika kwa shintu shididini, hanukutuli guweri mkulu kwa lushi zya malongu.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Ntumintumi gwa pili kiza na katakula, ‘Mtuwa, mpata mpiya zyamuhanu nentu ya mpiya yimu yagunupiti.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Kwa yumu ayu kamgambira, ‘Haguweri mkulu gwa lushi zya muhanu.’<verse eid="LUK 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />“Ntumintumi gwingi kiza na kutakula, ‘Mtuwa, mpiya yaku ayi, ntawiti mushitambala. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Nukutuliriti gwenga toziya gwenga gwa muntu gukalipa. Gwenga gutolaga shilii shaku ndiri na kubena shilii shaguyala ndiri.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Nayomberi kamgambira, ‘Gwenga gwa ntumintumi gufaa ndiri! Nukutoza kulawirana na visoweru vyaku! Guvimana neni muntu nkalipa, ntola shilii shashiwera ndiri shaneni na mbenanga vilii vyanyala ndiri.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Su iwera hashi gutuliti ndiri mpiya zyangu muluhanja? Pambuyiti hampati mpiya yangu pamuhera na mota yakuwi.”<verse eid="LUK 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />“Shakapanu kawagambira woseri yawaweriti wagoloka palii, ‘Mmupoki mpiya ayi na mumupi ntumintumi ulii yakongeriti mpiya lilongu.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Kumbiti womberi wamgambira, ‘Mtuwa, ayu kana mpiya kala mala lilongu!’ <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />Nayomberi kawankula, ‘Nukugambirani woseri yawawera na shintu, hawongelerwi, kumbiti woseri yawahera na shintu, ata shilii shididini shawawera nashi hawawapoki. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Vinu woseri walii yawaweriti wangondu wangu yawanfira ndiri neni nweri mfalumi gwawu, muwajegi panu na kuwalaga palongolu pa masu gangu!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankwingira Yerusalemu kwa shereku</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matayu 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mariku 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohani 12:12-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Yesu pakatakuliti kala aga, su kawalonguleriti kugenda Yerusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Pakaweriti pakwegera kusoka Betifagi na Betaniya, mulugongu lwa Mizeyituni, kawatumiti wafundwa wawili <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />kawagambira, “Mgendi mushijiji sha palongolu penu, pamwingira hamwoni punda wamtawa mweni hakenitenderwi na muntu. Mumyopoli na mumjegi panu. <figure style="fig" file="15 Colt.jpg" size="col" ref="19:30">Mwana gwa punda</figure> <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Muntu yoseri pakawakosiya, iwera hashi mwankumyopola, mumgambiri Mtuwa kamfira.”<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Wagenditi munjira yawu, wawona kila shintu Yesu ntambu yakawagambiriti. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Pawaweriti wankumyopola punda ulii, weni yawawera na punda wawakosiya, “Iwera hashi mwankumyopola punda ayu?”<verse eid="LUK 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Nawomberi wamwankula, “Mtuwa kamfira,” <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />su wamjega punda ulii kwa Yesu. Shakapanu wamyalikira nguwu zyawu pampindi pa punda na wamtanga Yesu kumkweniziya pampindi pakuwi. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Yesu kendereya na mwanja, na wantu wayalika nguwu zyawu munjira.<verse eid="LUK 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Pakasokiti pakwegera na Yerusalemu, panjira panda pa lugongu lwa Mizeyituni, lipinga likulu lya wafundwa wanjiti kutenda lusheka na nemeleru walonga mayagashii Mlungu na kumkwisa yomberi kwa liziwu likulu pawatakula mauzauza makulu wagawoniti, <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />“Mlungu gumtekeleri mfalumi yakiza mulitawu lya Mtuwa! Ponga iweri kumpindi nentu kwa Mlungu na ukwisa uweri kwa Mlungu!”<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Shakapanu Wamafalisayu wamu mulipinga lilii lya wantu wamgambira Yesu, “mfunda, guwanyamaziyi wafundwa waku.”<verse eid="LUK 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Yesu kawankula, “Nukugambirani, handa pawanyamalila, mabuhi aga haganji kubotanga.”<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankululilira lushi lwa Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Pawasokiti pakwegera na lushi lwa Yerusalemu, na pakaluwona kanjiti kululilira, <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />kalonga, “Meguvimani! Leru ayi vitwatira vijega ponga. Kumbiti vinu galififa pamasu paku. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Shaka shankwiza ndo sheni wangondu waku hawakuzyengeti kwa maboma, hawakupingili na kukubabanika wega zoseri. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Hawakwagamiziyi gwenga na wantu yawalikala mngati, hapeni wakulekeli ata libuwi limu panani pa limonga, toziya gushimana ndiri shaka sha Mlungu pakakwiziriti kukulopoziya.”<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankwingira Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Matayu 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mariku 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yohani 2:13-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Shakapanu Yesu kingiriti Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu na kanja kuwawinga walii yawashuwuza vintu palii, <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />kawagambira, “Walembiti mumalembu, Mlungu pakalonga, ‘Numba nkulu ya neni hayiweri numba ya kusalira.’ Kumbiti mwenga muyitenda mpanga ya wapoka.”<verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Kila lishaka Yesu kaweriti kankufunda Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu. Watambika wakulu na wafunda wa Malagaliru, na wakulu wa wantu wafiriti kumlaga, <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />kumbiti wasinditi ntambu yakutenda aga, toziya wantu woseri waweriti wankumpikinira weri kila shisoweru shakatakuliti, na wafiriti ndiri kukosa shisoweru ata shimu.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s">Likosiwu kuusu Uwezu wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Matayu 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mariku 11:27-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Lishaka limu Yesu kaweriti kankuwafunda wantu Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu na kuvibwera visoweru viwagira, watambika wakulu na wafunda wa Malagaliru, pamuhera na wazewi, wiziti <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />na wamgambira, “Gutugambiri, gutenda vintu vyoseri avi kwa uwezu wa gaa? Ndo gaa yakakupananiti uwezu wa kutenda aga?”<verse eid="LUK 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Yesu kawankula, “Vinu naneni hanuwakosiyi. Mung'ambiri, <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />uwezu wa kubatiza wa Yohani Mbatiza ulawiti kumpindi ama ulawiti kwa wantu?”<verse eid="LUK 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Womberi wanjiti kuligambirana weni, “Hatulongi hashi? Patulonga, ‘Ulawiti kumpindi,’ yomberi hakatakuli, ‘Iwera hashi munjimira ndiri?’ <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Kumbiti patulonga, ‘Ulawa kwa wantu,’ lipinga lyoseri lya wantu panu hawatugumi mabuhi, toziya woseri wavimaniti kuwera Yohani kaweriti mbuyi gwa Mlungu.” <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Su wamwankula, “Tuvimana ndiri uwezu wakuwi ulawiti koshi.”<verse eid="LUK 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Yesu kawagambira, “Vira neni hapeni nuwagambirani ntenda vitwatira avi kwa uwezu wa gaa.”<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfanu gwa lirambu lya Mizyabibu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Matayu 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mariku 12:1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Yesu kawagambiriti wantu mfanu agu, “Kweniti na muntu yakayaliti mizyabibu mulirambu, kawazimila walimi na mweni kagenditi mwanja, kalikaliti kulii shaka shivuwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Shaka sha kubenanga zyabibu shisokiti, kamtumiti mmanda kagendi kwa walimi, kakatoli seemu ya mabenangu ga lirambu lya mizyabibu. Kumbiti walimi wamkomanga ntumintumi ulii na wamuwuziya ukaya mawoku hera. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Su kamtumiti ntumintumi gwingi, kumbiti walimi walii wamkoma kayi na kumtendera vidoda, na wamwuziya ukaya mawoku hera. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Kamtumiti ntumintumi gwa tatu, walimi wamkoma mpaka kawera na vironda, shakapanu wamuwingawinga. <verse eid="LUK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Mweni kana lirambu kalikosiya, ‘Hantendi hashi? Hanumtumi mwana gwangu yanumfira, neni wera na unakaka hawamupanani ligoya!’ <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Kumbiti walimi walii pawamwoniti, wanja kuligambira, ‘Ayu ndo mhala gwakuwi. Tumlagi, uhala wakuwi hawuweri wa twenga!’ <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Su wamlaviya kunja kulirambu, wamlaga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">Yesu kawakosiya, “Yakana lirambu ulii hakawatendi hashi walimi walii? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />Hakizi kuwalaga walimi woseri, na hakawapanani walimi wamonga lirambu lilii lya mizyabibu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">Wantu pawapikaniriti, watakula, “Iwezekana ndiri!”<verse eid="LUK 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Yesu kawaloliti na kukosiya, “Su Malembu aga Mananagala gana mana gaa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:17">‘Libuwi lyawalilemiti wanyawa wa numba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:17">vinu ligalambuka na liwera libuwi lyaliwera na mana nentu kuliku goseri.’<verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Muntu yoseri pakaguwa pampindi pa libuwi hakamegeki vipandi vipandi, na libuwi palimtulukira muntu yoseri, halimpeshi.”<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Likosiwu lya kulipa kodi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Matayu 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mariku 12:13-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Wafunda wa Malagaliru na watambika wakulu wafiriti kumbata, toziya wavimaniti mfanu agu guweriti kankuwatakula womberi, kumbiti palii yawatiriti wantu. <verse eid="LUK 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Su waweriti wankusakula shaka shifaa. Wawapananiti wantu wamu mpiya walitendi waheri, su wawatuma wagendi kumjera Yesu kwa kumkosiya, su wawezi kumbata na kumjega kwa wakulu wa serikali ya Rumi. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Walolalola walii wamgambira Yesu, “mfunda, tuvimana ntambu yagutakula na kufunda vitwatira vya nakaka. Tuvimana gwenga gwahera ubagula kwa muntu yoseri ulii, kumbiti gwenga gufunda unakaka wa vintu vyakafira Mlungu. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Gutugambiri, handa vya halali ama vyahalali ndiri kulipa kodi kwa Kayisari!”<verse eid="LUK 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Kumbiti Yesu kavimaniti shawafira na kawagambira, <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />“Mnanguziyi mpiya. Sheni sha mumpiya sha gaa na malembu yagalembwa mumpiya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:24">Wamwankula, “vya Kayisari.”<verse eid="LUK 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Su Yesu kawagambira, “Su vya Kayisari mpanani Kayisari na vya Mlungu mpanani Mlungu.”<verse eid="LUK 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Waweza ndiri kumbata kwa shisoweru shoseri palii palongolu pa wantu, su wanyamaliti, pawalikangasha ntambu yakawankuliti.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Likosiwu lya kuzyuka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Matayu 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mariku 12:18-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Shakapanu Masadukayu wamu, yawalongaga wantu yawahowa hapeni wazyuki, wamwiziriti Yesu na kulonga, <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />“mfunda, Musa katulembiriti Lilagaliru ali, ‘Muntu pakahowa na kumleka mdala yakahera mwana, mpaka mlongu gwakuwi kamtoli mkenja ulii su kamleleri wana mlongu gwakuwi yakahowiti.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Vinu kuweriti na walongu saba. Mkulu yakalongoleriti kumyuga kahowa pakaleka ndiri mwana. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Mlongu gwa pili kamuyuga mdala mkenja ulii, <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />na mlongu gwa tatu ntambu iraa, vitwatira viweriti viraa virii kwa woseri saba, wahowiti pawaleka ndiri wana. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Upeleru wakuwi na mdala mkenja ulii kahowiti vira. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Vinu mulishaka lya wahowiti kuzyuka, mdala ulii hakaweri gwa gaa? Toziya woseri saba wamuyugiti.”<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Yesu kawankula, “Mushaka ashi wapalu wayuga wadala, <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />kumbiti wapalu na wadala weni Mlungu hakawatangi kuwera mushaka sha kuzyuka, hapeni wapalu wayugi wala wadala kuyugwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Hawaweri gambira wantumintumi wa kumpindi na hapeni wahowi. Womberi ndo wana wa Mlungu, toziya wazyuka kulawa kwa wahowiti. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Kumbiti Musa kalanguziyiti weri kuwera yawahowiti hawazyuki. Mumalembu Mananagala galembitwi shakatakuliti Mtuwa ndo Mlungu gwa Aburahamu, na Mlungu gwa Isaka, na Mlungu gwa Yakobu. <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Mlungu ndo gwa yawawera wakomu, na Mlungu ndiri gwa wahowiti, kwakuwi woseri walikala.”<verse eid="LUK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Wafunda wamu wa Malagaliru watakula, “mfunda guwankula weri!” <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Watakuliti hangu toziya wasinditi kumkosiya kayi makosiwu gamonga.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Likosiwu kuusu Masiya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Matayu 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mariku 12:35-37</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Yesu kawakosiya, “Watakula hashi kulonga Kristu kawera mwana gwa Dawudi? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Mweni Dawudi kalemba kala mushintola sha Zaburi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:42">‘Mtuwa kamgambiriti Mtuwa gwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:42">Gwikali kumliwu kwaneni<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />Mpaka nuwatuli wangondu waku kuwera shigoda sha kutulila magulu gaku.’<verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Dawudi kamshemiti yomberi, ‘Mtuwa.’ Hayiweri hashi Masiya kaweri mwana gwa Dawudi?”<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuwakalipira wantu kuusu Wafunda wa Malagaliru</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matayu 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mariku 12:38-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Yesu kawagambira wafundwa wakuwi kulongolu kwa wantu woseri, <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />“Muliloleri weri kuusu wafunda wa Malagaliru, weni wafira kugendagenda pawavalira lihabiti na wafira kulamsiwa kwa ligoya pahala pa soku, weni wasyagula kulivaga pahala pa ligoya munumba zya Mlungu, na pahala paherepa mumsambu, <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Wawagambira wakenja mpayu na kuwapoka numba zyawu na pawaluwa Mlungu sala ntali! Azabu yawu hayiweri nkulu nentu!”<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s">Malaviwu ya Mkenja</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Mariku 12:41-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Yesu kalola wega zoseri, kawawona wantu walunda pawatula mafupu gawu mulisanduku lya luhanja Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu, <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />vira virii kamwoniti mkenja muhushu nentu pakatula senti ndidika mbili zya mpiya. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Kawagambira, “Nukugambirani kuwera nakaka mkenja muhushu ayu kalaviya zivuwa kuliku woseri wamonga. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Wamonga walaviyiti mafupu gawu galii gagasigaliti muulunda wawu, kumbiti muhushu ayu kwa uhushu wakuwi kalaviya vyoseri vyakalitumbiriti.”<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nkakutakula kuhalibisiwa kwa Numba nkulu ya Mlungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Matayu 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mariku 13:1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Wantumini wamu waweriti wankutakula kuusu Numba nkulu ya Mlungu, ntambu yawaherepeziya kwa mabuhi gaherepa na mafupu wagalaviyiti kwa Mlungu. Yesu kawagambira, <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />“Goseri aga gamgalola, shaka shankwiza peni hapeni lisigali libuwi limu pahala pakuwi, kila shintu hashiharibisiwi.”<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ntabiku na mbeziwu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Matayu 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mariku 13:3-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Womberi wamkosiyiti, “mfunda, visoweru avi havilawili ndii? Hashilawiri shishi kutulanguziya kuwera shaka ashi shankwiza?”<verse eid="LUK 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Yesu kawankula, “Mliloli weri, nawawazyangani. Wantu wavuwa hawizi pawatakula shisoweru shangu, hawizi na kulonga, ‘Neni ndo mweni!’ Na ‘Shaka hashizi!’ Kumbiti namuwafata. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Namtira pampikanira ngondu na ndewu, vintu vyoseri avi mpaka vilawiri kwanja, kumbiti upeleru wa vitwatira avi wankali.”<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Yesu kendereya kutakula, “Isi yimu hailikomangi na isi yimonga, na ufalumi umu haulikomi na ufalumi umonga. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Hakuweri na malendemeru makulu ga isi na hakuweri na njala na ulweri wa tawuni pahala poseri, hakuweri na vitwatira vya kutiliziya na lilangaliru likulu kulawa kuliyera. <verse eid="LUK 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />Pamberi pagalawira goseri aga, hawawabati na kuwatabisiya na hawawajegeni munumba za Mlungu na kuwatula muvibetubetu, hawawajegeni kulongolu kwa wafalumi na wakulu toziya munjimira neni. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Ayi hayiweri lupenyu lwenu kuvibwera visoweru viwagira. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Kumbiti muvimani mumyoyu mwenu, namlihola ntambu ya kujiteteya, <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />toziya Namweni neni hanuwapanani mwenga lulimi na luhala vyeni wangondu wenu woseri hapeni wawezi kusindana naga na kugalema gamtakula. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Hagugalambukwi na mawu na tati gwaku, na walongu waku, na waganja waku, na wamonga pakati penu hawawalagi. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Wantu woseri hawawakalalirani mwenga toziya ya litawu lyaneni. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Kumbiti hapeni luagamili ata luvili lumu mumituwi mwenu. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Muweri pamgangamala mumoyu, hamliponiziyi weni.<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nkakutunga kuhalibisiwa lushi lwa Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Matayu 24:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Mariku 13:14-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />“Pamwona Yerusalemu guzyengetwa na wangondu, su hamvimani kuwera shaka shisoka peni isi ayi hayiharabisiwi. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Woseri yawalikala Muyudeya watugili mulugongu, woseri yawawera mulushi wawuki, na woseri yawawera mumalambu nawawuya mulushi. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Toziya mashaka aga hagaweri ‘Mashaka ga kutoza,’ kulanguziya koseri kwakulembitwi mumalembu Mananagala gatimii. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Shondi shondi wamawu yawawera na yinda na walii yawanoniziya mumashaka galii! Toziya hakuweri na malweri gavuwa muisi, na utoza wa Mlungu hawuwayizili wantu awa. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Wamonga hawawalagi kwa ligumba, na wamonga hawawatuli muvibetubetu muisi zoseri, na hawawatoli lopola muisi zoseri na Yerusalemu hayitimbwi na wantu yawamumana ndiri Mlungu mpaka shaka shawu pashimalilika.<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwiza kwa Mwana gwa Muntu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Matayu 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mariku 13:24-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />“Hakuweri na lilangaliru mumshenji, na mulyezi, na muntondu. Pasipanu wantu woseri yawaweriti muisi zoseri hawaweri na uhushu, lyoga lya kulishera kwa mtukuliru gwa makupala ga bahari na mihenyuhenyu yakuwi. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Wantu pawafuwa myoyu kwa lyoga, pawalola vitwatira vyeni havilawili pasipanu, makakala ga kumpindi hagatikinyiki. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Shaka shilii Mwana gwa Muntu hakalawili, pakiza mumahundi pakawera na makakala pamuhera na ukwisa mkulu. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Vintu avi pavyanja kulawira, mkalamuki na mnyasuli mituwi yenu kumpindi toziya ulopoziwu wenu wapakwegera.”<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfanu gwa mtera gwa mkuyu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Matayu 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mariku 13:28-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Yesu kawagambiriti mfanu agu, “Mguloli mtera gwa mkuyu na mitera yamonga yoseri. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Pamuwoniti mihamba yankwanja kumera, muvimana kuwera shaka sha kutowa vula shapakwegera. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Ntambu iraa ayi, pamwona vitwatira avi vyankulawira, muvimani handa Ufalumi wa Mlungu wapakwegera.<verse eid="LUK 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />“Mliholi kuwera vintu vyoseri havilawili huti pamberi pa wantu woseri yawalikala vinu kuhowa. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Kumpindi na pasipanu hazipiti, kumbiti visoweru vyangu hapeni vipiti.<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />“Mliloleri weri! Namuwera vyambojola bojola, na lukologelu na lyaliya, ama pamlilola weri ndiri lishaka lilii halikwizireni vumu hera, <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />gambira mgomiziwu. Toziya haguwayizili kwa wantu woseri yawalikala pahala poseri pasipanu. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Mwenga mulikali masu na mumluwi Mlungu mashaka goseri su mpati makakala ga kugenda weri muvitwatira vyoseri vyeni ndo havilawili na kugoloka kulongolu kwa Mwana gwa Muntu.”<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Mashaka goseri paluwala, Yesu kaweriti kankufunda Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu, na pamihi kaweriti kankugenda kulikala mulugongu lwa Mizeyituni. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Kila pamandawila wantu woseri wagenditi Kunumba nkulu ya Mlungu kumpikinira.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s">Mpangu gwa kumlaga Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matayu 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mariku 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yohani 11:45-53</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Msambu gwa mabumunda gachechema ndiri, yagushemwa Pasaka guweri sambira gusoka. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Watambika wakulu na wafunda wa Malagaliru waweriti wankusakula njira ya kumlaga Yesu kwa bada, toziya wawatiriti wantu.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda kankujimila kumgalambuka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Matayu 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mariku 14:10-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Shetani kamwingiriti Yuda, yawamshema Isikariyoti, yumu gwa wantumini walii lilongu na mbili. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Su Yuda kagenditi kuyowera na Watambika wakulu na walolera wa numba nkulu ya Mlungu ntambu ya kumgalambuka Yesu kwawomberi. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Womberi weniti manemu na wayoweriti na yomberi wampanani mpiya. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Yuda kajimiliti, na kaweriti kankusakula lupenyu luherepa lwa kumlaviya Yesu kwawomberi pota na lipinga lya wantu kuvimana.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankulitanda kuliya Shiboga sha Pasaka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Matayu 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mariku 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yohani 13:21-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Lishaka lisokiti lya msambu gwa mabumunda gachechema ndiri, wakondolu wa shiboga sha Pasaka pawawadumuliti. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Yesu kawatumiti Peteru na Yohani, kawagambira, “Mgendi mwakatunyawili shiboga sha Pasaka tupati kuliya.”<verse eid="LUK 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Womberi wamkosiyiti, “Gufira twakanyawi koshi?”<verse eid="LUK 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Yesu kawankula, “Pamgenda mulushi, hamliwoni na mpalu yakalitwika shiwiga sha mashi. Mmufati mpaka mnumba pakayingira, <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />mumgambiri mweni kana numba, ‘mfunda kankukosiya, shakoshi shuwogu mweni handiyi Pasaka pamuhera na wafundwa wangu?’ <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Yomberi hakawalanguziyi shuwogu shikulu mugorofa wayiherepeziya, munyawi amu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Wagenditi na woniti kila shintu sawa ntambu Yesu yakawagambiriti, wanyawa shiboga sha Pasaka.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shiboga sha Mtuwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Matayu 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mariku 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-27">1 Wakorintu 11:23-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Shaka pashisokiti, Yesu kalikaliti kuliya shiboga pamuhera na wantumintumi wakuwi. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Kawagambira, “Nfira nentu kuliya Pasaka ayi pamuhera na mwenga pamberi pa kundabisiya! <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Nukugambirani ayi ndo Pasaka ya upeleru kuliya na mwenga mpaka palii payiwera kala mu Ufalumi wa Mlungu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Shakapanu Yesu katola lwindi, kalonga mayagashii Mlungu, kalonga, “Muwanki lwindi alu na mlandiri woseri. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Nukugambirani, kwanjira vinu hanandi kayi ndiri divayi ayi mpaka Ufalumi wa Mlungu pawiza.”<verse eid="LUK 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Shakapanu katoliti libumunda, kalonga mayagashii Mlungu, kalimega na kawapanana womberi pakalonga, “Ayi ndo nshimba ya neni yailaviwa kwajili ya mwenga. Mtendi hangu kwa kuhola neni.” <verse eid="LUK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Viraa avi, kawapanana lwindi lwa divayi pawaliyiti kala shiboga, pakalonga, “Lwindi alu ndo lipatanu lya syayi lyalilaviyitwi kwa mwazi gwangu wagwitika toziya ya mwenga<verse eid="LUK 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />“Mloli! Ulii yakang'alambuka ka palaa kankuliya pamuhera naneni. <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Mwana gwa Muntu hakahowi ntambu yakafiriti Mlungu, kumbiti shondi kwa muntu yakamgalambuka!”<verse eid="LUK 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Palaa wanjiti kulikosiya weni, su gaa pakati petu hakatendi shitwatila ashi.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Likakatala lya Ukulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Kulawiriti likakatala pakati pa wantumintumi walii gaa ndo hakawezi kuwera mkulu pakati pawu. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Yesu kawagambira, “Wafalumi wa maisi yawawera ndiri Wayawudi yawakolamlima wantu wawu kwa makakala, nawomberi pawawashema ‘Waganja wa wantu.’ <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Kumbiti nayiwera hangu pakati penu, kumbiti ulii yakaweriti mkulu pakati penu ndo kalazima kaweri mdidiki gwa woseri, na yakawera mlongoziya ndo kaweri ntumintumi. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Gaa yakaweriti mkulu, ulii yakalikala pasi kuliya shiboga, ama ulii yakatumika? Imanikana ulii yakalikala pashitalawanda kuliya shiboga! Kumbiti neni ndo ntumintumi pakati penu.<verse eid="LUK 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />“Mwenga mlikala pamuhera na neni shaka shoseri sha kujerwa kwangu, <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />gambira Tati gwangu ntambu yakampananiti ukolamlima, su naneni hanuwapanani ntambu ira ayi. <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />Hamlii na kulanda pashitalawanda pangu mu Utuwa wangu na hamulikali muvibanta vya ufalumi kugatoza makabila lilongu na mbili ga Israeli.<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankutunga handa Peteru hakamlemi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matayu 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mariku 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yohani 13:36-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />“Simoni, Simoni! Gupikaniri! Shetani kapatiti ruusa ya kuwajera mwenga mawoseri, kuvilaviya viherepa kulawa muvidoda, gambira mlimi pakapeta nganu kulawa mumakapi. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Kumbiti neni nankuluwira kwa Mlungu, Simoni njimiru yaku nayidodomera. Nagwenga pagumbuyira, guwatangi wayagu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Peteru kamwankula, “Mtuwa, neni hang'enda kala pamuhera na gwenga mushibetubetu, na ata kuhowa pamuhera na gwenga.”<verse eid="LUK 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Yesu kamuwankula, “Nukugambira gwenga Peteru, pamberi njogolu hakeniwiki leru hagunemi mala ndatu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulitanda mushaka sha ntabiku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Shakapanu Yesu kawakosiyiti wantumintumi wakuwi, “Shaka shanuwatumiti pota na mpiya, na muhaku ama vilwatu, mpungukiwitwi shintu shoseri?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">Wamwankula, “Ndala.”<verse eid="LUK 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Yesu kawagambira, “kumbiti vinu, ulii yakawera na muhaku gwa mpiya kagutoli, yakahera na ligumba, kashuwuzi nguwu yakuwi na kahemeri ligumba lumu.” <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />“Toziya nukugambirani, Malembu Mananagala galembwa, ‘Wamtuliti shipinga shimuwera pamuhera na wavidoda,’ ndo mpaka gatimii kwa neni, toziya shawalemba kuusu neni shankwiza kuwera nakaka.”<verse eid="LUK 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Wantumintumi walonga, “Guloli Mtuwa! Panu kwana magumba mawili!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:38">Yesu kalonga, “Ayi itosha!”<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankusali mulugongu lwa Mizeyituni</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Matayu 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mariku 14:32-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Yesu kalawa mulushi na kugenda, ntambu yaiweriti ntambu yakuwi, kagenda mpaka kulugongu lwa mizeyituni, wafundwa wakuwi wamfata. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Pakasokiti kulii kawagambiriti, “Mluwi Mlungu namwingira mukujeruwa.”<verse eid="LUK 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Shakapanu kawaleka kagenda utali wa muntu kuweza kuguma libuwi, kasuntama na kumluwa Mlungu. <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />Kalonga, “Tati pagufira, guyiwusiyi lwindi alu lwa ntabiku kwa neni. Ata hangu, mafiliru gaku gafiliziwi, pota ganeni ndiri, ira gutendi ntambu yagufira gumweni.” <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Palaa wamahoka wa Mlungu kulawa kumpindi wamlawira, su wamtanga. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Pakaweriti mu kutama nentu, kamluwiti Mlungu na livuki limlawiti gambira makontera ga mwazi, gaturukiti pasi.<verse eid="LUK 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Pakaluwiti kala, kawawuyiriti wafundwa wakuwi, kawawoniti wagonja mpota, womberi waweriti na hinginiku. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Kawagambira, “Iwera ashi mgonja? Mwimuki na mluwi, namwingira mukujerwa.”<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wambata</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matayu 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mariku 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:1-11">Yohani 18:1-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Yesu pakaweriti kankali kankuyowera, lipinga lya wantu liza palilongoziwa na Yuda, yumu gwa walii wafundwa lilongu na mbili. Yuda kamgenderiti Yesu na kumnonera. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Yesu kamgambira, “Yuda! Hashi gwankumgalambuka Mwana gwa Muntu kwa kumnona?”<verse eid="LUK 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Wantumini yawaweriti pamuhera na Yesu pawagawoniti galii gagalawira, womberi wakosiya, “Mtuwa tugatenderi magumba getu?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Na yumu gwawu kamkomiti ligumba ntumintumi gwa Mtambika Mkulu na kamdumula likutu lyakuwi lya kumliwu.<verse eid="LUK 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Palaa, Yesu kalonga, “Ayi itosha!” Kalishinkula likutu lya muntu ayu, kamuponiziya.<verse eid="LUK 22:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Shakapanu Yesu kawagambira watambika wakulu, na wakulu walolera wa Numba nkulu ya Mlungu na wazewi wawiziti kumubata, “Hashi, mwiza na mapanga na vindonga kumbata gambira neni na mpoka? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Kila lishaka panweriti pamuhera na mwenga Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu mumkamula ndiri. Kumbiti ashi ndo shaka shenu asa, ndo shaka sha ukolamlima wa luwindu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Peteru kankumlema Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Matayu 26:57-58</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Mariku 14:53-54</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Yohani 18:12-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Wamubatiti Yesu na kugenda nayu ukaya kwa Mtambika Mkulu, na Peteru kaweriti kankumfata kwa kutali. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Motu wagukoziiti pakati pa uwa, na Peteru kaweriti pamuhera na woseri weni waweriti walikala pamuhera pawayoterata motu. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Ntumintumi yumu mdala pakamwoniti Peteru kalivaga pakwegera na motu, kamjodoleriti masu na kalonga, “Muntu ayu kaweriti vira pamuhera na Yesu!”<verse eid="LUK 22:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Kumbiti Peteru kaberiti pakalonga, “Ndala gwenga, neni nummana ndiri!”<verse eid="LUK 22:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Shakapanu hera, muntu yumonga kamwona Peteru na kalonga, “Gwenga gwa yumu gwawu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:58">Kumbiti Peteru kawankula, “Mtuwa gwenga, neni ndiri!”<verse eid="LUK 22:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Na lisaa limu pamberi, muntu yumonga kamsindikira pakatakula, “Nakaka ayu kaweriti pamuhera na Yesu, toziya ayu ndo Mgalilaya vira!”<verse eid="LUK 22:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Peteru kamwankula, “Mtuwa gwenga, nuvimana ndiri ntambu yagutakula!” Palaa palii, pakaweriti kankali kankuyowera, njogolu kaweka. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Mtuwa kagalambuka na kumlola Peteru, na Peteru kalihola galii Mtuwa gakamgambiriti, “Leru pamberi njogolu keniwika hagunemi mala ntatu.” <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Peteru kawukiti kugenda kunja, na kalila nentu.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuhigilwa na kukomwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Matayu 26:67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Mariku 14:65</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Wantu walii waweriti wankumlolera Yesu, wamkomiti na kumhigira. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Wamtawiti shitambala kusheni, na wankumkosiya, “Gutungi! Gani yakakukomiti?” <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Wamlavilira visoweru vivuwa vya kumwigilanga.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wamtula kulongolu mushiyotera motu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:59-68">Matayu 26:59-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mariku 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Yohani 18:19-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Lishaka lyalifatiti Yesu wamjegiti mushiyotera motu . Pashiyotera motu kuweriti na wazewi na watambika wakulu na wafunda wa malagaliru, womberi waliwoniti pamuhera na Yesu wamjegiti kulongolu kwawu. <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />Nawomberi wamgambira, “Gutugambiri! Hashi, gwenga gwa Kristu?” Su Yesu kawagambira, “Ata panuwagambira, hapeni munjimiri, <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />handa panuwakosiya hapeni mnankuli. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Kwanjira vinu, Mwana gwa Muntu hakalivagi uwega wa kumliwu wa Mlungu kana makakala goseri.”<verse eid="LUK 22:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Woseri walonga, “Ndo kulonga gwenga gwa Mwana gwa Mlungu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">Nayomberi kawankula, “Mwenga mtakula handa ndo Neni.”<verse eid="LUK 22:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Nawomberi walonga, “Tufira ndiri kayi ukapitawu umonga? Twaweni tupikanira shilii shakatakuliti.”<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s">Yesu wamjega pashiyotera motu sha Pilatu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matayu 27:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mariku 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yohani 18:28-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Shipinga shoseri wagolokiti, wamjega Yesu kulongolu kwa Pilatu, <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Wanja kumsitaki, pawalonga, “Tumwoniti muntu ayu kankuwasongiziya wantu wetu, na kuwaberiziya wantu kumupanana kodi Kayisari, pakawagambira Kristu mweni ndo, mfalumi.”<verse eid="LUK 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Pilatu kamkosiyiti yomberi, “Hashi, gwenga ndo Mfalme gwa Wayawudi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">Yesu kamuwankula, “Gwenga gulonga.”<verse eid="LUK 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Pilatu kawagambira watambika wakulu wa numba ya Mlungu na lipinga lya wantu, “Mona likosa ndiri lyoseri kwa muntu ayu.”<verse eid="LUK 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Kumbiti womberi wanjiti kulonga kankuwazongiziya, “Kwa mafundu gakuwi kanjiti kutenda ndewu pakati pa wantu woseri mu Yudeya. Kanjiti mu Galilaya na vinu kiza panu.”<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wamjega kwa Herodi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Pilatu pakapakiniriti aga, kakosiya, “Hashi, muntu ayu ka mwenikaya gwa Galilaya?” <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Pakavimaniti handa Yesu kalawiti lushi lwalukolitwimlima na Herodi, su kamjegiti kwa Herodi, ndo mweni yakaweriti mu Yerusalemu shaka shilii. <verse eid="LUK 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Herodi kanemeleriti nentu pakamwoniti Yesu, toziya kapikaniriti kala visoweru vyakuwi, su kaweriti kankuhepera kumwona yomberi kwa shaka shivuwa. Kaweriti kankutumbira kawoni Yesu pakatenda mauzauza. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Su Herodi kamkosiyiti Yesu makosiwu gavuwa, kumbiti Yesu kamwankula ndiri. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Mtambika mkulu gwa numba ya Mlungu na wafunda wa Malagaliru walawiriti pawulongoru, walaviyiti masitaka gawu kwa makakala nentu. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Herodi pamuhera na wanjagila wakuwi, wamuwanganiti Yesu na kumtendera lidufiya, shakapanu wamvalisiya nguwu ya shifalumi, na wamuwuziya kwa Pilatu. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Kwanjira lishaka lilii, Herodi na Pilatu wawera waganja, pamberi pa shaka shilii waweriti wangondu.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wamutoza kuhowa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Matayu 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mariku 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yohani 18:39-19:16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Su Pilatu kawashemiti pamuhera, watambika wakulu wa numba ya Mlungu, na walongoziya wantu <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />kawagambira, “Mumjega muntu ayu kwaneni pamlonga kaweriti kawasongiziya wantu wawulemi ufalumi wa Rumi. Vinu mpikiniri! Pandoliti kala weri shitwatila ashi pawulongolu penu, mona ndiri likosa lyoseri kwa masitaka genu kwakuwi. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Wala Herodi kawoniti ndiri likosa, su kamuwuziyiti kwa twenga. Kwahera likosa lya kumtenda muntu ayu kahowi. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Su hanuwalongeri wamsyatangi ntomondu, hanumleki kagendi zakuwi.” <verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />Kila Mumsambu gwa Pasaka Pilatu kamlekiziyaga mtatilwa yumu pakati pawu.<verse eid="LUK 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Lipinga lyoseri wabotanga pawalonga, “Gumlagi ayu! Gutuvuguliri Baraba!” <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />Baraba wamtuliti mushibetubetu toziya ya kutenda ngondu mlushi lulii, viraa kalagiti wantu.<verse eid="LUK 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Pilatu kafiriti kumlekeziya Yesu, su katakula kayi nawomberi. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Kumbiti womberi watenditi umatu, “Gumkong'onderi misumali mulupingika! Gumkong'onderi misumali mulupingika!”<verse eid="LUK 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Pilatu kawagambira mala ya tatu, “Ashi katenda shidoda gaa? Mona ndiri likosa kwakuwi limtendi yomberi wamlagi, su hanumsyatangi viboku, su hanumlekeziyi.”<verse eid="LUK 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Kumbiti womberi wendereyiti kutenda umatu kwa kubotanga kuwera Yesu mpaka kakong'onderwi misumali palupingika, na upeleru wawu wa kutenda umatu ukanga. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Su Pilatu kaamuwiti ntambu yawafira womberi gatendeki. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Kamvugulira kulawa mushibetubetu muntu ulii yawamfiriti, ndomweni yawamtuliti mushibetubetu toziya ya ngondu yakuwi na kulaga wantu, su kamlaviyiti Yesu kwa womberi wamtenderi ntambu yawafira.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wankumkong'ondera misumali mulupingika</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matayu 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mariku 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yohani 19:17-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Pawaweriti wankumjega, waliwoniti na muntu yumu yawamshema Simoni gwa Kureni, kaweriti kankulawa muisi na kwingira mlushi. Su wambata, wamtwika lupingika lulii kalutoli kumbeli kwa Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Lipinga likulu lya wantu limfatiti, mngati mwawu waweriti wadala wankudaya na kumlilira. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Yesu kawagalambukira, kawagambira, “Mwenga washina mawu wa Yerusalemu! Namundilira neni, kumbiti mulililiri maweni na wana wenu. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Toziya mashaka gankwiza, wantu hawalongi, ‘Mbaka kwa walii wagumba, yawaleriti ndiri ama kunonisiya wana!’ <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Hashiweri shaka wantu pawayigambira migongu, ‘Gutuguwiri!’ Na kuvigambira vigongu, ‘Gutugubiki!’ <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Kwa mana, handa wantu wankugutendera mtera muwisi ntambu ayi, hayiweri hashi kwa mtera guyuma?”<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Wawatoliti viraa wantu wamonga wawili, wadoda wawalagi pamuhera na Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Pawasokiti kala pahala pawapashema, “Shipalakasa sha mtuhi,” Yesu ndo wamkong'onderiti misumali palupingika pamuhera na walii wadoda wawili, yumu uwega wakuwi wa kumliwu na yumonga uwega gwakuwi gwa kumshigi. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Yesu kalonga, “Tati guwalekeziyi toziya wavimana ndiri vyawatenda.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:34">Shakapanu wagawana nguwu zyakuwi kwa kugalambula simbi. <verse eid="LUK 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Wantu wawagolokiti palii pawamlola. Na walongoziya wamtendera lidufiya pawalonga, “Kawalopoziya wamonga, vinu kalilopoziyi mweni, handa mweni ndo Kristu, msyagula gwa Mlungu!”<verse eid="LUK 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Wanjagira wamtenderiti vira lidufiya, wamgenderiti wamupa icheshema <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />pawalonga, “Handa nakaka gwenga ndo Mfalumi gwa Wayawudi, gulilopoziyi gumweni.”<verse eid="LUK 23:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Vira vilii malembu aga wagatula kumpindi kwakuwi, “Ayu ndo Mfalumi gwa Wayawudi.”<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Yumu gwa walii wadoda yawampingikiti palupinjika, kamwigilanga Yesu pakalonga, “Hashi, yanakaka ndiri gwenga ndo Kristu? Su gulilopoziyi gumweni, gutulopoziyi na twenga viraa.”<verse eid="LUK 23:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Kumbiti mdoda gwingi ulii kamkalipira muyaguwi pakalonga, “Gwenga gumtira ndiri Mlungu ata kidogu? Gwenga gupata azabu iraa ayi. <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Gwenga na neni tustahili, mana aga ndo malipu ya galii gatutenditi. Kumbiti muntu ayu katenda ndiri shidoda shoseri.” <verse eid="LUK 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Shakapanu kalonga, “Gwenga Yesu! Gunholi shaka pagwingira muufalumi waku.”<verse eid="LUK 23:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yesu kamwankula, Nukugambira nakaka, lelu haguweri pamuhera na neni muparadisu.<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhowa kwa Yesu mulupingika</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matayu 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mariku 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yohani 19:28-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Iweriti yapata saa sita paliwala, mshenji guleka kuwala, luwindu lugubikiti muisi yoseri mpaka saa tisa, <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />lipaziya lya numba nkulu ya Mlungu lipantika vipandi viwili. <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Yesu kalila kwa liziwu likulu, Tati, mumawoku gaku nuyitula rohu yangu. Pakalongiti hangu kahowa.<verse eid="LUK 23:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Paliya, mkulu gwa wanjagila pakawoniti kala galii gatendikiti kamkwisa Mlungu pakalonga, “Nakaka ayu kaweriti muntu muheri.”<verse eid="LUK 23:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Wantu woseri walii waweriti wajojinika toziya ya shitwatila ashi, pawawoniti galii gatendikiti, wawuyiti ukaya kwawu pawahinginitiki. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Waganja wakuwi pamuhera na wadala walii wamfatiti kulawa Galilaya, wagolokiti kwa kutali kulola shitwatila shiliya.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wankumsira</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matayu 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mariku 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yohani 19:38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50" />Kuweriti na muntu yumu litawu lyakuwi Yosefu, mwenikaya gwa shijiji shimu sha Wayawudi shawashishema Arimatayu. Kaweriti muntu muheri yakapananwa ligoya. <verse eid="LUK 23:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51" />Yomberi kaweriti kankulolera kwiza kwa ufalumi wa Mlungu. Tembera kaweriti mjumbi gwa shyoteramotu shikulu sha Wayawudi, kajimiliti ndiri nawomberi majimiranu na matendu gawu. <verse eid="LUK 23:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Yomberi kagenditi kwa Pilatu, kaluwa kamupananiti nshimba ya Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Su kasulusiya nshimba ilii kulawa mulupingika, kayizyengititi sanda ya shitani, kayitula mulipumba lyaliweriti walisongola mulitalawu, lyeni alyenitenderwi. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Lishaka lilii liweriti Ijumaa, na matandiru ga lishaka lya kwoyera liweriti lyankuyanja. <verse eid="LUK 23:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Wadala walii waweriti wafatana na Yesu kulawa Galilaya wamfatiti Yosefu, waliwona lipumba lilii ntambu yawatula nshimba yakuwi. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Shakapanu wawuyiti ukaya, watanditiri uturi na malashi ga kuswaga nshimba ya Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:56">Lishaka lya kwoyera woyeriti gambira malagaliru gagalagaliti.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s">Kuzyuka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Matayu 28:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mariku 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yohani 20:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Jumapili mandawira pee, wadala walii wagenditi kulipumba pawatola na utuli ulii yawaunyawiti. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Wawoniti libuwi lilii libilingisiwa pampenku pa lipumba. <figure style="fig" file="16 Tomb.jpg" size="col" ref="24:2">Libuwi libilingisiwa pampeku pa lipumba</figure> <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />Pawingiriti mngati, wawoniti ndiri nshimba ya Mtuwa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Wagolokiti palii na waweriti wankulishera kwajili shisoweru shilii, kamukamu hera wantu wawili wazivaliti nguwu zing'ereng'eta neru mbuu wagolokiti pakwegera na womberi. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Wadala walii wingiritwi na lyoga, wasuntama. Su wantu walii wawagambira, “Iwera ashi mwankumsakula mkomu pakati pa wahowiti? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Ka panu ndiri, kazyuka kala! Mliholi galii gakawagambirani pakaweriti kulii Galilaya, <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />‘Mwana gwa Muntu mpaka wamlaviyi kwa wantu wanavidoda, nayomberi hawamkong'onderi misumali mulupingika na lishaka lya tatu hakazyuki kwanjira pakahowiti’ ”<verse eid="LUK 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Wadala walii waliholiti vyakatakuliti Yesu, <verse eid="LUK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />walawiti mulipumba, na watakuliti vintu avi vyoseri kwa wantumintumi walii lilongu na yumu na wamonga wawaweriti paliya. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Hashina Mariya Magidalena na Yoana na Maliya mawu gwa Yakobu, pamuhera na wadala wamonga wawagenditi nawomberi ndo watakuliti vintu vilii kwa wantumintumi. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Kumbiti wantumintumi pawapikaniriti ntambu yawatakuliti wadala walii wahera mana, su wawajimilira ndiri. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Su Peteru kalawiti na kagenda pakatuga mpaka kulipumba, kasuntama na kawoniti sanda hera. Kawuyiti ukaya pakawera kankulihola kwajili ya galii yagalawiriti.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwanja kugenda Emau</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Mariku 16:12-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Lishaka lilalirii, wantu wawili mngati mwa wantu yawamfata Yesu waweriti wankugenda mushijiji shawashishemiti Emawu, utali wa kilumita lilongu na yimu kulawa Yerusalemu, <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />na waweriti wankuyowera kwajili ya goseri galii yagalawiriti. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Pawaweriti wankuyowera na kuligambiziyana, Yesu mweni kalawira na kugenda pamuhera nawomberi. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Wamwoniti kwa masu, kumbiti wamumana ndiri. <verse eid="LUK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Yesu kawakosiya, “Mwankuyowera shishi pamgendagenda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:17">Womberi wagoloka jii, sheni zyawu zihinginikiti. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Muntu yumu pakati pawu, yawamshema Kileopa, kamkosiya, “Hashi gwenga gwa muhenga gweka yaku Kuyerusalemu yaguvimana ndiri vitwatira yavirawiriti kulii mashaka aga?”<verse eid="LUK 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Yesu kawakosiya, “Vitwatila gaa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">Womberi wamwankula, “Vitwatira vyavimpatiti Yesu gwa Nazareti. Muntu ayu kaweriti mbuyi gwa Mlungu kana uwezu kulongolu kwa Mlungu na kulongolu kwa wantu, mukila shintu shakatakuliti na kutenda. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Watambika wakulu na wakolamlima wetu wamlaviya wamtozi kuhowa, na wampingikiti palupinjika. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Na twenga tulitumbira handa mweni ndo kaweri yumu yakagenda kuikombola Israeli! Gamonga ga aga goseri, leru ndo lishaka lya tatu kwanjira vitwatira avi pavirawiriti. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Wadala wamu mushipinga shetu watusintuziya, pawagenditi kulipumba mandawira pee, <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />su wayiwoniti ndiri nshimba yakuwi. Wawuyiti pawalonga handa walawiritwi na wantumintumi wa kumpindi, pawawagambiriti handa kaweriti mkomu. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Wamonga mushipinga mwetu wagenditi kulipumba, wawona galii gawatakuliti wadala walii, su mweni wamwona ndiri.”<verse eid="LUK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Shakapanu Yesu kawagambira, “Iwera hashi mwa wazigizigi shiyasi ashi na myoyu yenu ikamala nentu kugajimira goseri galii gatakulitwi na wambuyi wa Mlungu! <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Hashi, ifiruwa ndiri Kristu kukong'onderwa misumali mulupingika, shakapanu kingiri muukwisa wakuwi?” <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Na Yesu Kawagambira vitwatira vyoseri vya vimuwusu mweni Mumalembu Mananagala mushintola sha Musa na shawalembiti wambuyi woseri wa Mlungu.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Pawaweriti pakwegera na shijiji shawashigenderiti, Yesu katenda gambira kankwendereya na mwanja, <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />kumbiti womberi wamluwiti pawalonga, “Gwikali pamuhera na twenga, mana kwinala, na pashiru pankwingira.” Su kingira na kulikala pamuhera nawomberi. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Pakalivagiti kuliya shiboga pamuhera na womberi, katola libumunda na kulitekelera, shakapanu kalimega na kuwapanana. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Masu gawu gavugukiti na wammana, kumbiti kawukiti pamasu pawu. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Su waligambirana weni, “Hashi myoyu yetu iweriti iyaka ndiri shaka pakaweriti kankututakulira Malembu Mananagala munjira kulii?”<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Wawuka shaka shilaa shilii na wawuyiti Yerusalemu, wawoniti wantumintumi walii lilongu na yumu na walii wamonga waweriti pamuhera pawalijojinira <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />na walonga, “Nakaka Mtuwa kazyuka! Kamlawira Simoni!”<verse eid="LUK 24:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Su wantumini wawili wawagambira ntambu yagawapatiti munjira, na ntambu yawammaniti pakamega libumunda.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankuwalawira wantumini wakuwi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matayu 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mariku 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohani 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 1:6-8">Matayu 1:6-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Wantu awili pawaweriti wankuwagambira aga, palaa paliya Yesu mweni kagoloka pakati pawu na kawagambira, “Ponga iweri na mwenga.”<verse eid="LUK 24:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Walilimuka na waweriti na lyoga pawavimana wawona shihoka. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Su Yesu kawagambira, “Iwera ashi mwana lyoga? Iwera ashi myoyu yenu itira? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Mloli mawoku gangu na magulu gangu na mloli neni ndo mweni. Mumbati mundoli na hamvimani, mana shihoka shahera nshimba na mafupa ntambu yamndola.”<verse eid="LUK 24:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Katakuliti aga na kawalanguziyiti mawoku na magulu gakuwi. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Waweriti wankali pawagajimira ndiri, toziya ya manemu gawu na wankali wankulishera, Yesu kawakosiyiti, “Mwanashu shiboga shoseri panu shakuliya?” <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Wamupa shipandi sha somba wa kubanika, <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />kashitoliti na kushiiliya, woseri pawamlola.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Shakapanu kawagambira, “Ayi ndo mana ga visoweru vyanuwagambiriti pamweriti pamuhera na mwenga, kila shintu shawalembiti kwajili ya neni Mulilagaliru lya Musa, na mumalembu gawalembiti wambuyi wa Mlungu, na mushintola sha Zaburi gawera nakaka.”<verse eid="LUK 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Shakapanu kagavugula mahala gawu kugamana Malembu Mananagala, <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />na kawagambira, “Ashi ndo shawalembiti, Kristu mpaka katabiki na mpaka kazyuki kulawa kwa wahowiti lishaka lya tatu kwanjira pakahowiti, <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />nalitawu lyakuwi muujumbi kwajili ya kuleka vidoda vyawatenda mpaka wawubweri kwa isi zoseri, kwanjira Yerusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Mwenga mwa wakapitawu wa vitwatira avi. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Na neni mweni hanuwajegerani ulii mweni Tati yakalagiliti kumjega, su muheperi muisi uganu mpaka pawakupananiti makakala kulawa kumpindi kwakuwi.”<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kankunyasulwa kugenda kumpindi kwa Mlungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matayu 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mariku 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohani 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 1:6-8">Matayu 1:6-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Su Kawalonguziyiti kunja kuisi mpaka Betaniya, kanyasula mawoku gakuwi kumpindi, na kawatekelera. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Pakaweriti kankuwatekelera, kawaleka, kanyasulitwi kugenda kumpindi kwa Mlungu. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Womberi wamguwira, na wawuyiti kugenda Yerusalemu, pawawera na nemeli nkulu, <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />na walikaliti shaka shoseri Mnumba nkulu ya Mlungu pawamkwisa Mlungu.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>